rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "Can\'t target itself because you choose the target before you tap him. At that time he is not yet a legal target."}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "If the creature is no longer tapped when the Assassin\'s ability resolves, then the ability doesn\'t resolve."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "If you have at least one of each of the three Urza\'s lands on the battlefield, you must take the 2 mana instead of just one."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "If you increase the power of the targeted creature after the ability resolves, it still can\'t be blocked that turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "Other effects can prevent a permanent from untapping during an untap step. You do need to look carefully, however, as many effects say that the permanent does not untap during its controller\'s untap step, and this card\'s ability occurs during other players\' untap steps. If a card does say this, then Seedborn Muse can untap it. But some other abilities are not written this way and can still prevent a card from untapping."}, {\'date\': \'2007-07-15\', \'text\': "All your permanents untap during each other player\'s untap step. You have no choice about what untaps."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'A creature that must attack each turn, must only attack once that turn. It is not forced into each attack that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Abilities that trigger when a creature attacks, blocks, or is blocked will trigger during each combat that turn. Thus, a creature with Rampage will get the bonus added during each attack.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "If you manage to cast this during a main phase of your opponent\'s turn, that opponent\'s creatures will untap and that opponent will be able to attack again. It will not allow you to attack during their turn."}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'It only creates an additional combat and main phase if it resolves during a main phase.\'}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'A source of damage is a permanent, a spell on the stack (including one that creates a permanent), or any object referred to by an object on the stack. A source doesn’t need to be capable of dealing damage to be a legal choice.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Can be used even when there is no damage to prevent. It prevents the next damage (if any) from the source this turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Alters all occurrences of the chosen word in the text box and the type line of the given card.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Can target a card with no appropriate words on it, or even one with no words at all.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It can be used to change a land’s type from one basic land type to another. For example, Forest can be changed to Island so it produces blue mana. It doesn’t change the name of any permanent.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It can’t change a word to the same word. It must be a different word.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It only changes what is printed on the card (or set on a token when it was created or set by a copy effect). It will not change any effects that are on the permanent.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can’t change proper nouns (i.e. card names) such as “Island Fish Jasconius”.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You choose the words to change on resolution.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Always affects the player and targets one of their opponents.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Each point of damage is dealt separately, so if you are damaged twice by this spell, each time is considered a separate time this source deals damage.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This card’s coin flip has no winner or loser.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because the "search" requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\\\'t have to find the card if you don\\\'t want to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The land does not count toward your one per turn limit because it was put onto the battlefield by an effect.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because the "search" requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\\\'t have to find the card if you don\\\'t want to.\'}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Can be used on a player with less than 2 cards in their library. It will remove 0 or 1 cards if that is all that is available.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It is not a draw effect so it will not cause a player with less than 2 cards in their library to lose.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Since you are putting more than one card in the graveyard at one time, the affected player can choose the order the 2 cards go in.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Can target an already tapped creature if you want.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Creatures are only put into a graveyard for having 0 toughness when state-based actions are checked. If Maro’s toughness goes to 0 during the announcement or resolution of a spell or ability and then goes back up above 0 before the end of that announcement or resolution, it won’t be put into your graveyard when state-based actions are checked.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Damage that is prevented does not count toward the total.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Discarding as a cost to cast a spell will not trigger the ability. Only discarding as an effect will trigger the ability.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If it is discarded, the damage done by it is done by this card due to an ability and not by a spell.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The second ability will trigger even on an optional discard caused by an opponent.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Does not trigger on a card on the battlefield being changed into a creature.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The ability will not trigger on itself entering the battlefield, but it will trigger on any other creature that is put onto the battlefield at the same time.'}, {'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'The life gain is mandatory.'}, {'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'Two Soul Wardens entering the battlefield at the same time will each cause the other’s ability to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Each other player sacrifices a creature for each creature you control that goes to a graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Giving either creature first strike does not affect the ability.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If this leaves the battlefield before its activated ability resolves, it will still deal damage to the targeted creature. On the other hand, if the targeted creature leaves the battlefield before the ability resolves, the ability won’t resolve and no damage will be dealt.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If Howling Mine leaves the battlefield before it resolves, then the last known tap or untap state of the card is used for resolution.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It does not trigger at all if this is tapped at the start of the draw step, and it checks this again on resolution.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The additional draw is separate from any other draw during your draw step. It happens when the triggered ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The triggered ability is put onto the stack after you have already drawn your card for the turn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'If a creature has more than one creature type, and one of those types matches the creature you are calculating for, then count that creature. Only one type needs to match in order to get counted.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'If you have a creature with more than one creature type, count all creatures which have either creature type.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Sharing multiple creature types doesn\'t give an additional bonus. Coat of Arms counts creatures, not creature types."}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If a player controls no creatures when this resolves, their life total will become zero and they will lose the game.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This spell causes the player to lose or gain enough life to change to the new life total.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If a spell or ability causes more than one card to be drawn, draw the cards one at a time and deal with this replacement before drawing the next card.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If someone pays the cost, then the card was never drawn or discarded. It just gets put into the graveyard directly from the library.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This is a continuous replacement effect that modifies a draw.'}, {'date': '2006-04-01', 'text': 'When using Dredge with this, you have two choices. You can immediately replace the draw with Dredge, or you can apply Zur’s Weirding’s replacement. If the latter, you first resolve Zur’s Weirding’s ability, then if you’re going to draw the card, decide whether or not to replace that draw with Dredge.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If a spell or ability damages multiple things, divide up the damage before applying this effect. This means you can’t normally end up with an odd amount of damage on something.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If you have two of these on the battlefield, the damage is multiplied by 4.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The multiplied damage counts in all ways as if it came from the original source. Furnace of Rath is not the source.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The trample rules cause damage to be divided before it is doubled.'}, {'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'If multiple effects modify how damage will be dealt, the player who would be dealt damage or the controller of the creature that would be dealt damage chooses the order to apply the effects. For example, Mending Hands says, “Prevent the next 4 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.” Suppose a spell would deal 5 damage to a player who has cast Mending Hands targeting themselves. That player can either (a) prevent 4 damage first and then let Furnace of Rath double the remaining 1 damage, taking 2 damage, or (b) double the damage to 10 and then prevent 4 damage, taking 6 damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If it attacks more than once per turn, it gets the bonus each time.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If multiple cards are drawn at once, this card triggers once for each card drawn.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'In a multi-player game, it affects all opponents.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a spell or ability causes you to put cards into your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” it’s not a card drawn.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If the Rukh Egg card is removed from the graveyard in the same turn it is put there, a Bird will still be put onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'If the Egg is destroyed while under the control of another player, the controller of the Egg gets the Bird.'}, {'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'If the Egg is exiled instead of being put into the graveyard, no Bird is put onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'Text-changing effects can be used to change the color of the Bird that will be put onto the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If the player has less than 3 cards, all of them are revealed.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If there are no creatures in the player’s library, then the target creature is still destroyed, you see all the cards in that player’s library, and then they shuffle and continue play.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A “creature card” is any card with the type creature, even if it has other types such as artifact, enchantment, or land. Older cards of type summon are also creature cards.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the targeted creature is an illegal target by the time Polymorph would resolve, the entire spell doesn’t resolve. Nothing else happens.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If there are no creature cards in the player’s library, all the cards in that library are revealed, then the library is shuffled. (The targeted creature remains destroyed.)'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If the targeted creature has indestructible, it’s still a legal target — it just isn’t destroyed. The rest of Polymorph’s effect happens as normal.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If you are damaged by more than one, the effects are cumulative and you skip multiple combat phases.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If you have more than one of these, each effect triggers separately.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You do your normal draw before this ability is put on the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If you life total was above 5 at end of turn, then you lose life to make your total 5. If it was less than 5, you gain life to bring it to 5.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It sets your life total at the beginning of the end step of every player’s turn, not just your own.'}, {'date': '2014-02-01', 'text': 'Unless some effect explicitly says otherwise, a creature that can’t attack you can still attack a planeswalker you control.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If you target yourself, this spell has no useful effect. It will not cause an infinite loop since a replacement effect can’t modify the same event more than once. This effect will not modify the draw that it has you perform.'}, {'date': '2007-07-15', 'text': 'If you and your opponent each cast Plagiarize on each other during the same turn, the two spells effectively cancel each other out. You will draw cards when you normally would and so will your opponent.'}, {'date': '2007-07-15', 'text': 'If you target a player whose library is empty, any effect or turn-based action that would cause that player to draw a card will cause you to draw a card instead. It doesn’t matter that the other player would be unable to draw.'}, {'date': '2007-07-15', 'text': 'You draw the card from your library as normal, not from your opponent’s library.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It affects Elves controlled by all players, not just yours.'}, {'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'This card is now an Elf but has been reworded so that it does not give itself the bonus.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It can only make itself into a creature during combat phases and therefore it is difficult to get Auras placed on it.'}, {'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'A delayed triggered ability that refers to Jade Statue still affects it even if it’s no longer a creature. For example, if Jade Statue blocks the Kashi-Tribe Warriors (“Whenever Kashi-Tribe Warriors deals combat damage to a creature, tap that creature and it doesn’t untap during its controller’s next untap step.”), the Warriors’ effect stops Jade Statue from untapping.'}, {'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'If Jade Statue’s ability has been activated, abilities that trigger “at end of combat” will see Jade Statue as an artifact creature.'}, {'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'A noncreature permanent that turns into a creature can attack, and its {T} abilities can be activated, only if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn. It doesn’t matter how long the permanent has been a creature.'}, {'date': '2013-09-20', 'text': 'If Jade Statue is animated by some other effect, you get an artifact creature with whatever power, toughness, and creature types (if any) are specified by that effect. If you subsequently use Jade Statue’s ability during combat, it will become 3/6 and gain the creature type Golem in addition to those creature types until end of combat.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It is returned to its owner’s hand at the end of any turn in which it is on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It only affects damage dealt by the source one time. If the source damages you a second time this turn, the damage will not be reversed.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'It only produces one mana even if the land can produce more than one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The ability can be activated if the opponent has no lands that produce mana, but the effect will not be able to generate any mana.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "This works even if the opponent\'s lands are tapped. It only checks what kinds of mana can be produced, not if the abilities that produce them are usable right now."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'Fellwar Stone checks the effects of all mana-producing abilities of lands your opponents control, but it doesn\\\'t check their costs. For example, Vivid Crag has the ability "{T}, Remove a charge counter from Vivid Crag: Add one mana of any color." If an opponent controls Vivid Crag and you control Fellwar Stone, you can tap Fellwar Stone for any color of mana. It doesn\\\'t matter whether Vivid Crag has a charge counter on it, and it doesn\\\'t matter whether it\\\'s untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Fellwar Stone doesn\'t care about any restrictions or riders your opponents\' lands (such as Ancient Ziggurat or Hall of the Bandit Lord) put on the mana they produce. It just cares about colors of mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "The colors of mana are white, blue, black, red, and green. Fellwar Stone can\'t be tapped for colorless mana, even if a land an opponent controls could produce colorless mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "When determining what colors of mana your opponents\' lands could produce, take into account any applicable replacement effects that would apply to those lands\' mana abilities (such as Contamination\'s effect, for example). If there is more than one, consider them in any possible order."}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It reduces your life total to 1, not the damage to 1.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Worship does not prevent damage. It causes some damage to be unable to lower your life total. So any damage rendered useless by Worship was still dealt and is counted by effects that track the amount of damage done to a player. In addition, Worship does not prevent loss of life, so loss of life bypasses Worship.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Regenerating artifacts can regenerate from this.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The additional cost can be reduced by effects that reduce costs, such as Sapphire Medallion.\'}, {\'date\': \'2006-05-01\', \'text\': "In Two-Headed Giant, spells don\'t cost extra on your own turn."}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The color is chosen on resolution.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The creature being brought back is chosen on announcement and not on resolution of the spell because it is targeted.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You must show the card you bring out of the graveyard to your opponent.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The creatures and lands are only prevented from untapping during the targeted player’s next untap step. They can still can untap during other player’s untap steps.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'No creatures or lands controlled by the player will untap during their next untap step. This includes those which entered the battlefield after Exhaustion resolved.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The land is untapped as a normal ability that goes on the stack. It is not a mana ability, so it can’t be used at times that only mana abilities can be used.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The player can put the cards in their graveyard in any order they choose.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The sacrificing of an artifact is not mandatory. You can choose not to sacrifice an artifact but will pay the consequences.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The “if you do” part is only done if you successfully sacrifice this card. In other words, it has to be on the battlefield when the trigger resolves or it does not deal damage.'}, {'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'If Booby Trap’s last ability is countered, Booby Trap remains on the battlefield (and no damage is dealt).'}, {'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'If a single Booby Trap’s ability triggers multiple times, then only the first ability to resolve causes Booby Trap to be sacrificed and damage to be dealt.'}, {'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'If an effect causes the player to draw multiple cards, each card is revealed as it’s drawn. If Booby Trap’s ability triggers, it will go on the stack once the card-drawing effect has concluded.'}, {'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'The choice of which card to name is part of the resolution of the spell or ability which puts Booby Trap onto the battlefield. It can’t be countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This card’s ability does not override effects which prevent a permanent from untapping.'}, {'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'If another effect limits the number of permanents that untap, that number combines with Storage Matrix’s effect. For example, Imi Statue says “players can’t untap more than one artifact during their untap steps.” If both Imi Statue and an untapped Storage Matrix are on the battlefield, and you choose “artifact,” only one artifact untaps.'}, {'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'Permanents with multiple types untap if any of their types is chosen. For example, an artifact creature untaps if either artifact or creature is chosen.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This is a triggered mana ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This spell increases the number of lands you can play in a turn. The land cards are played as you would normally play lands.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can cast this if you have less than 2 life, since the life is lost as an effect and not a payment.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can cast this if you have less than 3 life, since the life is lost as an effect and not a payment.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can use it on yourself.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You decide on resolution whether or not to tap or untap the creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You do not take the 3 points of damage if the ability doesn’t resolve because the target is illegal.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You don’t draw a card if this spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'Flowstone Crusher’s ability can be activated multiple times, but Flowstone Crusher is put into the graveyard after an effect resolves that makes its toughness 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'Gift of Estates does nothing if each of your opponents has the same number of lands or fewer as you.'}, {'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'You can find nonbasic lands if they have the Plains land type, such as dual lands (Tundra, et al).'}]", "[{'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'Goblin King now has the Goblin creature type and its ability has been reworded to affect *other* Goblins. This means that if two Goblin Kings are on the battlefield, each gives the other a bonus.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'Imaginary Pet’s ability triggers only if you have cards in your hand as your upkeep begins, and the ability checks again as it resolves. If your hand is empty at both those times, Imaginary Pet stays on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'King Cheetah is always a Creature spell, never an instant, regardless of when you cast it.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'Lord of the Undead now has the Zombie creature type and its first ability has been reworded to affect *other* Zombies. This means that if two Lord of the Undead are on the battlefield, each gives the other a bonus.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'Shard Phoenix uses Last Known Information. If, for example, it was blue when it was sacrificed, the damage will come from a blue source.'}, {'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'You can return Shard Phoenix any time during your upkeep; this is not a beginning of upkeep triggered ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-02-01', 'text': 'If this card’s ability is activated by one player, then another player takes control of it on the same turn, the second player can’t activate its ability that turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-05-01', 'text': 'In Two-Headed Giant, triggers only once per upkeep, not once for each player.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Verdant Force’s ability triggers at the beginning of each upkeep, not just each of your upkeeps.'}]", "[{'date': '2007-05-01', 'text': 'Creatures with the Reach ability (such as Giant Spider) don’t actually have Flying, so they can’t block a creature enchanted with this.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2007-05-01\', \'text\': \'Putting the card onto the battlefield is optional. When the ability resolves, you can choose not to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'A "creature card" is any card with the type creature, even if it has other types such as artifact, enchantment, or land. Older cards of type summon are also creature cards.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2007-07-15\', \'text\': "If Sengir Vampire deals nonlethal damage to a creature and then a different effect or damage source causes that creature to be put into a graveyard later in the turn, Sengir Vampire\'s ability will trigger and it will get a +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "Each time a creature is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, check whether Sengir Vampire had dealt any damage to it at any time during that turn. If so, Sengir Vampire\'s ability will trigger. It doesn\'t matter who controlled the creature or whose graveyard it was put into."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If Sengir Vampire and a creature it dealt damage to are both put into a graveyard at the same time, Sengir Vampire\'s ability will trigger, but it will do nothing when it resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2007-07-15\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when Clone enters the battlefield. Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen creature will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2007-07-15\', \'text\': \'If the chosen creature is a token, Clone copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that put it onto the battlefield. Clone is not a token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2007-07-15\', \'text\': \'If the chosen creature is copying something else (for example, if the chosen creature is another Clone), then your Clone enters the battlefield as whatever the chosen creature copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'If the chosen creature has {X} in its mana cost (such as Protean Hydra), X is considered to be zero.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': "Clone copies exactly what was printed on the original creature and nothing more (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on."}, {\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': "If Clone somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as another creature, Clone can\'t become a copy of that creature. You may choose only a creature that\'s already on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': \'You can choose not to copy anything. In that case, Clone enters the battlefield as a 0/0 Shapeshifter creature, and is probably put into the graveyard immediately.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "Clone\'s ability doesn\'t target the chosen creature."}]', "[{'date': '2007-07-15', 'text': 'Warrior’s Honor affects creatures you control that are on the battlefield at the time it resolves. If you put a creature onto the battlefield later in the turn, that creature won’t get the bonus.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'A “creature spell” is any spell with the type Creature, even if it has other types such as Artifact or Enchantment. Older cards of type Summon are also Creature spells.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'If you control 0 swamps, then the Nightmare has 0 toughness and will be put into its owner’s graveyard as a state-based action right before the next player gains priority.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Nightmare’s power and toughness changes as the number of Swamps you control changes.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Nightmare’s ability counts all lands you control with the subtype Swamp, not just ones named Swamp.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'The ability that defines Nightmare’s power and toughness works everywhere, not just on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'Since the activated ability doesn’t have a tap symbol in its cost, you can tap a creature (including Llanowar Behemoth itself) that hasn’t been under your control since your most recent turn began to pay the cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'This card now uses the Reach keyword ability to enable the blocking of flying creatures. This works because a creature with flying can only be blocked by creatures with flying or reach.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'A noncreature permanent that turns into a creature can attack, and its {T} abilities can be activated, only if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn. It doesn’t matter how long the permanent has been a creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'The ability triggers even if the Specter’s damage is being redirected to an opponent. It does not trigger if damage that would have been dealt to the opponent is redirected to a nonopponent player or a creature, or if the damage is prevented.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'You can activate the ability repeatedly during a turn. This generally has no additional effect, unless some other effect (like that from Adarkar Windform has caused it to lose flying since the last time the ability resolved.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'For flying to work as an evasion ability, an attacking Goblin Balloon Brigade’s ability must be activated before the declare blockers step begins. Once Goblin Balloon Brigade has become blocked, giving it flying won’t change that.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A “blocking creature” is one that has been declared as a blocker this combat, or one that was put onto the battlefield blocking this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be a blocking creature through the end of combat step, even if the creature or creatures it was blocking are no longer on the battlefield or have otherwise left combat.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A “creature card” is any card with the type creature, even if it has other types such as artifact, enchantment, or land. Older cards of type summon are also creature cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If a player casts a black spell, Demon’s Horn’s ability triggers and is put on the stack on top of that spell. Demon’s Horn’s ability will resolve (causing you to gain 1 life) before the spell does.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The ability triggers whenever any player, not just you, casts a black spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If a player casts a blue spell, Kraken’s Eye’s ability triggers and is put on the stack on top of that spell. Kraken’s Eye’s ability will resolve (causing you to gain 1 life) before the spell does.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The ability triggers whenever any player, not just you, casts a blue spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If a player casts a green spell, Wurm’s Tooth’s ability triggers and is put on the stack on top of that spell. Wurm’s Tooth’s ability will resolve (causing you to gain 1 life) before the spell does.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The ability triggers whenever any player, not just you, casts a green spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If a player casts a red spell, Dragon’s Claw’s ability triggers and is put on the stack on top of that spell. Dragon’s Claw’s ability will resolve (causing you to gain 1 life) before the spell does.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The ability triggers whenever any player, not just you, casts a red spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If a player casts a white spell, Angel’s Feather’s ability triggers and is put on the stack on top of that spell. Angel’s Feather’s ability will resolve (causing you to gain 1 life) before the spell does.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The ability triggers whenever any player, not just you, casts a white spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If multiple effects modify your hand size, apply them in timestamp order. For example, if you put Null Profusion (an enchantment that says your maximum hand size is two) onto the battlefield and then put Spellbook onto the battlefield, you’ll have no maximum hand size. However, if those permanents entered the battlefield in the opposite order, your maximum hand size would be two.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the targeted permanent or player is an illegal target by the time Consume Spirit would resolve, the entire spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t gain any life.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The amount of life you gain is equal to the number chosen for X, not the amount of damage Consume Spirit deals (in case some of it is prevented).'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The ability affects whichever creature is enchanted by Firebreathing at the time the ability resolves. The bonus remains even if Firebreathing stops enchanting that creature.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'This ability can be activated by Firebreathing’s controller, not the enchanted creature’s controller (in case they’re different players).'}]", "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'An “attacking creature” is one that has been declared as an attacker this combat, or one that was put onto the battlefield attacking this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be an attacking creature through the end of combat step, even if the player it was attacking has left the game, or the planeswalker it was attacking has left combat.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Battle of Wits has an “intervening ‘if’ clause.” This means that if you don’t have 200 or more cards in your library at the beginning of your upkeep, the ability won’t trigger. If the ability does trigger, but you have fewer than 200 cards in your library when the ability resolves, the ability will do nothing.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'In tournaments, you must be able to shuffle your entire deck within a reasonable amount of time.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "This card won\'t be put into your graveyard until after it\'s finished resolving, which means it won\'t be shuffled into your library as part of its own effect."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'Like most lands, each land in this cycle is colorless. The damage dealt to you is dealt by a colorless source.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "The damage dealt to you is part of the second mana ability. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}]', "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'You can sacrifice Nantuko Husk itself to activate its own ability. However, the only thing that will do is put Nantuko Husk into the graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Emperor Crocodile’s ability will trigger if you don’t control another creature, even if it’s only for a brief moment during the resolution of another spell or ability (such as that of Brago, King Eternal).'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'The ability only checks if you control no other creatures at the time it triggers. It does not check again on resolution, so gaining control of a creature before then will not save Emperor Crocodile.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Nothing happens if there are no nonartifact, nonblack creatures on the battlefield when Nekrataal enters the battlefield, but if there is one, you must target it, even if it’s a creature you control.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Hell\'s Caretaker can be the creature sacrificed to activate its ability, but it can\'t be the target of its own ability."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "The upkeep step is before the draw step, after the untap step. Because the turn has already begun, creatures put onto the battlefield during your upkeep won\'t be able to attack or pay a {T} cost this turn."}]', "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If there is only one card in your library, you put it into your hand.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If there is only one card in your library, you put it into your hand.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the spell is an illegal target when Rewind tries to resolve, perhaps because it was countered by another spell or ability, Rewind won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t untap any lands."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Rewind targets only a spell. It doesn\'t target any lands. The lands are chosen as Rewind resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You can choose up to four lands, no matter who controls any of them. Those lands untap once. You can\'t choose one land and have it untap four times, for example."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have three cards in hand when instructed to discard three cards, you discard your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Use the sacrificed creature\'s power as it last existed on the battlefield to determine how many cards you draw."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You draw and discard cards all while Greater Good\'s ability is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If a nonbasic land has an ability that causes it to enter the battlefield tapped, it will lose that ability before it can apply. The same is also true of any other abilities that modify how a land enters the battlefield or apply "as" a land enters the battlefield, such as the first ability of Cavern of Souls.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If a nonbasic land has an ability that triggers "when" it enters the battlefield, it will lose that ability before it can trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Nonbasic lands will lose any other land types and abilities they had. They will gain the land type Mountain and gain the ability "{T}: Add {R}."\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'This effect doesn\\\'t affect names or supertypes. It won\\\'t turn any land into a basic land or remove the legendary supertype from a legendary land, and the lands won\\\'t be named "Mountain."\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "Gaining control of a permanent doesn\'t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "Gaining control of an Aura or Equipment doesn\'t change what it\'s attached to."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "Once a player announces that they\'re casting a spell or activating an ability, no player may take other actions until the spell or ability has been paid for. Notably, other players can\'t try to tap that player\'s permanents to stop them from paying {T} or to stop them from producing enough mana."}]', "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'The triggered ability triggers when the enchanted creature deals any damage, not only combat damage.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Unlike the lifelink ability, the ability of Spirit Link is a triggered ability that goes on the stack and may be responded to. Notably, if the enchanted creature deals damage at the same time you’re dealt enough damage to reduce your life total to 0 or less, you’ll lose the game before you can gain any life.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Abkupfern\', \'text\': \'Falls bis zum Ende des Zuges ein Spieler deiner Wahl eine Karte ziehen würde, übergeht dieser Spieler dieses Kartenziehen stattdessen, und du ziehst eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Denkst du, was ich auch denke?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98656&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cbde756-79e8-495c-a1c2-1fdd297805d3\', \'multiverseId\': 98656}, \'multiverseid\': 98656}, {\'name\': \'Plagiar\', \'text\': \'Hasta el final del turno, si el jugador objetivo fuera a robar una carta, en vez de eso, ese jugador se salta ese robo y tú robas una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Estás pensando lo mismo que yo?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=100096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67a95f5e-119c-4658-9b3d-ae57ce295fb9\', \'multiverseId\': 100096}, \'multiverseid\': 100096}, {\'name\': \'Plagiat\', \'text\': "Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, si le joueur ciblé devait piocher une carte, ce joueur passe cette pioche et vous piochez une carte à la place.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Est-ce que vous pensez à ce que je pense ? »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98296&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad4e09c1-082f-4c27-80a5-eaa40e45369e\', \'multiverseId\': 98296}, \'multiverseid\': 98296}, {\'name\': \'Plagiare\', \'text\': \'Fino alla fine del turno, se il giocatore bersaglio sta per pescare una carta, invece quel giocatore non pesca quella carta e tu peschi una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Stai pensando quello che sto pensando io?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99016&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ee42f5d-23b4-45bf-9475-78e4a9b444e0\', \'multiverseId\': 99016}, \'multiverseid\': 99016}, {\'name\': \'盗用\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、そのプレイヤーがカードを１枚引く場合、代わりにそのプレイヤーはそのドローを飛ばし、あなたがカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'君は私の考えてることを考えてるってわけ？\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57ebc394-0bf3-4c8a-a6bd-ff57ee58c7ac\', \'multiverseId\': 99376}, \'multiverseid\': 99376}, {\'name\': \'Plagiar\', \'text\': \'Até o final do turno, se o jogador alvo fosse comprar um card, em vez disso aquele jogador pula aquela compra e você compra um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Você está pensando o que eu estou pensando?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7edbb06-0ed9-4233-b0ae-8812985a1105\', \'multiverseId\': 99736}, \'multiverseid\': 99736}, {\'name\': \'Плагиат\', \'text\': \'До конца хода, если целевой игрок должен взять карту, вместо него берете карту вы.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'"Ты думаешь то же, что и я?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=110007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15dd8c3b-43c2-4517-87ae-0986ccdb5bcc\', \'multiverseId\': 110007}, \'multiverseid\': 110007}, {\'name\': \'剽窃\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，若目标牌手将抓一张牌，则改为该牌手略过该次抓牌，并且你抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「你想的和我一样？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'073431aa-6b4e-4518-a88d-2c69aad082eb\', \'multiverseId\': 97936}, \'multiverseid\': 97936}]', '[{\'name\': \'Adarkarwüste\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {W} oder {U}. Die Adarkarwüste fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98437&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4a44777-7ca8-4ce8-9b82-ac5336903119\', \'multiverseId\': 98437}, \'multiverseid\': 98437}, {\'name\': \'Yermos de Adarkar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {U} a tu reserva de maná. Los Yermos de Adarkar te hacen 1 punto de daño.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b3add73-45c1-49fd-ba5c-32ae7b9a5eed\', \'multiverseId\': 99877}, \'multiverseid\': 99877}, {\'name\': "Landes d\'Adarkar", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U} à votre réserve. Ces Landes d\'Adarkar vous infligent 1 blessure.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98077&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5aa5203-c26f-42b4-bf01-721edfd33c1f\', \'multiverseId\': 98077}, \'multiverseid\': 98077}, {\'name\': "Distese dell\'Adarkar", \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {U} alla tua riserva di mana. Le Distese dell\'Adarkar ti infliggono 1 danno.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'135b5a6f-fe96-459f-b7a7-d6db5c91d82b\', \'multiverseId\': 98797}, \'multiverseid\': 98797}, {\'name\': \'アダーカー荒原\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{W}か{U}を加える。 アダーカー荒原はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91c33e88-36af-4757-aad2-3aa189a231c2\', \'multiverseId\': 99157}, \'multiverseid\': 99157}, {\'name\': \'Regiões Agrestes de Adarkar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adiciona {1} à sua reserva de mana.\\n{T}: Adiciona {W} ou {U} à sua reserva de mana. Regiões Agrestes de Adarkar causa 1 ponto de dano a você.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4ff61ff-13b9-4738-95dd-9712a11953cf\', \'multiverseId\': 99517}, \'multiverseid\': 99517}, {\'name\': \'Адаркарские пустоши\', \'text\': \'{T}: Добавьте {1} в запас маны.\\n{T}: Добавьте {W} или {U} в запас маны. Пустыни Адаркара наносят вам 1 повреждение.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c22b3d72-9e65-479a-8893-d77d7d09edac\', \'multiverseId\': 109788}, \'multiverseid\': 109788}, {\'name\': \'阿达卡荒野\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{1}到你的法术力池中。\\n{T}：加{W}或{U}到你的法术力池中。 阿达卡荒野对你造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78089ab1-5d2c-450a-91cb-344dbb987fc8\', \'multiverseId\': 97717}, \'multiverseid\': 97717}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aladins Ring\', \'text\': \'{8}, {T}: Aladins Ring fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Ha, Männer Seht, der feine Knabe trägt ja Schmuck ..." —Wüstenräuber, letzte Worte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98439&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f2f903c-1c58-48cd-b42c-ff166f337bbe\', \'multiverseId\': 98439}, \'multiverseid\': 98439}, {\'name\': \'Anillo de Aladino\', \'text\': \'{8}, {T}: El Anillo de Aladino hace 4 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Una lámpara buena iluminará tu camino. Un anillo bueno lo despejará." —Nervan, joyero real\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a8b1267-b184-4cbe-9bff-b4e4770e24fa\', \'multiverseId\': 99879}, \'multiverseid\': 99879}, {\'name\': "Anneau d\'Aladdin", \'text\': "{8}, {T} : L\'Anneau d\'Aladdin inflige 4 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Louke zeuh rinegueu. » —Argot gobelin pour « M\'as-tu vu. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98079&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff6181bb-6f54-43e8-99dd-bc83316e15af\', \'multiverseId\': 98079}, \'multiverseid\': 98079}, {\'name\': \'Anello di Aladino\', \'text\': "{8}, {T}: L\'Anello di Aladino infligge 4 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Una buona lampada illuminerà il tuo cammino. Un buon anello spazzerà via gli ostacoli." —Nervan, gioielliere reale\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d791aac9-4c6c-4868-ac09-43b310cbd9ad\', \'multiverseId\': 98799}, \'multiverseid\': 98799}, {\'name\': \'アラジンの指輪\', \'text\': \'{8}, {T}：クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。アラジンの指輪はそれに４点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'良いランプはあなたの道を照らします。 良い指輪はあなたに道を開きます。 ――王宮宝石商、ナーヴァン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1a2c50f-7617-428c-8aa5-6406b17e7348\', \'multiverseId\': 99159}, \'multiverseid\': 99159}, {\'name\': \'Anel de Aladim\', \'text\': \'{8}, {T}: Anel de Aladim causa 4 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Uma boa lâmpada iluminará teu caminho. Um bom anel o limpará." — Nervan, joalheiro da realeza\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'655756de-afaa-4156-af3d-53aef0db234d\', \'multiverseId\': 99519}, \'multiverseid\': 99519}, {\'name\': \'Кольцо Аладдина\', \'text\': \'{8}, {T}: Кольцо Аладдина наносит 4 повреждения целевому существу или игроку.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'"Хороший факел осветит ваш путь. Хорошее кольцо расчистит его". — Нерван, королевский ювелир\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf57960b-99b9-4f77-be20-ea053d591858\', \'multiverseId\': 109790}, \'multiverseid\': 109790}, {\'name\': \'阿拉丁戒指\', \'text\': \'{8}，{T}：阿拉丁戒指对目标生物或牌手造成4点伤害。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「好灯能为你指路； 好戒指则为你开路。」 ～皇家珠宝匠耐文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97719&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d484001-d0ed-4b4c-8dca-7a3c414bc981\', \'multiverseId\': 97719}, \'multiverseid\': 97719}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alter Silberrücken\', \'text\': \'{G}: Regeneriere den Alten Silberrücken. (Das nächste Mal, dass diese Kreatur in diesem Zug zerstört würde, wird sie nicht zerstört. Tappe sie stattdessen, entferne allen Schaden von ihr und entferne sie aus dem Kampf.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Menschenaffe\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98443&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0efcb3db-8dea-4e4e-b68e-12ce6daecada\', \'multiverseId\': 98443}, \'multiverseid\': 98443}, {\'name\': \'Lomo plateado antiguo\', \'text\': \'{G}: Regenera al Lomo plateado antiguo. (La próxima vez que esta criatura fuera a ser destruida este turno, no lo es. En vez de eso, gírala, remueve todo el daño de ella y remuévela del combate.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Simio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a574a8ca-7f74-43dd-a828-e8fad7ce42d6\', \'multiverseId\': 99883}, \'multiverseid\': 99883}, {\'name\': \'Vieux gorille à dos argenté\', \'text\': "{G} : Régénérez le Vieux gorille à dos argenté. (La prochaine fois que cette créature devrait être détruite ce tour-ci, elle ne l\'est pas. À la place, engagez-la, retirez-lui toutes ses blessures et retirez-la du combat.)", \'type\': \'Créature : grand singe\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98083&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6e40f34-286a-41b7-b050-65591c7b65bd\', \'multiverseId\': 98083}, \'multiverseid\': 98083}, {\'name\': \'Antico Schienargento\', \'text\': "{G}: Rigenera l\'Antico Schienargento. (La prossima volta che questa creatura sta per essere distrutta in questo turno, non viene distrutta. Invece TAPpala, rimuovi tutti i danni da essa e rimuovila dal combattimento.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Scimpanzé\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78be33f9-2a8e-477a-9d7e-c06bf65788ef\', \'multiverseId\': 98803}, \'multiverseid\': 98803}, {\'name\': \'年経たシルバーバック\', \'text\': \'{G}：年経たシルバーバックを再生する。 （このターン、次にこのクリーチャーが破壊される場合、破壊されない。 代わりに、それをタップし、それに与えられているダメージをすべて取り除き、それを戦闘から取り除く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 類人猿\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e6865fe-3ed2-49e3-ae74-c52bad3a8924\', \'multiverseId\': 99163}, \'multiverseid\': 99163}, {\'name\': \'Gorila Ancião de Dorso Prateado\', \'text\': \'{G}: Regenera Gorila Ancião de Dorso Prateado. (Na próxima vez em que esta criatura seria destruída neste turno, ela não o é Em vez disso, vire-a, remova todo o dano dela e remova-a do combate.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Símio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e1010b6-2ca0-4244-af8a-4c0e49d418aa\', \'multiverseId\': 99523}, \'multiverseid\': 99523}, {\'name\': \'Старый вожак горилл\', \'text\': \'{G}: Регенерируйте Старого вожака горилл. (Если в течение этого хода это существо будет уничтожено, оно не отправляется на кладбище. Вместо этого поверните его, снимите с него все повреждения и выведите его из боя).\', \'type\': \'Существо — Обезьяна\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76bd828e-77e2-49f5-aa4e-8e43cdbbf206\', \'multiverseId\': 109794}, \'multiverseid\': 109794}, {\'name\': \'老银背\', \'text\': \'{G}：重生老银背。 （如果此生物下一次于本回合中将被消灭，则它不会被消灭， 而是改为将它横置，移除所受的所有伤害，并将它移出战斗。）\', \'type\': \'生物～猿猴\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97723&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e63a327-3576-4f7d-ac76-af57a5009d34\', \'multiverseId\': 97723}, \'multiverseid\': 97723}]', "[{'name': 'Anaba-Schamane', 'text': '{R}, {T}: Der Anaba-Schamane fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Minotaurus, Schamane', 'flavor': 'Versuch mal, diesen Stier bei den Hörnern zu packen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98440&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3caf31b2-34e1-4566-8514-259a112cceac', 'multiverseId': 98440}, 'multiverseid': 98440}, {'name': 'Chamán de Anaba', 'text': '{R}, {T}: El Chamán de Anaba hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Chamán minotauro', 'flavor': 'Sólo intenta tomar a este toro por los cuernos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99880&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '441219b4-fde3-405a-b69e-77ed1507223a', 'multiverseId': 99880}, 'multiverseid': 99880}, {'name': 'Shaâmane anabaane', 'text': '{R}, {T} : Le Shaâmane anabaane inflige une blessure à une cible, créature ou joueur.', 'type': 'Créature : minotaure et shamane', 'flavor': 'Essayez donc de prendre ce taureau par les cornes.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98080&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b779b023-0f1d-4f3d-8557-4faf3b4c6e13', 'multiverseId': 98080}, 'multiverseid': 98080}, {'name': 'Sciamano di Anaba', 'text': '{R}, {T}: Lo Sciamano di Anaba infligge 1 danno a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.', 'type': 'Creatura — Sciamano Minotauro', 'flavor': 'Prova a prendere questo toro per le corna.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98800&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3192185f-9120-4d4c-a724-92bb35291e5d', 'multiverseId': 98800}, 'multiverseid': 98800}, {'name': 'アナーバのシャーマン', 'text': '{R}, {T}：クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。アナーバのシャーマンはそれに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ミノタウルス・シャーマン', 'flavor': 'こいつを牛耳ってみなよ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99160&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cfb46873-3f49-4dc2-9870-185d5f673b2c', 'multiverseId': 99160}, 'multiverseid': 99160}, {'name': 'Xamã de Anaba', 'text': '{R}, {T}: Xamã de Anaba causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Xamã Minotauro', 'flavor': 'Tente pegar este touro pelos chifres.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99520&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5b658906-72f5-4d48-99ad-6cfbfca995e0', 'multiverseId': 99520}, 'multiverseid': 99520}, {'name': 'Шаман Анаба', 'text': '{R}, {T}: Шаман Анаба наносит 1 повреждение целевому существу или игроку.', 'type': 'Существо — Шаман Минотавр', 'flavor': 'Только попробуйте взять этого быка за рога.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109791&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '43c4226b-6a58-42eb-a9b8-dd6fdab5f951', 'multiverseId': 109791}, 'multiverseid': 109791}, {'name': '阿那巴祭师', 'text': '{R}，{T}：阿那巴祭师对目标生物或牌手造成1点伤害。', 'type': '生物～牛头怪／祭师', 'flavor': '你可以试着抓住这头牛的角来稳住他。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97720&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '931d9971-1a1b-4a0c-8998-189a2d3a34e3', 'multiverseId': 97720}, 'multiverseid': 97720}]", '[{\'name\': \'Anakonda\', \'text\': \'Sumpftarnung (Diese Kreatur ist unblockbar, solange der verteidigende Spieler einen Sumpf kontrolliert.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ophis\', \'flavor\': \'Bist du kleiner als die Anakonda, hält sie dich für Nahrung. Bist du größer als die Anakonda, hält sie dich für eine Menge Nahrung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98441&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15084fd9-dfe1-439b-b589-f22a2331a6a3\', \'multiverseId\': 98441}, \'multiverseid\': 98441}, {\'name\': \'Anaconda\', \'text\': \'Cruza pantanos. (Esta criatura es imbloqueable mientras el jugador defensor controle un pantano.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Víbora\', \'flavor\': \'Si eres más pequeño que la anaconda, te considera comida. Si eres más grande que la anaconda, te considera mucha comida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99881&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc38feec-a2a2-460a-9917-5bb6d290548e\', \'multiverseId\': 99881}, \'multiverseid\': 99881}, {\'name\': \'Anaconda\', \'text\': \'Traversée des marais (Cette créature est imblocable tant que le joueur défenseur contrôle au moins un marais.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : serpent\', \'flavor\': "Si vous êtes plus petit que l\'anaconda, il voit en vous de la nourriture. Si vous êtes plus grand, il voit en vous beaucoup de nourriture.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98081&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fad14a1c-6a6a-49ec-8d89-9859c14c1e49\', \'multiverseId\': 98081}, \'multiverseid\': 98081}, {\'name\': \'Anaconda\', \'text\': \'Passa-paludi (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata fintanto che il giocatore in difesa controlla almeno una Palude.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Serpente\', \'flavor\': "Se sei più piccolo di lei, l\'anaconda ti vede come cibo. Se sei più grande di lei, l\'anaconda ti vede come un mucchio di cibo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cf6df60-240a-457f-8a88-c34cd140abea\', \'multiverseId\': 98801}, \'multiverseid\': 98801}, {\'name\': \'アナコンダ\', \'text\': \'沼渡り （このクリーチャーは防御プレイヤーが沼をコントロールしている限りブロックされない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 蛇\', \'flavor\': \'君がアナコンダより小さければ、あいつは君をエサだと思うよ。 君がアナコンダより大きければ、あいつは君を大量のエサだと思うよ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e207511f-c63a-40b1-b38a-5ac6ee044eec\', \'multiverseId\': 99161}, \'multiverseid\': 99161}, {\'name\': \'Anaconda\', \'text\': \'Travessia de Pântano (Esta criatura não pode ser bloqueada desde que o jogador defensor controle um Pântano.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cobra\', \'flavor\': \'Se você for menor que a anaconda, ela irá considerá-lo comida. Se você for maior que a anaconda, ela irá considerá-lo muita comida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26f6f0f3-cb31-451d-833b-54465205c6e5\', \'multiverseId\': 99521}, \'multiverseid\': 99521}, {\'name\': \'Анаконда\', \'text\': \'Знание болот (Это существо невозможно заблокировать, пока обороняющийся игрок контролирует Болото).\', \'type\': \'Существо — Змея\', \'flavor\': \'Если вы меньше анаконды, она считает вас обедом. Если вы больше анаконды, она считает вас плотным обедом.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c060205c-fd70-4044-a6a0-91cbc42c21f3\', \'multiverseId\': 109792}, \'multiverseid\': 109792}, {\'name\': \'大水蛇\', \'text\': \'沼泽行者（只要防御牌手操控沼泽，此生物便不能被阻挡）\', \'type\': \'生物～蛇\', \'flavor\': \'如果你比大水蛇小，它会把你当成一点食物； 而如果你比大水蛇大，它会把你当成一堆食物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84160707-c2e6-4fbb-b367-df5528701576\', \'multiverseId\': 97721}, \'multiverseid\': 97721}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anarchist\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Anarchist ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Hexereikarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand bringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Die, die nicht folgen wollen, sind zum Anführen verdammt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98442&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e6ccd5b-1727-45ac-8e32-462f556718e4\', \'multiverseId\': 98442}, \'multiverseid\': 98442}, {\'name\': \'Anarquista\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Anarquista entre en juego, puedes regresar la carta objetivo de conjuro de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Aquéllos que no siguen están destinados a guiar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3788b864-a3e8-472a-b93f-6f5278c77fe8\', \'multiverseId\': 99882}, \'multiverseid\': 99882}, {\'name\': \'Anarchiste\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Anarchiste arrive en jeu, vous pouvez renvoyer la carte de rituel ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'Ceux qui ne suivront pas seront condamnés à commander.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98082&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77181f65-40f6-407e-9084-199ab16314b1\', \'multiverseId\': 98082}, \'multiverseid\': 98082}, {\'name\': \'Anarchico\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Anarchico entra in gioco, puoi riprendere in mano una carta stregoneria bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Coloro che non vogliono seguire sono condannati a comandare.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f40d9a5-a7c1-42ca-a579-b45c2eb44eb5\', \'multiverseId\': 98802}, \'multiverseid\': 98802}, {\'name\': \'無政府主義者\', \'text\': \'無政府主義者が場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にあるソーサリー・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをあなたの手札に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'人に従わない者は、人を導く者にならざるを得ない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ddb2214-2a96-4629-901f-17b96ea2c754\', \'multiverseId\': 99162}, \'multiverseid\': 99162}, {\'name\': \'Anarquista\', \'text\': \'Quando Anarquista entra em jogo, você pode devolver o card de feitiço alvo de seu cemitério para a sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Mago Humano\', \'flavor\': \'Aqueles que não seguem estão fadados a comandar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'934023dc-f15b-421d-baa0-d90689d701da\', \'multiverseId\': 99522}, \'multiverseid\': 99522}, {\'name\': \'Анархист\', \'text\': \'Когда Анархист вступает в игру, вы можете вернуть целевую карту волшебства с кладбища в руку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Мудрец\', \'flavor\': \'Тот, кто не желает покориться, обречен на лидерство.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a886e8d0-c4b4-4f6a-aadc-edee31323da8\', \'multiverseId\': 109793}, \'multiverseid\': 109793}, {\'name\': \'无政府主义者\', \'text\': \'当无政府主义者进场时，你可以将目标法术牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'不服领导的人注定倒霉要带头。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7028067b-baca-4760-b1a1-48b9741af4b2\', \'multiverseId\': 97722}, \'multiverseid\': 97722}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anbetung\', \'text\': \'Wenn du eine Kreatur kontrollierst, reduziert aller Schaden, der deine Lebenspunkte auf weniger als 1 reduzieren würde, stattdessen deine Lebenspunkte auf 1.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Glaube an das Ideal, nicht an das Idol." —Serra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98787&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41750176-f51d-4ed6-8e9c-c25ed4a234a0\', \'multiverseId\': 98787}, \'multiverseid\': 98787}, {\'name\': \'Adoración\', \'text\': \'Si controlas una criatura, el daño que fuera a reducir tu total de vida a menos de 1, en vez de eso, lo reduce a 1.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Cree en el ideal, no en el ídolo." —Serra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=100227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1eb80d24-4011-4280-9272-bc2168f2f02f\', \'multiverseId\': 100227}, \'multiverseid\': 100227}, {\'name\': \'Adoration\', \'text\': \'Si vous contrôlez au moins une créature, les blessures qui devraient réduire votre total de points de vie à moins de 1 le réduisent à 1 à la place.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Croyez en l\'idéal, pas en l\'idole. » —Serra", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98427&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da3231ae-7b1a-4901-8f19-2046e2e56e3d\', \'multiverseId\': 98427}, \'multiverseid\': 98427}, {\'name\': \'Adorare\', \'text\': \'Se controlli almeno una creatura, qualsiasi danno che ridurrebbe il totale dei tuoi punti vita a meno di 1 lo riduce invece a 1.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Credi nell\\\'ideale, non nell\\\'idolo." —Serra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0659d5b-6e7e-4728-a03f-e4da955c1759\', \'multiverseId\': 99147}, \'multiverseid\': 99147}, {\'name\': \'崇拝\', \'text\': \'あなたがいずれかのクリーチャーをコントロールしている場合、あなたのライフの合計を１点以下に減少させるダメージは、代わりにあなたのライフの総量が１点になるまで減少させる。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'偶像を信じるんじゃなくて、理想を信じるのよ。 ――セラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47ad9587-117b-4b32-a32e-a70f5eac67c2\', \'multiverseId\': 99507}, \'multiverseid\': 99507}, {\'name\': \'Adoração\', \'text\': \'Se você controlar uma criatura, o dano que reduziria seu total de pontos de vida para menos do que 1, em vez disso, o reduzirá para 1.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Tenha fé no ideal, não no ídolo." — Serra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f92bf876-6fd7-405e-a931-90d8873a66d8\', \'multiverseId\': 99867}, \'multiverseid\': 99867}, {\'name\': \'Поклонение\', \'text\': \'Если вы контролируете существо и вам наносятся повреждения, в результате которых общее число вашей жизни оказывается меньше 1, вместо этого общее число вашей жизни снижается только до 1.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'"Верь в идеалы, а не в идолов". — Серра\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=110138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7112c776-f083-4105-849b-5e4509c5ba88\', \'multiverseId\': 110138}, \'multiverseid\': 110138}, {\'name\': \'崇拜\', \'text\': \'若你操控任何生物，则将使你的生命减少至1以下的伤害，改为减少你的生命至1。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「信仰你的理念，而不是偶像。」 ～撒拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a4e06cd-8665-44ab-ab7f-8b3569d802c2\', \'multiverseId\': 98067}, \'multiverseid\': 98067}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anfeuern\', \'text\': \'Enttappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Sie erhält +2/+4 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Da werden Weiber zu Hyänen Und treiben mit Entsetzen Scherz, Noch zuckend, mit des Panthers Zähnen, Zerreißen sie des Feindes Herz." —Friedrich Schiller, Das Lied von der Glocke\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98584&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6169da64-6126-40ee-aca1-70a9b4870354\', \'multiverseId\': 98584}, \'multiverseid\': 98584}, {\'name\': \'Alentar\', \'text\': \'Endereza la criatura objetivo. Obtiene +2/+4 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"La hora de su redención ha llegado. . . . Únanse a mí. . . . levántense y ataquen. Ataquen en cada oportunidad favorable. Por sus casas y hogares, ¡ataquen" —General Douglas MacArthur, al pueblo de Filipinas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=100024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbaab45c-cd3a-455a-8d0a-1b94d8d249da\', \'multiverseId\': 100024}, \'multiverseid\': 100024}, {\'name\': \'Exhortation\', \'text\': "Dégagez la créature ciblée. Elle gagne +2/+4 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« De même qu\'une cloche ne tinte pas sans être ébranlée, de même l\'homme n\'est pas vertueux sans exhortations. » —Proverbe chinois", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98224&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3cfc1a9-7497-44b5-be68-adf3b4db8797\', \'multiverseId\': 98224}, \'multiverseid\': 98224}, {\'name\': \'Infondere Coraggio\', \'text\': \'STAPpa una creatura bersaglio. Essa prende +2/+4 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"È giunta l\\\'ora della vostra redenzione. . . . Unitevi a me. . . . Alzatevi e colpite. Colpite ad ogni occasione favorevole. Per le vostre case e i vostri focolari, colpite" —Generale Douglas MacArthur alla popolazione delle Filippine\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba684d96-c8fa-42c3-926a-f16d1c3bf59c\', \'multiverseId\': 98944}, \'multiverseid\': 98944}, {\'name\': \'奮起\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをアンタップする。 それはターン終了時まで+2/+4の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'誰かが覆さない限り、世の中のものは覆らない。 ――ジェームズ・A・ガーフィールド\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36e11adb-2bd1-4f38-81cb-58ae7c874e3a\', \'multiverseId\': 99304}, \'multiverseid\': 99304}, {\'name\': \'Encorajar\', \'text\': \'Desvira a criatura alvo. Ela recebe +2/+4 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"A hora de sua redenção é agora. . . . Juntem-se a mim. . . . ergam-se e lutem. Ataquem em todas as oportunidades favoráveis. Por suas casas e famílias, ataquem" — General Douglas MacArthur, ao povo das Filipinas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'445f6083-ee78-4804-9ee5-d4cb9d81de11\', \'multiverseId\': 99664}, \'multiverseid\': 99664}, {\'name\': \'Воодушевление\', \'text\': \'Разверните целевое существо. Оно получает +2/+4 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'"Пришло время платить по счетам . . . Следуйте за мной . . . восстаньте и бейтесь. Бейтесь всегда, когда вам представится такая возможность. Во имя вашего дома и ваших жизней, бейтесь" — Генерал Дуглас Мак Артур, воззвание к филиппинцам\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109935&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40f03a88-87be-469a-ac63-d2ae6cd14a02\', \'multiverseId\': 109935}, \'multiverseid\': 109935}, {\'name\': \'激扬\', \'text\': \'重置目标生物。 它得+2/+4直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「你们的救赎时刻已经来到. . . . 团结在我身边. . . . 挺身出来战斗。 藉每个有利的机会打击敌人。 为了你们的家园与家庭，战斗吧！」 ～道格拉斯‧麦克阿瑟将军， 对菲律宾人民的演说\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'468fb10b-4ca2-4fa9-a476-bd0330f9fae3\', \'multiverseId\': 97864}, \'multiverseid\': 97864}]', '[{\'name\': \'Annektion\', \'text\': \'Landverzauberung (Bestimme ein Land als Ziel, sowie du diese Karte spielst. Diese Karte kommt an das Land angelegt ins Spiel.)\\nDu kontrollierst das verzauberte Land.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Du solltest sehen, wie klein die Landkarte ist.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98447&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92da9385-2379-4a5a-8a03-d0a532e2740a\', \'multiverseId\': 98447}, \'multiverseid\': 98447}, {\'name\': \'Anexar\', \'text\': \'Encantar tierra. (Haz objetivo a una tierra al jugarlo. Esta carta entra en juego anexada a esa tierra.)\\nTú controlas la tierra encantada.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Deberías ver lo pequeño que es el mapa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47b3b2bd-7602-4445-89ae-a13c9434e1b4\', \'multiverseId\': 99887}, \'multiverseid\': 99887}, {\'name\': \'Annexion\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : terrain (Ciblez un terrain au moment où vous jouez cette carte. Cette carte arrive en jeu attachée à ce terrain.)\\nVous contrôlez le terrain enchanté.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "Vous n\'avez pas vu la taille de la carte.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98087&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b13bad62-e4ce-4925-883a-e45c4c158970\', \'multiverseId\': 98087}, \'multiverseid\': 98087}, {\'name\': \'Annessione\', \'text\': \'Incanta terra (Scegli come bersaglio una terra mentre giochi questa magia. Questa carta entra in gioco assegnata a quella terra.)\\nTu controlli la terra incantata.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Dovresti vedere quanto è piccola la mappa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11b3085b-bd55-4761-a7da-064330329d2b\', \'multiverseId\': 98807}, \'multiverseid\': 98807}, {\'name\': \'併合\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（土地） （これをプレイする際に、土地１つを対象とする。 このカードはその土地につけられている状態で場に出る。）\\nあなたはエンチャントされている土地のコントロールを得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'地図なんて物は狭いもんだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2053dae-cf9f-4c31-b847-90b732d46677\', \'multiverseId\': 99167}, \'multiverseid\': 99167}, {\'name\': \'Anexar\', \'text\': \'Encantar terreno (Vise um terreno conforme jogar este card. Este card entra em jogo anexado àquele terreno.)\\nVocê controla o terreno encantado.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Você precisa ver o quão pequeno é o mapa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf568f40-292a-46c3-ac21-a6f6fe17c632\', \'multiverseId\': 99527}, \'multiverseid\': 99527}, {\'name\': \'Приложение\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать землю (Когда вы разыгрываете эту карту, целью является земля. Карта вступает в игру вместе с этой землей).\\nВы контролируете зачарованную землю.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'Помните о том, как мал этот мир.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e5d95d2-c178-4463-8ae3-7e9812dbd0ea\', \'multiverseId\': 109798}, \'multiverseid\': 109798}, {\'name\': \'吞并领土\', \'text\': \'地结界（于使用时指定一个地为目标。 此牌进场时结附在该地上）\\n你操控受此结界的地。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'你该瞧瞧，这地图可真小。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2052b18-b173-416a-8005-d01b33a7fcf1\', \'multiverseId\': 97727}, \'multiverseid\': 97727}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anspruch des Meeres\', \'text\': \'Landverzauberung (Bestimme ein Land als Ziel, sowie du diese Karte spielst. Diese Karte kommt an das Land angelegt ins Spiel.)\\nDas verzauberte Land ist eine Insel.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Bezeichnest du mich immer noch als verrückt?" —Torgle, hochalpiner Bootsbauer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98700&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15a320a1-47cf-438c-92cb-3fa7af391a5a\', \'multiverseId\': 98700}, \'multiverseid\': 98700}, {\'name\': \'Reclamo del mar\', \'text\': \'Encantar tierra. (Haz objetivo a una tierra al jugarlo. Esta carta entra en juego anexada a esa tierra.)\\nLa tierra encantada es una isla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"¿¡Quién es el loco ahora?" —Torgle, montañés constructor de botes\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=100140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b60d7d13-abfb-49e3-bf2c-26f4e32c6d5f\', \'multiverseId\': 100140}, \'multiverseid\': 100140}, {\'name\': \'Revendication par la mer\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : terrain (Ciblez un terrain au moment où vous jouez cette carte. Cette carte arrive en jeu attachée à ce terrain.)\\nLe terrain enchanté est une île.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "« Alors, qui c\'est qui était fou ? » —Torgle, batelier des sommets", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98340&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b5e8a3b-e12b-41b3-8a80-5133f4cbe62c\', \'multiverseId\': 98340}, \'multiverseid\': 98340}, {\'name\': \'Reclamato dal Mare\', \'text\': "Incanta terra (Scegli come bersaglio una terra mentre giochi questa magia. Questa carta entra in gioco assegnata a quella terra.)\\nLa terra incantata è un\'Isola.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"E adesso chi è il pazzo di noi due?" —Torgle, barcaiolo della vetta\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a106671-08af-4199-bac9-316135d304d5\', \'multiverseId\': 99060}, \'multiverseid\': 99060}, {\'name\': \'海の要求\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（土地） （これをプレイする際に、土地１つを対象とする。 このカードはその土地につけられている状態で場に出る。）\\nエンチャントされている土地は島である。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'頭がおかしかったのはどっちの話だ！？ ――山頂の船大工、トーグル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ff25f29-647e-48ff-bd53-c2c80e697a36\', \'multiverseId\': 99420}, \'multiverseid\': 99420}, {\'name\': \'Reivindicação do Mar\', \'text\': \'Encantar terreno (Vise um terreno conforme jogar este card. Este card entra em jogo anexado àquele terreno.)\\nO terreno encantado é uma Ilha.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Quem é o louco agora?" — Torgle, barqueiro do topo da montanha\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7706d03-ce31-4281-986d-88cc0bb1b62c\', \'multiverseId\': 99780}, \'multiverseid\': 99780}, {\'name\': \'Зов моря\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать землю (Когда вы разыгрываете эту карту, целью является земля. Карта вступает в игру вместе с этой землей).\\nЗачарованная земля становится Островом.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'"Ну и кто теперь дурак?" — Торгл, лодочник, живущий на горной вершине.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=110051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8aec93ed-4cb4-4297-9eeb-d33a22df816a\', \'multiverseId\': 110051}, \'multiverseid\': 110051}, {\'name\': \'还诸海疆\', \'text\': \'地结界（于使用时指定一个地为目标。 此牌进场时结附在该地上）\\n受此结界的地是海岛。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「现在你倒说说是谁疯了？」 ～在山顶造船的托茍\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f682bb6a-7df0-469b-a537-9c133e69d500\', \'multiverseId\': 97980}, \'multiverseid\': 97980}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anstürmender Pegasus\', \'text\': \'Fliegend (Diese Kreatur kann nur von fliegenden Kreaturen geblockt werden.)\\nErstschlag (Diese Kreatur fügt Kampfschaden vor Kreaturen ohne Erstschlag zu.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pegasus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98650&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db9e71c5-f13c-4717-828d-c36dcf4b9030\', \'multiverseId\': 98650}, \'multiverseid\': 98650}, {\'name\': \'Pegaso de batalla\', \'text\': \'Vuela. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar.)\\nDaña primero. (Esta criatura hace daño de combate antes que las criaturas sin la habilidad de dañar primero.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pegaso\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=100090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0dc7bd0-4158-42c8-a250-87821dc86756\', \'multiverseId\': 100090}, \'multiverseid\': 100090}, {\'name\': \'Pégase de bataille\', \'text\': "Vol (Cette créature ne peut être bloquée que par des créatures avec le vol.)\\nInitiative (Cette créature inflige des blessures de combat avant les créatures sans l\'initiative.)", \'type\': \'Créature : pégase\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98290&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fc43ca1-409b-4175-b145-9c459340041b\', \'multiverseId\': 98290}, \'multiverseid\': 98290}, {\'name\': \'Pegaso Destriero\', \'text\': \'Volare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature con volare.)\\nAttacco improvviso (Questa creatura infligge il danno da combattimento prima delle creature senza attacco improvviso.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pegaso\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd963d50-97ed-473a-845e-4b62c008fa32\', \'multiverseId\': 99010}, \'multiverseid\': 99010}, {\'name\': \'突撃ペガサス\', \'text\': \'飛行 （このクリーチャーは飛行を持たないクリーチャーによってブロックされない。）\\n先制攻撃 （このクリーチャーは先制攻撃を持たないクリーチャーよりも先に戦闘ダメージを与える。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ペガサス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'340f60ce-3bb4-4175-b553-a1ec0022f4c1\', \'multiverseId\': 99370}, \'multiverseid\': 99370}, {\'name\': \'Pégaso Atacante\', \'text\': \'Voar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com a habilidade de voar.)\\nIniciativa (Esta criatura causa dano de combate antes de criaturas sem a habilidade de iniciativa.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pégaso\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'309df86e-9535-4edc-9ef4-67633ed94e52\', \'multiverseId\': 99730}, \'multiverseid\': 99730}, {\'name\': \'Боевой пегас\', \'text\': \'Полет (Это существо может быть блокировано только существом со способностью полета).\\nПервый удар (Это существо наносит боевые повреждения раньше существ без способности первого удара).\', \'type\': \'Существо — Пегас\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=110001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f3543b2-4571-4c83-b287-1c70e37063e4\', \'multiverseId\': 110001}, \'multiverseid\': 110001}, {\'name\': \'冲锋飞马\', \'text\': \'飞行（只有具飞行异能的生物才能阻挡它。）\\n先攻（此生物会比不具先攻异能的生物提前造成战斗伤害。）\', \'type\': \'生物～飞马\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7439e3c-cf16-4a28-aad0-2f6db086f62d\', \'multiverseId\': 97930}, \'multiverseid\': 97930}]', '[{\'name\': \'Archivar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Setz dich hin und lies. Bereite dich auf die kommenden Konflikte vor." —Mary Harris "Mother" Jones\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98448&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b6b13ce-a551-474f-af84-25a66d0e4749\', \'multiverseId\': 98448}, \'multiverseid\': 98448}, {\'name\': \'Archivero\', \'text\': \'{T}: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Siéntate y lee. Edúcate para los conflictos venideros." —Mary Harris "Madre" Jones\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c4d0bfe-73ee-4c84-919b-fc71802f451a\', \'multiverseId\': 99888}, \'multiverseid\': 99888}, {\'name\': \'Archiviste\', \'text\': \'{T} : Piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« La vie doit être une éducation incessante ; il faut tout apprendre, depuis parler jusqu\'à mourir. » —Gustave Flaubert", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98088&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9391c26-2eb4-4737-bfb5-61fbcf767caa\', \'multiverseId\': 98088}, \'multiverseid\': 98088}, {\'name\': \'Archivista\', \'text\': \'{T}: Pesca una carta\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Siediti e leggi. Istruisciti per i conflitti che verranno." —Mary Harris "Madre" Jones\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98808&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf893c25-311e-4adc-9f3d-bbf566c10922\', \'multiverseId\': 98808}, \'multiverseid\': 98808}, {\'name\': \'文書管理人\', \'text\': \'{T}：カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'座って読みなさい。 来るべき困難のために学びなさい。 ――メアリー・ハリス・"マザー"・ジョーンズ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da99fc73-d311-4fa2-ae94-00d6a788b6e0\', \'multiverseId\': 99168}, \'multiverseid\': 99168}, {\'name\': \'Arquivista\', \'text\': \'{T}: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Mago Humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Sente-se e leia. Eduque-se para os conflitos que estão por vir." — Mary Harris "Mãe" Jones\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9c189db-9c0d-41d2-9f78-adab278b9701\', \'multiverseId\': 99528}, \'multiverseid\': 99528}, {\'name\': \'Архивариус\', \'text\': \'{T}: Возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Мудрец\', \'flavor\': \'"Садись и читай. Готовься к будущим схваткам". —Мэри Харрис Джонс ("Мамаша Джонс")\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'958832d7-a8cc-461c-86c7-18322c12ddd2\', \'multiverseId\': 109799}, \'multiverseid\': 109799}, {\'name\': \'书库辖员\', \'text\': \'{T}：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「坐下来读读书。 把自己教育好，才能克服将来的挑战。」 ～玛莉‧哈里斯「大妈」琼斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9048832-c472-41c8-bd4b-05c09a24f435\', \'multiverseId\': 97728}, \'multiverseid\': 97728}]', '[{\'name\': \'Armbrustträger\', \'text\': \'{T}: Der Armbrustträger fügt einer angreifenden oder blockenden Kreatur deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Er kann über das halbe Schlachtfeld hinweg eine Sumpffliege in zwei Teile zerlegen." —Oneanischer Hauptmann\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98492&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb3b4301-6af1-4a5e-8736-f37d757e747a\', \'multiverseId\': 98492}, \'multiverseid\': 98492}, {\'name\': \'Infantería de ballesta\', \'text\': \'{T}: La Infantería de ballesta hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura atacante o bloqueadora objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Puede partir a una mosca del pantano en dos desde la mitad del campo de tiro." —Sargento oneano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc733ca9-c40e-41aa-90fc-c609153118f9\', \'multiverseId\': 99932}, \'multiverseid\': 99932}, {\'name\': \'Arbalétriers à pied\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ces Arbalétriers à pied infligent 1 blessure à la créature attaquante ou bloqueuse ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Il peut couper en deux une mouche des marais qui traverse le champ de tir. » — Un sergent onéan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98132&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e70f944-8114-46e9-94b5-c65ca3ea1bc5\', \'multiverseId\': 98132}, \'multiverseid\': 98132}, {\'name\': \'Fante Balestriere\', \'text\': \'{T}: Il Fante Balestriere infligge 1 danno a una creatura bersaglio che sta attaccando o bloccando.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Può dividere in due una mosca delle paludi anche alla massima distanza." —Sergente oneano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47b520f8-ccbd-44a6-bba6-33cc4ac853de\', \'multiverseId\': 98852}, \'multiverseid\': 98852}, {\'name\': \'弩弓歩兵\', \'text\': \'{T}：攻撃かブロックに参加しているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。弩弓歩兵はそれに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'あいつは射程の半ばほどにいる沼バエを真っ二つにできるんだ。 ――オネイアンの軍曹\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49e7f886-8900-44df-b2c7-7ec3d2432f02\', \'multiverseId\': 99212}, \'multiverseid\': 99212}, {\'name\': \'Infantaria com Balista\', \'text\': \'{T}: Infantaria com Balista causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura alvo atacante ou bloqueadora.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado Humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Ele é capaz de partir uma mosca ao meio, na metade do alcance." — Sargento de Oneah\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'609345da-79b4-4a55-ac75-92f529331185\', \'multiverseId\': 99572}, \'multiverseid\': 99572}, {\'name\': \'Арбалетчики\', \'text\': \'{T}: Арбалетчики наносят 1 повреждение целевому нападающему или блокирующему существу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'"Он болотную муху может рассечь пополам". — Онейский сержант\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00426ff1-9f33-4e88-9aa9-f6714372f5f0\', \'multiverseId\': 109843}, \'multiverseid\': 109843}, {\'name\': \'十字弓步兵\', \'text\': \'{T}：十字弓步兵对目标进行攻击或阻挡的生物造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「他的箭能在半路顺势将苍蝇劈成两半。」 ～欧尼亚士官\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7325ad56-9e3b-40fa-8abf-d9325d983716\', \'multiverseId\': 97772}, \'multiverseid\': 97772}]', "[{'name': 'Auferstehung der Toten', 'text': 'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Was durch Magie befehligt wird, kann die Erde nicht festhalten.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98668&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '08fc1f97-0f23-4cc6-afdf-297ebb843763', 'multiverseId': 98668}, 'multiverseid': 98668}, {'name': 'Alzar a los muertos', 'text': 'Regresa la carta objetivo de criatura de tu cementerio a tu mano.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'La tierra no puede contener aquello que la magia rige.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=100108&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a7f457d4-8dae-40ab-80da-e4ca82436b73', 'multiverseId': 100108}, 'multiverseid': 100108}, {'name': 'Exhumation', 'text': 'Renvoyez une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Terre ne peut garder ce que magie réclame.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98308&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9eebcbbb-df14-4baf-9de8-3275effd0af5', 'multiverseId': 98308}, 'multiverseid': 98308}, {'name': 'Risveglio dei Morti', 'text': 'Riprendi in mano una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': 'La terra non può trattenere ciò che è governato dalla magia.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99028&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '292c5f94-2b25-40ac-b3d6-0f65f39fca53', 'multiverseId': 99028}, 'multiverseid': 99028}, {'name': '死者再生', 'text': 'あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '魔法が求めるものを、大地はとどめ置けない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99388&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '971dda95-6e58-4610-8993-79afe0f4fa29', 'multiverseId': 99388}, 'multiverseid': 99388}, {'name': 'Ressuscitar Morto', 'text': 'Devolve o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': 'A terra não pode reter o que a magia comanda.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99748&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9fad33d0-4e0c-41cb-98e4-23a1c58cda2b', 'multiverseId': 99748}, 'multiverseid': 99748}, {'name': 'Воскрешение', 'text': 'Верните целевое существо с кладбища в руку.', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': 'Земля не может сдержать то, что подчиняется приказам магии.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=110019&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3558fe29-d838-4437-9426-86d07c83ca90', 'multiverseId': 110019}, 'multiverseid': 110019}, {'name': '起死回生', 'text': '将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '泥土无法留存法术驱使之物。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97948&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '92f79d76-c7a3-4b4d-89f0-ddf1118cd749', 'multiverseId': 97948}, 'multiverseid': 97948}]", '[{\'name\': \'Auge des Ur-Golems\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {2}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Das Auge starrt immer noch vorwurfsvoll auf Memnarch, obwohl Jahrtausende vergangen sind, seit er es vom Körper getrennt hat.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98761&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20ef6ee8-2d9f-4648-85a6-58202c2cfd37\', \'multiverseId\': 98761}, \'multiverseid\': 98761}, {\'name\': \'Ojo de ur-gólem\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {2} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Aún mira acusadoramente a Memnarch, aunque han pasado milenios desde que lo separó de su cuerpo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=100201&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0983a8b-03cb-4bda-bdbf-31b2e1e221d1\', \'multiverseId\': 100201}, \'multiverseid\': 100201}, {\'name\': "Œil de l\'Ur-Golem", \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {2} à votre réserve.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Des milliers d\'années après avoir été arraché au visage de l\'Ur-Golem, il porte toujours un regard accusateur sur Memnarch.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98401&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a957bfaf-b77e-4568-a9c0-8ea7acd14c4f\', \'multiverseId\': 98401}, \'multiverseid\': 98401}, {\'name\': "Occhio dell\'Ur-Golem", \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {2} alla tua riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Fissa ancora Memnarch con fare accusatorio, anche se sono passati millenni da quando ha separato l\'occhio dal suo corpo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc6b2cd1-a690-4e21-97d7-5cae49a2042a\', \'multiverseId\': 99121}, \'multiverseid\': 99121}, {\'name\': \'ウル＝ゴーレムの目\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{2}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'その目は、数千年前に身体から引き剥がされて以来、今も責めるような眼差しをメムナークに向けている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bcdbae3-f0e3-4cd0-bd1c-5dc22f7683b1\', \'multiverseId\': 99481}, \'multiverseid\': 99481}, {\'name\': \'Olho do Ur-Golem\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adiciona {2} à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'O olho ainda fita o Memnarca acusadoramente, embora já tenham se passado milênios desde que ele o separou de seu corpo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1a0a961-a558-4afe-98aa-336e5c7ff5e1\', \'multiverseId\': 99841}, \'multiverseid\': 99841}, {\'name\': \'Глаз праголема\', \'text\': \'{T}: Добавьте {2} в запас маны.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Он по-прежнему осуждающе смотрит на Мемнарха, хотя прошла уже тысяча лет с тех пор, как он вырвал этот глаз.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=110112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebe39757-cb75-4d1f-a7dd-01fd9f802fcc\', \'multiverseId\': 110112}, \'multiverseid\': 110112}, {\'name\': \'古魔像之眼\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{2}到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'虽然千年前便已遭蒙纳坷自本体卸下，这眼睛至今依旧瞪视着他。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7a9d325-0a9b-4be9-a39d-e2c358542ace\', \'multiverseId\': 98041}, \'multiverseid\': 98041}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausgenutztes Wissen\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl zeigt drei Karten aus seiner Hand offen vor, und du bestimmst eine davon. Dieser Spieler wirft diese Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Zusätzlich zum wahllosen Töten von Untertanen, Bestrafen von Bediensteten und dem Aufbau einer Armee von Albträumen fand Braids auch noch Zeit für ihr Lieblingshobby: ein klein wenig Erpressung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98461&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'315511a2-7de6-427a-8a3a-4a20dab25aeb\', \'multiverseId\': 98461}, \'multiverseid\': 98461}, {\'name\': \'Chantaje\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo muestra tres cartas de su mano y tú eliges una de ellas. Ese jugador descarta esa carta.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Además de matar campesinos, castigar subordinados y crear un ejército de pesadillas, Trenzas siempre encontraba tiempo para su pasatiempo favorito: la extorsión mezquina.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99901&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a5d9d0b-75ce-4041-9a59-7fc6cc3bb762\', \'multiverseId\': 99901}, \'multiverseid\': 99901}, {\'name\': \'Chantage\', \'text\': "Le joueur ciblé révèle trois cartes de sa main et vous choisissez l\'une d\'elles. Ce joueur se défausse de cette carte.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Elle massacrait les paysans, punissait ses sbires et elle levait une armée cauchemardesque, mais Nattes trouvait encore le temps de s\'adonner à son passe-temps favori : l\'extorsion.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98101&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'489f2229-d67e-450a-b60e-7a1fc9951b68\', \'multiverseId\': 98101}, \'multiverseid\': 98101}, {\'name\': \'Ricatto\', \'text\': \'Il giocatore bersaglio rivela tre carte dalla propria mano e tu scegli una di esse. Quel giocatore scarta quella carta.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Oltre a uccidere i contadini, punire i propri subordinati e mettere in piedi un esercito di incubi, Braids trovò anche il tempo per il proprio hobby preferito: le piccole estorsioni.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51d2d805-597c-4b74-b941-7fb9b669d4bc\', \'multiverseId\': 98821}, \'multiverseid\': 98821}, {\'name\': \'脅迫状\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分の手札からカードを３枚公開し、あなたはその中から１枚を選ぶ。 そのプレイヤーはそのカードを捨てる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'農民を殺し、部下を罰し、ナイトメアの軍を編成する他に、ブレイズは自分の趣味の時間を確保していた。ちょっとした強請りだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a57e8b37-a582-4674-b8a6-d39b7066269e\', \'multiverseId\': 99181}, \'multiverseid\': 99181}, {\'name\': \'Chantagear\', \'text\': \'O jogador alvo revela três cards de sua própria mão e você escolhe um deles. Aquele jogador descarta aquele card.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Além de matar camponeses, punir os subordinados, e criar um exército de pesadelos, Braids conseguiu encontrar tempo para seu hobby favorito: extorsão banal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6df0d39e-c4f7-4063-979e-2cf5451ab808\', \'multiverseId\': 99541}, \'multiverseid\': 99541}, {\'name\': \'Шантаж\', \'text\': \'Целевой игрок открывает три карты из руки, и вы выбираете одну из них. Целевой игрок сбрасывает эту карту.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Брейдс убивает крестьян, наказывает подданных, собирает армию кошмаров, и все же каким-то образом она находит время для своего любимого развлечения шантажа.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43e72d38-80f9-4454-8ea7-27b28c117203\', \'multiverseId\': 109812}, \'multiverseid\': 109812}, {\'name\': \'勒索\', \'text\': \'目标牌手从手上展示三张牌并且你从中选择一张。 该牌手弃掉该牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'在杀害乡民，责罚部下，壮大梦魇军队之外，布蕾德总算有时间来从事最爱的嗜好：小额敲诈。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97741&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1dc7b67-2cad-476a-b327-9b8feb40be9a\', \'multiverseId\': 97741}, \'multiverseid\': 97741}]', '[{\'name\': \'Avior-Fischer\', \'text\': \'Fliegend (Diese Kreatur kann nur von fliegenden Kreaturen geblockt werden.)\\nWenn der Avior-Fischer aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Mit denselben Speeren, mit denen sie heute ihr Essen aufspießen, werden sie morgen ihre Häuser verteidigen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98450&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'458421c9-0ff4-40c5-a393-f850a6d69808\', \'multiverseId\': 98450}, \'multiverseid\': 98450}, {\'name\': \'Pescador aven\', \'text\': \'Vuela. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar.)\\nCuando el Pescador aven vaya a un cementerio desde el juego, puedes robar una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado ave\', \'flavor\': \'Las mismas lanzas que usan los aven para atrapar su comida hoy, defenderán sus hogares mañana.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a4cce9a-648b-43ec-b9f1-cfabdd5250fa\', \'multiverseId\': 99890}, \'multiverseid\': 99890}, {\'name\': \'Pêcheur avemain\', \'text\': \'Vol (Cette créature ne peut être bloquée que par des créatures avec le vol.)\\nQuand le Pêcheur avemain est mis dans un cimetière depuis le jeu, vous pouvez piocher une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et soldat\', \'flavor\': "Ils défendront demain leur maison avec cette même lance qui leur sert aujourd\'hui à attraper leur nourriture.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98090&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2482668-9e6d-4262-90a2-2bd398febbb4\', \'multiverseId\': 98090}, \'multiverseid\': 98090}, {\'name\': \'Pescatore Aviano\', \'text\': \'Volare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature con volare.)\\nQuando il Pescatore Aviano viene messo in un cimitero dal gioco, puoi pescare una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'Le stesse lance che catturano oggi il loro cibo difenderanno un domani le loro case.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca4195a0-737a-4b7e-ac2c-ecdff265de50\', \'multiverseId\': 98810}, \'multiverseid\': 98810}, {\'name\': \'エイヴンの魚捕り\', \'text\': \'飛行 （このクリーチャーは飛行を持たないクリーチャーによってブロックされない。）\\nエイヴンの魚捕りが場からいずれかの墓地に置かれたとき、あなたはカードを１枚引いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'エイヴンが食べ物を捕るために使うヤスは、いつでも身を守る武器になるだろう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6615a2f-52b8-4671-aab6-11820637e04b\', \'multiverseId\': 99170}, \'multiverseid\': 99170}, {\'name\': \'Pescador Aviano\', \'text\': \'Voar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com a habilidade de voar.)\\nQuando Pescador Aviano é colocado num cemitério vindo de jogo, você pode comprar um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado Pássaro\', \'flavor\': \'As mesmas lanças que caçam sua comida hoje irão defender suas casas amanhã.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e29a3035-b5dc-49d7-bac2-b200748177f5\', \'multiverseId\': 99530}, \'multiverseid\': 99530}, {\'name\': \'Воздушный рыболов\', \'text\': \'Полет (Это существо может быть блокировано только существом со способностью полета).\\nКогда Воздушный рыболов отправляется на кладбище, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'Те же копья, что сегодня добывают им пищу, завтра будут защищать их дома.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f555f8b5-5fdd-4d54-938d-b66c1b010186\', \'multiverseId\': 109801}, \'multiverseid\': 109801}, {\'name\': \'艾文渔人\', \'text\': \'飞行（只有具飞行异能的生物才能阻挡它。）\\n当艾文渔人从场上置入坟墓场时，你可以抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～鸟／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'手握同支长矛，猎捕今朝食物，保卫明日家园。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7615bf5-25e1-4d2c-99ab-1a75660fce43\', \'multiverseId\': 97730}, \'multiverseid\': 97730}]', '[{\'name\': \'Avior-Lüfteleser\', \'text\': \'Fliegend (Diese Kreatur kann nur von fliegenden Kreaturen geblockt werden.)\\n{1}{U}: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl zeigt die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek offen vor.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Soldat, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Selbst die kleinste Welle erzählt eine lange Geschichte."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98452&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c74322d9-ecf6-4dec-9341-e068710dc61d\', \'multiverseId\': 98452}, \'multiverseid\': 98452}, {\'name\': \'Leevientos aven\', \'text\': \'Vuela. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar.)\\n{1}{U}: El jugador objetivo muestra la carta de la parte superior de su biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero soldado ave\', \'flavor\': \'"La ola más pequeña cuenta una historia de una profundidad de 10 brazas."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63bc0afc-1212-489f-ad49-7cdd56bfc2f8\', \'multiverseId\': 99892}, \'multiverseid\': 99892}, {\'name\': \'Avemain déchiffre-vent\', \'text\': \'Vol (Cette créature ne peut être bloquée que par des créatures avec le vol.)\\n{1}{U} : Le joueur ciblé révèle la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et soldat et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« La plus petite des vaguelettes conte des histoires profondes de dix brasses. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98092&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a28970ab-71fe-4c28-8e9f-27d1e365d6f6\', \'multiverseId\': 98092}, \'multiverseid\': 98092}, {\'name\': \'Scrutavento Aviano\', \'text\': \'Volare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature con volare.)\\n{1}{U}: Il giocatore bersaglio rivela la prima carta del proprio grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Soldato Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'"La più piccola increspatura racconta una storia che si è svolta a dieci leghe di profondità."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2aa0122e-d9f4-4f63-bae0-cbf2c0a8e2ff\', \'multiverseId\': 98812}, \'multiverseid\': 98812}, {\'name\': \'エイヴンの風読み\', \'text\': \'飛行 （このクリーチャーは飛行を持たないクリーチャーによってブロックされない。）\\n{1}{U}：プレイヤー１人を対象とし、そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・兵士・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'水面のほんの小さな波紋が、深い水底で起こっていることを伝えてくれる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d1d19eb-00a9-4a66-8c65-f14dbfe5126f\', \'multiverseId\': 99172}, \'multiverseid\': 99172}, {\'name\': \'Leitor dos Ventos Aviano\', \'text\': \'Voar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com a habilidade de voar.)\\n{1}{U}: O jogador alvo revela o card do topo de seu próprio grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Mago Soldado Pássaro\', \'flavor\': \'"A menor ondulação na superfície conta uma história com dez braças de profundidade."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c84f634-f613-4b92-ac03-36740767b393\', \'multiverseId\': 99532}, \'multiverseid\': 99532}, {\'name\': \'Предсказатель ветров\', \'text\': \'Полет (Это существо может быть блокировано только существом со способностью полета).\\n{1}{U}: Целевой игрок открывает верхнюю карту библиотеки.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица Солдат Мудрец\', \'flavor\': \'"Крошечная рыбья чешуйка может поведать, что творится на глубине в десяток саженей".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f8b0776-9775-4726-8a3f-c0252c37ceec\', \'multiverseId\': 109803}, \'multiverseid\': 109803}, {\'name\': \'艾文风信师\', \'text\': \'飞行（只有具飞行异能的生物才能阻挡它。）\\n{1}{U}：目标牌手展示其牌库顶牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～鸟／士兵／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「甚至连最微小的水纹都透露出十噚深的故事。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fea9967-786f-4556-bead-1d3089913006\', \'multiverseId\': 97732}, \'multiverseid\': 97732}]', '[{\'name\': \'Avior-Wolkenjäger\', \'text\': \'Fliegend (Diese Kreatur kann nur von fliegenden Kreaturen geblockt werden.)\\nWenn der Avior-Wolkenjäger ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98449&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b3736a7-7a35-4c90-b144-29945a17886b\', \'multiverseId\': 98449}, \'multiverseid\': 98449}, {\'name\': \'Cazanubes aven\', \'text\': \'Vuela. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar.)\\nCuando el Cazanubes aven entre en juego, destruye el encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'638d2ae8-25ac-45d5-b93e-2e489639fc9d\', \'multiverseId\': 99889}, \'multiverseid\': 99889}, {\'name\': \'Avemain chasse-nuage\', \'text\': "Vol (Cette créature ne peut être bloquée que par des créatures avec le vol.)\\nQuand l\'Avemain chasse-nuage arrive en jeu, détruisez l\'enchantement ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98089&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'415eeccb-3167-4f34-8e6c-d672ebabe1f9\', \'multiverseId\': 98089}, \'multiverseid\': 98089}, {\'name\': \'Caccianubi Aviano\', \'text\': \'Volare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature con volare.)\\nQuando il Caccianubi Aviano entra in gioco, distruggi un incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Uccello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98809&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09cb6d80-7cd3-40ad-a72d-2134f5d8f313\', \'multiverseId\': 98809}, \'multiverseid\': 98809}, {\'name\': \'雲を追うエイヴン\', \'text\': \'飛行 （このクリーチャーは飛行を持たないクリーチャーによってブロックされない。）\\n雲を追うエイヴンが場に出たとき、エンチャント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efc08117-9cb1-43b8-b519-a5f1c226cfab\', \'multiverseId\': 99169}, \'multiverseid\': 99169}, {\'name\': \'Caça-nuvens Aviano\', \'text\': \'Voar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com a habilidade de voar.)\\nQuando Caça-nuvens Aviano entra em jogo, destrói o encantamento alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado Pássaro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73e14234-8502-4a41-a14b-81f16b0bcf54\', \'multiverseId\': 99529}, \'multiverseid\': 99529}, {\'name\': \'Загонщик облаков\', \'text\': \'Полет (Это существо может быть блокировано только существом со способностью полета).\\nКогда Загонщик облаков вступает в игру, уничтожьте целевые чары.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица Солдат\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b8e3106-a342-4303-96b2-a45d80c015b4\', \'multiverseId\': 109800}, \'multiverseid\': 109800}, {\'name\': \'艾文逐云战士\', \'text\': \'飞行（只有具飞行异能的生物才能阻挡它。）\\n当艾文逐云战士进场时，消灭目标结界。\', \'type\': \'生物～鸟／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8798913-6121-4106-8e10-5f1033934f1f\', \'multiverseId\': 97729}, \'multiverseid\': 97729}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aviorschwarm\', \'text\': \'Fliegend (Diese Kreatur kann nur von fliegenden Kreaturen geblockt werden.)\\n{W}: Der Aviorschwarm erhält +0/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'So wie jede weitere Feder den Flügel kräftiger macht, so wächst die Macht des Schwarms mit jedem weiteren Rekruten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98451&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90c77a75-cb1c-4879-b60b-7712b53f0108\', \'multiverseId\': 98451}, \'multiverseid\': 98451}, {\'name\': \'Parvada aven\', \'text\': \'Vuela. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar.)\\n{W}: La Parvada aven obtiene +0/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado ave\', \'flavor\': \'De la misma manera en que cada pluma agregada estabiliza el ala, la parvada se fortalece con cada miembro nuevo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5fc010e-8784-4b8e-873d-5a32c4cba36c\', \'multiverseId\': 99891}, \'multiverseid\': 99891}, {\'name\': "Nuée d\'avemains", \'text\': "Vol (Cette créature ne peut être bloquée que par des créatures avec le vol.)\\n{W} : La Nuée d\'avemains gagne +0/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et soldat\', \'flavor\': "Tout comme chaque plume renforce l\'aile, la nuée devient plus forte avec chaque nouvel arrivant.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98091&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa2447f3-6a62-49cf-ae82-1e96c43294c5\', \'multiverseId\': 98091}, \'multiverseid\': 98091}, {\'name\': \'Stormo di Aviani\', \'text\': \'Volare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature con volare.)\\n{W}: Lo Stormo di Aviani prende +0/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Uccello\', \'flavor\': "Come ogni nuova piuma rende l\'ala più stabile, così lo stormo diventa più forte per ogni nuovo membro.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98811&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae08e667-81b0-4471-bb74-e698ca9d39f8\', \'multiverseId\': 98811}, \'multiverseid\': 98811}, {\'name\': \'エイヴンの群れ\', \'text\': \'飛行 （このクリーチャーは飛行を持たないクリーチャーによってブロックされない。）\\n{W}：エイヴンの群れはターン終了時まで+0/+1の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'羽が一枚増えるごとに翼が強くなるように、新しいメンバーが増えるごとに群れは強くなる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f5f775a-3442-4d3e-b9b2-01d6c6e07fe5\', \'multiverseId\': 99171}, \'multiverseid\': 99171}, {\'name\': \'Bando Aviano\', \'text\': \'Voar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com a habilidade de voar.)\\n{W}: Bando Aviano recebe +0/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado Pássaro\', \'flavor\': \'Assim como cada pena adicionada estabiliza a asa, o bando se fortalece com cada novo membro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5822a00e-16f0-4810-9fe3-ed3f9a73839a\', \'multiverseId\': 99531}, \'multiverseid\': 99531}, {\'name\': \'Воздушная стая\', \'text\': \'Полет (Это существо может быть блокировано только существом со способностью полета).\\n{W}: Воздушная стая получает +0/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'Как с каждым новым пером крыло становится надежнее, так с каждой новой птицей стая становится сильнее.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26ca6d6a-5b1c-47c1-95b5-2cdc586b9298\', \'multiverseId\': 109802}, \'multiverseid\': 109802}, {\'name\': \'艾文信众\', \'text\': \'飞行（只有具飞行异能的生物才能阻挡它。）\\n{W}：艾文信众得+0/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～鸟／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'每根新羽毛都使翅翼更强健，每位新成员都让群体更壮实。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69f8ac40-052d-4a7d-a5a4-1377bff98a1d\', \'multiverseId\': 97731}, \'multiverseid\': 97731}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azurblauer Sceada\', \'text\': \'Fliegend (Diese Kreatur kann nur von fliegenden Kreaturen geblockt werden.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sceada\', \'flavor\': \'Nur wenige Träume sind so grausam Wie das Warten auf die ausgebreiteten Schwingen, Die gefletschten Zähne, die stechenden Augen Und scharfen Krallen, die Dich schaudern lassen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98453&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'387f2e4d-1ef6-4d7c-a360-b086d5eb6b7d\', \'multiverseId\': 98453}, \'multiverseid\': 98453}, {\'name\': \'Draco azur\', \'text\': \'Vuela. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Draco\', \'flavor\': \'Ningún sueño podría ser tan cruel Como esperar por las alas abiertas, Los dientes afilados, los ojos encendidos, Y las garras como cuchillas que se clavan hasta los nervios.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c23c607f-d4dd-4fe5-9ab7-ccb57e551ad7\', \'multiverseId\': 99893}, \'multiverseid\': 99893}, {\'name\': "Drakôn d\'azur", \'text\': \'Vol (Cette créature ne peut être bloquée que par des créatures avec le vol.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : drakôn\', \'flavor\': "Rien ne saurait être plus cruel Qu\'attendre ces grandes ailes de cuir, Ces dents acérées, ces yeux brûlants, Et ces serres qui percent le nerf à vif.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98093&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'264a3c34-2145-4193-927f-ecb40a95711a\', \'multiverseId\': 98093}, \'multiverseid\': 98093}, {\'name\': \'Drago Azzurro\', \'text\': \'Volare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature con volare.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Draghetto\', \'flavor\': "Sono pochi i sogni che possono sembrare così crudeli Come l\'attesa del dispiegarsi delle ali, Dei denti aguzzi, degli occhi di fuoco, E degli artigli taglienti che ti stritolano i nervi.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98813&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b64fc1b-b7c2-49df-88d0-7ee53e6e2384\', \'multiverseId\': 98813}, \'multiverseid\': 98813}, {\'name\': \'蒼穹のドレイク\', \'text\': \'飛行 （このクリーチャーは飛行を持たないクリーチャーによってブロックされない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドレイク\', \'flavor\': \'かくも残酷な瞬間があろうとは、誰も夢にも思うまい。 風を翼にはらませて、 我が身に迫る牙の列、燃えさかる瞳。 短剣の鈎爪は予感に震えて。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'185cb862-02e4-4548-9d7d-2e4ce037383f\', \'multiverseId\': 99173}, \'multiverseid\': 99173}, {\'name\': \'Dragonete Lazur\', \'text\': \'Voar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com a habilidade de voar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragonete\', \'flavor\': \'Poucos imaginavam que pudesse parecer tão cruel Ao observar suas asas se abrindo, Os dentes afiados, os olhos em brasa, E as garras como adagas que esmagam os nervos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd1518ae-01a4-41c1-9ca4-80481f9f28cd\', \'multiverseId\': 99533}, \'multiverseid\': 99533}, {\'name\': \'Лазурный дрейк\', \'text\': \'Полет (Это существо может быть блокировано только существом со способностью полета).\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дрейк\', \'flavor\': \'Огромны крылья и клыки, Огонь горит в глазах. И когти острые клинки Повсюду сеют страх.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109804&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'605b2530-f97f-4e04-806d-74bf960ec6f0\', \'multiverseId\': 109804}, \'multiverseid\': 109804}, {\'name\': \'碧蓝龙兽\', \'text\': \'飞行（只有具飞行异能的生物才能阻挡它。）\', \'type\': \'生物～龙兽\', \'flavor\': \'它静待着展翅高翔 很难想象竟是如此残酷 锯般的齿，燃烧的眼 紧连翅脉上匕首般的爪\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97733&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b2a0391-80c3-41aa-b95f-04d0e2568696\', \'multiverseId\': 97733}, \'multiverseid\': 97733}]', '[{\'name\': \'Balduvianische Barbaren\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Barbar\', \'flavor\': \'„Von den verschneiten Gipfeln von Kaelor, Zu den Flusstälern von Bandu, Wir trinken und kämpfen, fressen und sterben, Wozu wir geboren wurden." —Balduvianischer Kneipensong\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98454&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'767919f4-1265-45c4-9f3d-be2ce17e7fed\', \'multiverseId\': 98454}, \'multiverseid\': 98454}, {\'name\': \'Bárbaros balduvianos\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bárbaro humano\', \'flavor\': \'"De las laderas nevadas de Kaelor, a los cañones de Bandu, bebemos y peleamos y nos deleitamos y morimos, y lo hacemos porque para eso nacimos." Canción balduviana de taberna\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fa327c6-b9af-4295-ad03-c90a46a9a8d2\', \'multiverseId\': 99894}, \'multiverseid\': 99894}, {\'name\': \'Barbares balduvians\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et barbare\', \'flavor\': \'« Des pentes neigeuses de Kaelor aux canyons de Bandou, nous buvons et baisons et mourons car nous ne sommes pas des bande mou. » —Chanson à boire balduviane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98094&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04dc58c8-7a51-451c-a4c5-01d754553ae2\', \'multiverseId\': 98094}, \'multiverseid\': 98094}, {\'name\': \'Barbari di Balduvia\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Barbaro Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Dalle pendici innevate di Kaelor, Ai canyon di Bandu, Beviamo, combattiamo, banchettiamo e moriamo Così come ci è dato di fare dalla nascita." —Canzone da taverna di Balduvia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98814&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e962eba-3f6d-4511-ad8f-2568d42797a2\', \'multiverseId\': 98814}, \'multiverseid\': 98814}, {\'name\': \'バルデュヴィアの蛮族\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・バーバリアン\', \'flavor\': \'雪のキロールの山から バンデュの谷まで 我らは飲み、争い、騒ぎ、死ぬ 生まれたからにゃそうするまで ――バルデュヴィアの居酒屋の唄\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6782e94-16ae-4fdb-a11a-d8e2d592b37b\', \'multiverseId\': 99174}, \'multiverseid\': 99174}, {\'name\': \'Bárbaros Balduvianos\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bárbaro Humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Das encostas nevadas de Kaelor, Até os desfiladeiros de Bandu, Bebemos e lutamos e comemos e morremos É isso que fazemos desde que nascemos." — Canção balduviana de taverna\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53430ee6-277f-4797-a89d-d6f389f99be2\', \'multiverseId\': 99534}, \'multiverseid\': 99534}, {\'name\': \'Бальдувийские варвары\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Варвар\', \'flavor\': \'"От Кэйлора снежных вершин До горных каньонов Банду, В смертельных сраженьях и в пьяном бреду Проносится вся наша жизнь". —Застольная песня бальдувийцев\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109805&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec3500a5-c4d6-4ae3-80d1-7fdb8e8f4f22\', \'multiverseId\': 109805}, \'multiverseid\': 109805}, {\'name\': \'博都维亚野蛮人\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／野蛮人\', \'flavor\': \'「从凯勒的雪坡， 到班度的峡谷， 我们痛饮、战斗、庆贺、死亡 如同我们的天赋。」 ～博都维亚旅店之歌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99c875af-e99d-4afb-aa28-9d43ae4da7ad\', \'multiverseId\': 97734}, \'multiverseid\': 97734}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ballistaeinheit\', \'text\': \'{X}{W}, {T}: Die Ballistaeinheit fügt einer angreifenden oder blockenden Kreatur deiner Wahl X Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Rebell\', \'flavor\': \'Das perfekte Gegenmittel zu einer dichten Formation.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98456&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9113e86-2863-4578-8752-04c8ab681c59\', \'multiverseId\': 98456}, \'multiverseid\': 98456}, {\'name\': \'Escuadra de ballesta\', \'text\': \'{X}{W}, {T}: La Escuadra de ballesta hace X puntos de daño a la criatura atacante o bloqueadora objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Rebelde humano\', \'flavor\': \'Es el antídoto perfecto para una formación apretada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'408c5d15-ab98-4973-ae45-839c5a35daa7\', \'multiverseId\': 99896}, \'multiverseid\': 99896}, {\'name\': \'Escouade de balistes\', \'text\': "{X}{W}, {T} : L\'Escouade de balistes inflige X blessures à la créature attaquante ou bloqueuse ciblée.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et rebelle\', \'flavor\': "L\'antidote parfait à la formation serrée.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98096&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e90955bb-21d6-479d-8087-8992fc940ee6\', \'multiverseId\': 98096}, \'multiverseid\': 98096}, {\'name\': \'Unità Balista\', \'text\': "{X}{W}, {T}: L\'Unità Balista infligge X danni a una creatura bersaglio che sta attaccando o bloccando.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Ribelle Umano\', \'flavor\': "L\'antidoto perfetto per una formazione estremamente compatta.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e0289af-6e17-4bc3-80e4-8cae1cf30125\', \'multiverseId\': 98816}, \'multiverseid\': 98816}, {\'name\': \'バリスタ班\', \'text\': \'{X}{W}, {T}：攻撃かブロックに参加しているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。バリスタ班はそれにＸ点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・レベル\', \'flavor\': \'密集した隊形のための完璧な対策だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c7e1563-1627-489c-8afc-5cb59872e98e\', \'multiverseId\': 99176}, \'multiverseid\': 99176}, {\'name\': \'Esquadrão de Balista\', \'text\': \'{X}{W}, {T}: Esquadrão de Balista causa X pontos de dano à criatura alvo atacante ou bloqueadora.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Rebelde\', \'flavor\': \'O antídoto perfeito contra as formações muito cerradas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8d5bf75-0b7d-4df8-99ae-9357c748cfa0\', \'multiverseId\': 99536}, \'multiverseid\': 99536}, {\'name\': \'Баллиста\', \'text\': \'{X}{W}, {T}: Баллиста наносит X повреждений целевому нападающему или блокирующему существу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Повстанец\', \'flavor\': \'Прекрасное средство против сплоченных отрядов.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac70bd51-bbda-435c-8961-2d1c1e5b542b\', \'multiverseId\': 109807}, \'multiverseid\': 109807}, {\'name\': \'巨弩小队\', \'text\': \'{X}{W}，{T}：巨弩小队对目标进行攻击或阻挡的生物造成X点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／反抗军\', \'flavor\': \'对付坚实紧密的阵型之良方。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dbb4658-de57-459a-9cf3-93071482493b\', \'multiverseId\': 97736}, \'multiverseid\': 97736}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ballonbrigade der Goblins\', \'text\': \'{R}: Die Ballonbrigade der Goblins erhält Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Sie kann nur von fliegenden Kreaturen geblockt werden.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Sie flickten die Löcher, packten die spitzesten Steine ein, verhauten die Kinder ein letztes Mal und schlingerten langsam dem Sonnenuntergang entgegen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98554&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e9f199b-032d-4baf-8c75-4ca3ff3941f5\', \'multiverseId\': 98554}, \'multiverseid\': 98554}, {\'name\': \'Trasgos aeronautas\', \'text\': \'{R}: Los Trasgos aeronautas ganan la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno. (No pueden ser bloqueados excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Cosieron los agujeros, cargaron sus piedras más afiladas, golpearon a sus niños una última vez y se perdieron en el atardecer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffa58ee2-a913-4fb1-8d58-9a82eec5889b\', \'multiverseId\': 99994}, \'multiverseid\': 99994}, {\'name\': \'Aérostiers gobelins\', \'text\': "{R} : Les Aérostiers gobelins acquièrent le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Ils ne peuvent être bloqués que par des créatures avec le vol.)", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Ils bouchèrent les trous, chargèrent leurs pierres les plus acérées, fessèrent leurs enfants une dernière fois et s\'envolèrent vers le soleil couchant.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98194&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d12551a4-7599-4e81-96ea-61da09756301\', \'multiverseId\': 98194}, \'multiverseid\': 98194}, {\'name\': \'Brigata Aerostatica dei Goblin\', \'text\': \'{R}: La Brigata Aerostatica dei Goblin guadagna volare fino alla fine del turno. (Non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature con volare.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Goblin\', \'flavor\': "Rattopparono i buchi, caricarono le pietre più affilate, sculacciarono i loro bambini un\'ultima volta e guizzarono verso il tramonto.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98914&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ae57df9-4a1e-4c2e-8aff-d25f762f09ce\', \'multiverseId\': 98914}, \'multiverseid\': 98914}, {\'name\': \'ゴブリン気球部隊\', \'text\': \'{R}：ゴブリン気球部隊はターン終了時まで飛行を得る。 （それは飛行を持たないクリーチャーによってブロックされない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'穴を繕い、一番尖った岩を積み、最後に子供の尻をひと叩きしてから、やつらは夕暮れの中に潜む。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ddbcb6d-2353-4727-a9d0-922fe75dd207\', \'multiverseId\': 99274}, \'multiverseid\': 99274}, {\'name\': \'Brigada Baloeira Goblin\', \'text\': \'{R}: Brigada Baloeira Goblin ganha a habilidade de voar até o final do turno. (Ela só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com a habilidade de voar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerreiro Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Eles remendavam os buracos, carregavam suas rochas mais afiadas, espancavam seus filhos uma última vez, e guinavam em direção ao pôr-do-sol.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87f79404-f140-44af-b281-22c7b2942950\', \'multiverseId\': 99634}, \'multiverseid\': 99634}, {\'name\': \'Гоблинский воздушный экипаж\', \'text\': \'{R}: Гоблинский воздушный экипаж получает способность полета до конца хода. (Оно может быть заблокировано только существом со способностью полета).\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гоблин Воин\', \'flavor\': \'Они залатали дыры, погрузили самые острые камни, напоследок отшлепали ребятишек и отправились в путь, на закат.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5439ff8b-b338-4211-bc99-991cbbee169d\', \'multiverseId\': 109905}, \'multiverseid\': 109905}, {\'name\': \'精灵热气球旅\', \'text\': \'{R}：精灵热气球旅获得飞行异能直到回合结束。 （只有具飞行异能的生物才能阻挡它。）\', \'type\': \'生物～精灵／战士\', \'flavor\': \'他们把破洞修补好，装载最尖锐的石头，给孩子屁股赏最后一记巴掌，然后摇摇晃晃地随着朝阳升空。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97834&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4e09402-24d8-466a-8021-f387cdb18f6d\', \'multiverseId\': 97834}, \'multiverseid\': 97834}]', '[{\'name\': \'Baumaffe\', \'text\': \'Der Baumaffe kann blocken, als ob er Flugfähigkeit hätte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Menschenaffe\', \'flavor\': \'Die Lianen und Äste des Dschungeldaches sind alle Flügel, die er braucht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98756&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc638758-e494-4684-a630-befa918d0c25\', \'multiverseId\': 98756}, \'multiverseid\': 98756}, {\'name\': \'Mono de los árboles\', \'text\': \'El Mono de los árboles puede bloquear como si tuviera la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Simio\', \'flavor\': \'Las ramas y lianas de la enramada de la selva son todas las alas que necesita.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=100196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'387ffd29-5eba-4164-91b8-757a87019458\', \'multiverseId\': 100196}, \'multiverseid\': 100196}, {\'name\': \'Singe arboricole\', \'text\': "Le Singe arboricole peut bloquer comme s\'il avait le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature : grand singe\', \'flavor\': \'Les lianes et les branches de la canopée sont ses ailes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98396&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b00f6af-7f5d-439c-831d-f5ed8e83c798\', \'multiverseId\': 98396}, \'multiverseid\': 98396}, {\'name\': \'Scimmia dei Boschi\', \'text\': \'La Scimmia dei Boschi può bloccare come se avesse volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Scimpanzé\', \'flavor\': \'Le liane e i rami della giungla sono le uniche ali di cui ha bisogno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a733d633-edae-4738-8e24-2a601a7a4b33\', \'multiverseId\': 99116}, \'multiverseid\': 99116}, {\'name\': \'樹上生活の猿\', \'text\': \'樹上生活の猿は飛行を持っているかのようにブロックに参加できる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 類人猿\', \'flavor\': \'密林の梢の蔓や枝は、すべて翼の代わりになってくれる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b174c263-d4dc-4753-987e-a96e1a56c978\', \'multiverseId\': 99476}, \'multiverseid\': 99476}, {\'name\': \'Macaco Arbóreo\', \'text\': \'Macaco Arbóreo pode bloquear como se tivesse a habilidade de voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Símio\', \'flavor\': \'As vinhas e galhos das copas da selva são todas as asas de que ele precisa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99836&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f42e1fe-14ee-4206-91e5-9a0aaaf6b1c8\', \'multiverseId\': 99836}, \'multiverseid\': 99836}, {\'name\': \'Древесная обезьяна\', \'text\': \'Древесная обезьяна может блокировать, как если бы она обладала способностью полета.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Обезьяна\', \'flavor\': \'Лианы и ветви деревьев в джунглях. Других крыльев ей не нужно.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=110107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8e3e1e7-13bf-483c-ae02-aec33e792a19\', \'multiverseId\': 110107}, \'multiverseid\': 110107}, {\'name\': \'树林猴\', \'text\': \'树林猴能视同具飞行异能地进行阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物～猿猴\', \'flavor\': \'丛林树冠的藤蔓与树枝便是其翅翼。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'379fccad-e35a-48cf-ba5e-312e06f390d4\', \'multiverseId\': 98036}, \'multiverseid\': 98036}]', "[{'name': 'Baumwipfelarmreife', 'text': 'Kreaturenverzauberung (Bestimme eine Kreatur als Ziel, sowie du diese Karte spielst. Diese Karte kommt an die Kreatur angelegt ins Spiel.)\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 und kann nur von fliegenden Kreaturen geblockt werden.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': 'Auch die Schwerkraft ist nur das, was man aus ihr macht.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98757&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '97780c2e-3dbe-462c-a103-a10b7b25f4b0', 'multiverseId': 98757}, 'multiverseid': 98757}, {'name': 'Brazales para los árboles', 'text': 'Encantar criatura (Haz objetivo a una criatura al jugarlo. Esta carta entra en juego anexada a esa criatura.)\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 y no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura', 'flavor': 'La gravedad verdaderamente es lo que tú haces de ella.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=100197&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '47637c57-63e1-4736-b2f4-7269fa0d7017', 'multiverseId': 100197}, 'multiverseid': 100197}, {'name': 'Bracelets arboricoles', 'text': 'Enchanter : créature (Ciblez une créature au moment où vous jouez cette carte. Cette carte arrive en jeu attachée à cette créature.)\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 et elle ne peut être bloquée que par des créatures avec le vol.', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura', 'flavor': 'Tout dépend de la façon dont vous utilisez la gravité.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98397&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fff1dbe4-3bd5-4403-bd0c-d671e809791f', 'multiverseId': 98397}, 'multiverseid': 98397}, {'name': 'Sostegni Arboricoli', 'text': 'Incanta creatura (Scegli come bersaglio una creatura mentre giochi questa magia. Questa carta entra in gioco assegnata a quella creatura.)\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1 e non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature con volare.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura', 'flavor': 'La gravità è ciò che tu ne fai.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99117&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '440e3b9a-6bb4-45f3-a615-a011efd1ba50', 'multiverseId': 99117}, 'multiverseid': 99117}, {'name': '樹上の篭手', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー） （これをプレイする際に、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。 このカードはそのクリーチャーにつけられている状態で場に出る。）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは+1/+1の修整を受けるとともに飛行を持つクリーチャーによってしかブロックされない。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': '重力っていうものは、使い方次第さ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99477&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f30e5e92-36cc-4183-8d80-7e57bedecf2e', 'multiverseId': 99477}, 'multiverseid': 99477}, {'name': 'Braceletes das Copas', 'text': 'Encantar criatura (Vise uma criatura conforme jogar este card. Este card entra em jogo anexado àquela criatura.)\\nA criatura encantada recebe +1/+1 e só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com a habilidade de voar.', 'type': 'Encantamento — Aura', 'flavor': 'A gravidade é o que você faz dela.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99837&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e2b5068e-3bbb-47b8-88c9-4507d15caf51', 'multiverseId': 99837}, 'multiverseid': 99837}, {'name': 'Наручи верхолазов', 'text': 'Зачаровать существо (Когда вы разыгрываете эту карту, целью является существо. Карта вступает в игру вместе с этим существом).\\nЗачарованное существо получает +1/+1 и может быть блокировано только существом со способностью полета.', 'type': 'Чары — Аура', 'flavor': 'Они помогут вам преодолеть силу тяжести.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=110108&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd5976884-631a-4aaf-8a4d-c022066b1919', 'multiverseId': 110108}, 'multiverseid': 110108}, {'name': '树梢护臂', 'text': '生物结界（于使用时指定一个生物为目标。 此牌进场时结附在该生物上）\\n受此结界的生物得+1/+1，并且只能被具飞行异能的生物阻挡。', 'type': '结界～灵气', 'flavor': '重力的意义，端看你如何解释它。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98037&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '01aaad5c-2661-4e43-88cb-ce5ac8a9f12d', 'multiverseId': 98037}, 'multiverseid': 98037}]", '[{\'name\': \'Bedrohen\', \'text\': \'Enttappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl und erhalte bis zum Ende des Zuges die Kontrolle über sie. Diese Kreatur erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Sie kann in diesem Zug angreifen.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Motivationskünste der Goblins sind plump, aber effektiv.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98747&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccc14cb2-0cdd-4a2b-ac57-7441841d6dc7\', \'multiverseId\': 98747}, \'multiverseid\': 98747}, {\'name\': \'Amenazar\', \'text\': \'Endereza la criatura objetivo y gana el control de ella hasta el final del turno. Esa criatura gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno. (Puede atacar este turno.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Las técnicas motivadoras de los trasgos son rudimentarias, pero efectivas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=100187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b0a49e0-323e-4219-82d0-e6b1f4f341f0\', \'multiverseId\': 100187}, \'multiverseid\': 100187}, {\'name\': \'Menace\', \'text\': "Dégagez la créature ciblée et acquérez-en le contrôle jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Cette créature acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Elle peut attaquer ce tour-ci.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Les stages de motivation chez les gobelins sont rudimentaires, mais efficaces.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98387&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'720576f0-c956-4258-82ee-2a9fa45c1af5\', \'multiverseId\': 98387}, \'multiverseid\': 98387}, {\'name\': \'Minacciare\', \'text\': \'STAPpa una creatura bersaglio e prendine il controllo fino alla fine del turno. Quella creatura guadagna rapidità fino alla fine del turno. (Può attaccare in questo turno.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Le tecniche motivazionali dei Goblin sono un po\' rozze, ma efficaci.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b8db04f-cfcf-4956-a310-bdb61effb107\', \'multiverseId\': 99107}, \'multiverseid\': 99107}, {\'name\': \'脅しつけ\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それをアンタップし、ターン終了時までそれのコントロールを得る。 それはターン終了時まで速攻を得る。 （それはこのターン攻撃に参加してもよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ゴブリン式のやる気をおこさせる方法は、乱暴だが効果的だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99467&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b420283e-99c4-48d3-9259-e7829ea28b6d\', \'multiverseId\': 99467}, \'multiverseid\': 99467}, {\'name\': \'Ameaçar\', \'text\': \'Desvire a criatura alvo e ganhe o controle dela até o final do turno. Aquela criatura ganha a habilidade de ímpeto até o final do turno. (Ela pode atacar neste turno.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'As técnicas para motivação utilizadas pelos goblins são imaturas, porém eficazes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'484b6894-060b-434f-8f2b-b1260b6101a9\', \'multiverseId\': 99827}, \'multiverseid\': 99827}, {\'name\': \'Угроза\', \'text\': \'Разверните целевое существо и получите контроль над ним до конца хода. Это существо получает способность ускорения до конца хода. (Оно может нападать в этот ход).\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Способ убеждения у гоблинов жестокий, но действенный.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=110098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'571fbca7-ab9d-4445-a148-6b10ab05b5a8\', \'multiverseId\': 110098}, \'multiverseid\': 110098}, {\'name\': \'恐吓\', \'text\': \'重置目标生物并获得其操控权直到回合结束。 该生物获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。 （它此回合便可以攻击）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'精灵激励行动的技巧粗糙却有效。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2348586-4644-47a5-835f-42ecaaa57676\', \'multiverseId\': 98027}, \'multiverseid\': 98027}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bewusstseinserweiterung\', \'text\': \'Verändere den Text einer bleibenden Karte deiner Wahl, indem du im Text alle Vorkommen eines Farbwortes durch ein anderes oder alle Vorkommen eines Standardlandtyps durch ein anderes ersetzt. (Zum Beispiel kannst du „nichtschwarze Kreatur" in „nichtgrüne Kreatur" umändern oder „Waldtarnung" in „Ebenentarnung". Dieser Effekt endet nicht am Ende des Zuges.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98623&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7f7de91-bcc2-47ea-b4b7-ff1ef4526552\', \'multiverseId\': 98623}, \'multiverseid\': 98623}, {\'name\': \'Torsión mental\', \'text\': \'Cambia el texto del permanente objetivo reemplazando todas las menciones de un color por otro o un tipo de tierra básica por otro. (Por ejemplo, puedes cambiar "criatura que no sea negra" por "criatura que no sea verde" o "cruza bosques" por "cruza llanuras". Este efecto no termina al final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=100063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81dd7056-3efc-41aa-9080-9a8a10a1afe2\', \'multiverseId\': 100063}, \'multiverseid\': 100063}, {\'name\': \'Ploiement mental\', \'text\': "Changez le texte de règles d\'un permanent ciblé en remplaçant toutes les occurrences d\'un nom de couleur par un autre nom de couleur ou d\'un type de terrain de base par un autre. (Par exemple, vous pouvez remplacer « créature non-noire » par « créature non-verte » ou « traversée des forêts » par « traversée des plaines. » Cet effet ne s\'arrête pas à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98263&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed9c058d-9c0f-416a-bc3b-86a15c2441f2\', \'multiverseId\': 98263}, \'multiverseid\': 98263}, {\'name\': \'Piegare la Mente\', \'text\': \'Cambia il testo di un permanente bersaglio sostituendo tutte le occorrenze di un nome di colore con un altro o il tipo di una terra base con un altro. (Per esempio, puoi cambiare "creatura non nera" in "creatura non verde" o "passa-foreste" in "passa-pianure". Questo effetto non termina alla fine del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc886b25-ef94-41bc-994a-a2668b7c7a20\', \'multiverseId\': 98983}, \'multiverseid\': 98983}, {\'name\': \'幻覚\', \'text\': \'パーマネント１つを対象とする。それに書かれた色を表す言葉１種類をすべて別な色に置き換えるか、基本土地タイプ１種類をすべて別な基本土地タイプに置き換える。 （例えば、あなたは「黒でないクリーチャー」を「緑でないクリーチャー」に置き換えたり、「森渡り」を「平地渡り」に置き換えたりしてよい。この効果はターン終了時に終わらない。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dcf9cd7-18dc-4c5b-a3b2-0b9355e77e8d\', \'multiverseId\': 99343}, \'multiverseid\': 99343}, {\'name\': \'Contraverter a Mente\', \'text\': \'Mude o texto da permanente alvo substituindo todas as palavras relativas a uma cor por outra, ou um tipo de terreno básico por outro. (Por exemplo, você pode mudar "criatura que não seja preta" para "criatura que não seja verde" ou "travessia de floresta" para "travessia de planície". Este efeito não cessa no final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'036fc5a3-45ca-4829-98ba-b8d51c93b137\', \'multiverseId\': 99703}, \'multiverseid\': 99703}, {\'name\': \'Сгибание разума\', \'text\': \'Измените текст целевого перманента, заменив все названия цветов и типы базовых земель. (Например, "нечерное существо" можно заменить на "незеленое существо", а "знание лесов" на "знание равнин").\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77c12c5e-3f2c-4598-8d1e-eefd8c548f69\', \'multiverseId\': 109974}, \'multiverseid\': 109974}, {\'name\': \'曲解心意\', \'text\': \'更改目标永久物的规则叙述文字；将其中一种颜色文字全部更改为另一种，或是将一种基本地类别文字全部更改为另一种。 （例如你可以将「非黑生物」修改为「非绿生物」，或是将「树林行者」修改为「平原行者」。此效应不因回合结束而终止）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6c8c373-ce9e-4e2e-b825-1c4b6fadfdcd\', \'multiverseId\': 97903}, \'multiverseid\': 97903}]', '[{\'name\': \'Biorhythmus\', \'text\': \'Die Lebenspunktzahl jedes Spielers ist gleich der Anzahl der Kreaturen, die er kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe den Zweck des Lebens erkannt, und ihn für mich übernommen." —Kamahl, Druidennovize\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98460&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'404e74d1-9b38-4f65-a845-e204ece792ee\', \'multiverseId\': 98460}, \'multiverseid\': 98460}, {\'name\': \'Biorritmo\', \'text\': \'El total de vida de cada jugador es el número de criaturas que controle.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"He visto el propósito de la vida, y ahora lo he hecho mío". —Kamahl, acólito druida\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75463d89-1c36-4ca3-b2ee-448bcf8ce54a\', \'multiverseId\': 99900}, \'multiverseid\': 99900}, {\'name\': \'Biorythme\', \'text\': "Le total de points de vie de chaque joueur devient égal au nombre de créatures qu\'il contrôle.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Je connais le but de la vie, je connais donc le but de ma vie. » —Kamahl, acolyte druide\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98100&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48a99085-b5c8-4529-9bd7-f7ec013738f6\', \'multiverseId\': 98100}, \'multiverseid\': 98100}, {\'name\': \'Bioritmo\', \'text\': \'Il totale dei punti vita di ciascun giocatore diventa pari al numero di creature che egli controlla.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ho compreso lo scopo della vita e l\\\'ho fatto mio." —Kamahl, accolito druido\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f5dd16a-ab7a-43c3-9b37-84fbe7227e8f\', \'multiverseId\': 98820}, \'multiverseid\': 98820}, {\'name\': \'生命の律動\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーのライフの総量は、そのプレイヤーがコントロールするクリーチャーの総数に等しくなる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'私は生命の目的を見てきた。今やそれは私と共にある。 ――ドルイドの見習いカマール\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7481aee2-22b0-4c8f-97d6-2fd9022344e9\', \'multiverseId\': 99180}, \'multiverseid\': 99180}, {\'name\': \'Biorritmo\', \'text\': \'O total de pontos de vida de cada jogador torna-se igual ao número de criaturas que ele próprio controla.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Vi o propósito da vida, e agora é o meu próprio." — Kamahl, acólito druida\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d2ced11-52bc-496f-a87b-891293cbe3c8\', \'multiverseId\': 99540}, \'multiverseid\': 99540}, {\'name\': \'Биоритм\', \'text\': \'Общее количество жизни каждого игрока равняется числу существ, которых он контролирует.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'"Я узнал цель жизни. Теперь это моя цель". — Камал, священник друидов\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109811&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97943649-68ff-45dc-af4d-925876d67983\', \'multiverseId\': 109811}, \'multiverseid\': 109811}, {\'name\': \'生理韵律\', \'text\': \'每位牌手的总生命成为由其操控的生物之数量。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「我见识过生命的涵义。现在这是我生命的意义。」 ～德鲁伊侍僧卡马尔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11a64eb3-4b69-421d-ac99-26b000555535\', \'multiverseId\': 97740}, \'multiverseid\': 97740}]', "[{'name': 'Bleichholzrüstung', 'text': 'Kreaturenverzauberung (Bestimme eine Kreatur als Ziel, sowie du diese Karte spielst. Diese Karte kommt an die Kreatur angelegt ins Spiel.)\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 für jeden Wald, den du kontrollierst.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98462&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '72491976-f3cc-4f99-97fb-929a65965dc2', 'multiverseId': 98462}, 'multiverseid': 98462}, {'name': 'Armadura de maderapálida', 'text': 'Encantar criatura (Haz objetivo a una criatura al jugarlo. Esta carta entra en juego anexada a esa criatura.)\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 por cada bosque que controles.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99902&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '24fe0d18-8060-4159-a082-46fdf9cbeb6f', 'multiverseId': 99902}, 'multiverseid': 99902}, {'name': 'Armure de boisblanc', 'text': 'Enchanter : créature (Ciblez une créature au moment où vous jouez cette carte. Cette carte arrive en jeu attachée à cette créature.)\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 pour chaque forêt que vous contrôlez.', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98102&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cf16780b-ac9a-4768-8d7f-f1d1a7e0d731', 'multiverseId': 98102}, 'multiverseid': 98102}, {'name': 'Armatura di Boscopallido', 'text': 'Incanta creatura (Scegli come bersaglio una creatura mentre giochi questa magia. Questa carta entra in gioco assegnata a quella creatura.)\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1 per ogni Foresta che controlli.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98822&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dc113db9-3cdc-4487-b54e-ea5e064eb2b0', 'multiverseId': 98822}, 'multiverseid': 98822}, {'name': 'ブランチウッドの鎧', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー） （これをプレイする際に、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。 このカードはそのクリーチャーにつけられている状態で場に出る。）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは、あなたがコントロールする森１つにつき+1/+1の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99182&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7d00037c-191b-413f-a9d9-2b5d27371cdc', 'multiverseId': 99182}, 'multiverseid': 99182}, {'name': 'Armadura de Blanchwood', 'text': 'Encantar criatura (Vise uma criatura conforme jogar este card. Este card entra em jogo anexado àquela criatura.)\\nA criatura encantada recebe +1/+1 para cada Floresta que você controla.', 'type': 'Encantamento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99542&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd9e59608-747c-45ca-9efe-8890bd6d96ad', 'multiverseId': 99542}, 'multiverseid': 99542}, {'name': 'Доспехи Бланчвуда', 'text': 'Зачаровать существо (Когда вы разыгрываете эту карту, целью является существо. Карта вступает в игру вместе с этим существом).\\nЗачарованное существо получает +1/+1 за каждый Лес, который вы контролируете.', 'type': 'Чары — Аура', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109813&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '44296ef9-bba8-4213-91aa-0d7cbab55e74', 'multiverseId': 109813}, 'multiverseid': 109813}, {'name': '白木甲', 'text': '生物结界（于使用时指定一个生物为目标。 此牌进场时结附在该生物上）\\n你每操控一个树林，受此结界的生物便得+1/+1。', 'type': '结界～灵气', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97742&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f43832a4-89fd-4112-8e40-0b074a6beaac', 'multiverseId': 97742}, 'multiverseid': 97742}]", '[{\'name\': \'Blendender Engel\', \'text\': \'Fliegend (Diese Kreatur kann nur von fliegenden Kreaturen geblockt werden.)\\nImmer wenn der Blendende Engel einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, übergeht dieser Spieler seine nächste Kampfphase.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': \'„Ihre Augen werden ausdörren und erblinden im Antlitz des wahren Lichts des Schicksals."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98465&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55a29478-44b0-403c-a36e-67080cc00ed4\', \'multiverseId\': 98465}, \'multiverseid\': 98465}, {\'name\': \'Ángel cegador\', \'text\': \'Vuela. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar.)\\nSiempre que el Ángel cegador haga daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador se salta su siguiente fase de combate.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': \'"Sus ojos se consumirán y ennegrecerán ante la luz verdadera de la fe."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8604ab9b-5851-47bf-91ce-14b67bcb7d9a\', \'multiverseId\': 99905}, \'multiverseid\': 99905}, {\'name\': \'Ange aveuglante\', \'text\': "Vol (Cette créature ne peut être bloquée que par des créatures avec le vol.)\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Ange aveuglante inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur passe sa prochaine phase de combat.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': "« Leurs yeux se flétriront sous l\'effet de la vraie lumière de la foi. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98105&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8d6e57b-7f3f-40bd-809f-f8f6a7dda877\', \'multiverseId\': 98105}, \'multiverseid\': 98105}, {\'name\': \'Angelo Accecante\', \'text\': "Volare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature con volare.)\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Angelo Accecante infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, quel giocatore salta la sua prossima fase di combattimento.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': \'"I loro occhi avvizziranno e si oscureranno davanti alla vera luce della fede."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fbbbb93-9590-4795-8e1d-bd5638bff35d\', \'multiverseId\': 98825}, \'multiverseid\': 98825}, {\'name\': \'まばゆい天使\', \'text\': \'飛行 （このクリーチャーは飛行を持たないクリーチャーによってブロックされない。）\\nまばゆい天使がいずれかのプレイヤーに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーは自分の次の戦闘フェイズを飛ばす。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': \'彼らの目は真の信念の光の前ではしだいに閉じ、見えなくなってしまうであろう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'083309dc-61e7-47ab-95f1-b57a7582cf74\', \'multiverseId\': 99185}, \'multiverseid\': 99185}, {\'name\': \'Anjo Ofuscante\', \'text\': \'Voar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com a habilidade de voar.)\\nToda vez que Anjo Ofuscante causar dano de combate a um jogador, aquele jogador pula sua próxima fase de combate.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo\', \'flavor\': \'"Seus olhos serão atrofiados e cegados pela verdadeira luz da fé."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70699584-44e9-4891-b8be-aadc79f47917\', \'multiverseId\': 99545}, \'multiverseid\': 99545}, {\'name\': \'Ослепляющий ангел\', \'text\': \'Полет (Это существо может быть блокировано только существом со способностью полета).\\nКаждый раз, когда Ослепляющий ангел наносит боевые повреждения игроку, этот игрок пропускает следующую фазу боя.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ангел\', \'flavor\': \'"Глаза их сморщатся и почернеют от истинного света веры".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01476774-afd3-4595-b7b2-c10f5b6934a9\', \'multiverseId\': 109816}, \'multiverseid\': 109816}, {\'name\': \'眩目天使\', \'text\': \'飞行（只有具飞行异能的生物才能阻挡它。）\\n每当眩目天使对牌手造成战斗伤害时，该牌手略过他的下一个战斗阶段。\', \'type\': \'生物～天使\', \'flavor\': \'「他们的眼必将瞽盲于真理之明光。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97745&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd00d992-04eb-4577-b8c9-28c88f838e7a\', \'multiverseId\': 97745}, \'multiverseid\': 97745}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blick des Unheils\', \'text\': \'Ein Gegner deiner Wahl zeigt die Karten auf seiner Hand offen vor. Du ziehst eine Karte für jedes Gebirge und für jede rote Karte, die darunter ist.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Auch wenn aus Eurem Staub und Euren Steinen nicht viel gelernt werden kann, werde ich trotzdem meine Lehren daraus ziehen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98455&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df8cb9ef-2614-4c4f-ba50-717b52c8e78c\', \'multiverseId\': 98455}, \'multiverseid\': 98455}, {\'name\': \'Mirada maléfica\', \'text\': \'El oponente objetivo muestra su mano. Robas una carta por cada montaña y por cada carta roja que haya ahí.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Aunque haya poco que aprender de tu polvo y tus piedras, igualmente los exprimiré hasta dejarlos secos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6b9d0c1-397b-4284-b8c3-77a856a378f1\', \'multiverseId\': 99895}, \'multiverseid\': 99895}, {\'name\': \'Regard sinistre\', \'text\': "L\'adversaire ciblé révèle sa main. Vous piochez une carte pour chaque montagne et chaque carte rouge qui s\'y trouve.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Personne ne résiste bien longtemps à la cruelle lucidité du regard des morts. » —Georges Cartier\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98095&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50a8e555-37ac-4bee-a7c0-c465eb26288d\', \'multiverseId\': 98095}, \'multiverseid\': 98095}, {\'name\': \'Sguardo Malevolo\', \'text\': "L\'avversario bersaglio rivela la propria mano. Peschi una carta per ogni Montagna e per ogni carta rossa presente nella sua mano.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Benché ci sia poco da imparare dalla tua polvere e dalle tue pietre, le spremerò fino all\\\'ultima goccia."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09131058-d7b2-48bf-b9a9-a3c852271c02\', \'multiverseId\': 98815}, \'multiverseid\': 98815}, {\'name\': \'悪意の眼差し\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分の手札を公開する。 あなたはその中にある山カードか赤のカード１枚につきカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'塵や石から知れることは少なかろうが、とにかく絞りつくしてやるさ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a21152a1-a55b-4608-b148-21c477a8a049\', \'multiverseId\': 99175}, \'multiverseid\': 99175}, {\'name\': \'Olhar Funesto\', \'text\': \'O oponente alvo revela sua própria mão. Você compra um card para cada Montanha e card vermelho que houver nela.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Embora haja pouco a ser aproveitado de tua poeira e rochas, ainda assim eu vou extrair tudo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9772f61-500a-407f-8fd1-a66e6e0081d1\', \'multiverseId\': 99535}, \'multiverseid\': 99535}, {\'name\': \'Мрачный взгляд\', \'text\': \'Целевой оппонент открывает руку. Вы берете столько карт, сколько Гор и красных карт в руке у оппонента.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'"От твоей пыли и камней мало что можно узнать, но все же я выжму из них и эти жалкие капли".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'629ed56f-4d90-45af-950f-fe3c2cb2884c\', \'multiverseId\': 109806}, \'multiverseid\': 109806}, {\'name\': \'威迫的眼神\', \'text\': \'目标对手展示其手牌。 其中每有一张山脉或红色牌，你便抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「尽管很难从你这堆灰尘与石头里面看出什么心得，我还是要榨到干。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40e03b48-74e5-4cc2-9787-7aa4d8a9d1b4\', \'multiverseId\': 97735}, \'multiverseid\': 97735}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blick des Verderbens\', \'text\': \'Ein Gegner deiner Wahl zeigt die Karten auf seiner Hand offen vor. Du ziehst eine Karte für jeden Wald und für jede grüne Karte, die darunter ist.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Natur braucht das Wissen, das man aus ihrer Betrachtung gewinnt, nicht. Es ist besser, sie auszunutzen, als sie ihre Kraft an Blättern und Eidechsen verschwenden zu lassen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98785&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfd06cbb-10f1-4c04-bf6d-7dbecdb87e60\', \'multiverseId\': 98785}, \'multiverseid\': 98785}, {\'name\': \'Mirada abrasadora\', \'text\': \'El oponente objetivo muestra su mano. Robas una carta por cada bosque y por cada carta verde que haya ahí.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"A la naturaleza no le importa el conocimiento obtenido de su estudio. Mejor dejarla seca a que su potencial se desperdicie en lagartos y hojas."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=100225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c19d496b-3ed5-4030-870c-6b766cffe7d7\', \'multiverseId\': 100225}, \'multiverseid\': 100225}, {\'name\': \'Regard flétrisseur\', \'text\': "L\'adversaire ciblé révèle sa main. Vous piochez une carte pour chaque forêt et chaque carte verte qui s\'y trouve.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« La nature se moque de la connaissance qu\'on puisse tirer d\'elle. Mieux vaut qu\'elle se fane que d\'être gaspillée pour des lézards et des feuilles. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98425&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'034ddf85-3e4e-4d18-a7e8-ed2ca2bfb312\', \'multiverseId\': 98425}, \'multiverseid\': 98425}, {\'name\': \'Sguardo Avvizzente\', \'text\': "L\'avversario bersaglio rivela la propria mano. Tu peschi una carta per ogni Foresta e per ogni carta verde presente in essa.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Alla natura non interessa la conoscenza che si può trarre dal suo studio. Meglio svenarla, affinché il suo potenziale non vada sprecato su lucertole e foglie."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14287d07-3ee5-4c55-b5b0-77d228badfee\', \'multiverseId\': 99145}, \'multiverseid\': 99145}, {\'name\': \'萎縮の凝視\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは手札を公開する。 あなたはその中にある森カードか緑のカード１枚につきカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'自然はそこから学ぶことで得られる知識に興味が無い。 ならそれが蜥蜴や葉で無駄にされないよう絞り上げてやれ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1b73681-631d-4eb1-9828-4c73aa1ff940\', \'multiverseId\': 99505}, \'multiverseid\': 99505}, {\'name\': \'Olhar Definhador\', \'text\': \'O oponente alvo revela sua própria mão. Você compra um card para cada Floresta e para cada card verde que houver nela.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"A natureza não se importa com o conhecimento adquirido por meio de seu estudo. O melhor é esgotá-la por completo, para que seu potencial não seja desperdiçado em folhas e lagartos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99865&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'178e817b-008a-45f6-a1cc-bc428b5a63d9\', \'multiverseId\': 99865}, \'multiverseid\': 99865}, {\'name\': \'Опустошительный взгляд\', \'text\': \'Целевой оппонент открывает руку. Вы берете столько карт, сколько Лесов и зеленых карт в руке у оппонента.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'"Природа не дорожит знаниями, которые можно получить, изучая ее. Возьмите у нее все, что можно, иначе она растратит свои силы на ящериц и листья".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=110136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8bdbaa8-7f28-4839-a3b9-cea08d295788\', \'multiverseId\': 110136}, \'multiverseid\': 110136}, {\'name\': \'枯萎的凝视\', \'text\': \'目标对手展示其手牌。 其中每有一张树林或绿色牌，你便抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「大自然可不在乎能从自身推敲出什么知识。 最好是把它榨干，免得其潜力浪费在蜥蜴与叶子上。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca36d00e-7658-4598-9f61-7874f406c7e0\', \'multiverseId\': 98065}, \'multiverseid\': 98065}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitzelementar\', \'text\': \'Eile (Diese Kreatur kann in dem Zug, in dem sie unter deine Kontrolle kommt, angreifen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein Blitz im Gewitter kommt leuchtend herab, Er scheidet vom Leben und ruht jetzt im Grab." —William Knox, „Sterblichkeit"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98603&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b340ddc-d9e6-4b2d-b5a8-f7dbf23c52e1\', \'multiverseId\': 98603}, \'multiverseid\': 98603}, {\'name\': \'Elemental de rayos\', \'text\': \'Prisa. (Esta criatura puede atacar el turno en que entre bajo tu control.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"Un destello del relámpago, un rompimiento de la ola, él pasa de la vida a descansar en la tumba." William Knox, "Mortalidad"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=100043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c1579ef-17ec-4ac4-b0a1-c56c922f1304\', \'multiverseId\': 100043}, \'multiverseid\': 100043}, {\'name\': "Élémental d\'éclair", \'text\': \'Célérité (Cette créature peut attaquer dès le tour où elle arrive sous votre contrôle.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': "« Je vais, d\'un coup de poing, te briser comme verre (…)Ou te jeter si haut au-dessus des éclairs, Que tu sois dévoré des feux élémentaires. » — Corneille, L\'Illusion comique", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98243&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50982222-d3e1-4c06-8a68-108e16505fd0\', \'multiverseId\': 98243}, \'multiverseid\': 98243}, {\'name\': \'Elementale dei Fulmini\', \'text\': \'Rapidità (Questa creatura può attaccare nel turno in cui entra sotto il tuo controllo.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'"Il bagliore di un lampo, l\\\'infrangersi delle onde, Ed egli passa dalla vita al proprio riposo nella bara." —William Knox, "Mortalità"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98963&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dc9b3a2-da2a-4a3d-8383-336fcafb5bef\', \'multiverseId\': 98963}, \'multiverseid\': 98963}, {\'name\': \'稲妻の精霊\', \'text\': \'速攻 （このクリーチャーは、あなたのコントロール下になったターンに攻撃に参加してもよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'稲妻のきらめき、波のひと砕き、 彼は生から墓所の休息へと移っていった。 ――ウィリアム・ノックス「死すべきもの」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bbd042c-657a-4f6c-b4cb-b5cca5a621a0\', \'multiverseId\': 99323}, \'multiverseid\': 99323}, {\'name\': \'Elemental do Relâmpago\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto (Esta criatura pode atacar no turno em que entra em jogo sob seu controle.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"Um clarão de relâmpago, o quebrar de uma onda, Da vida ele passa, ao repouso na cova funda." — William Knox, "Mortalidade"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b713eb31-8bf6-4704-896b-ee7eee21f4bb\', \'multiverseId\': 99683}, \'multiverseid\': 99683}, {\'name\': \'Элементаль молний\', \'text\': \'Ускорение (Это существо может нападать во время того хода, когда оно попало под ваш контроль).\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': \'"Блеск молнии, бушующий прибой И он навеки обретет покой". — Уильям Нокс, "Смертный"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109954&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cff61f4c-0b77-4248-9e16-f18446a30048\', \'multiverseId\': 109954}, \'multiverseid\': 109954}, {\'name\': \'闪电元素\', \'text\': \'敏捷（你操控此生物的该回合中，它便可以攻击）\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': \'「闪耀的光芒，波动的裂隙， 他穿过生命直达墓场而安息。」 ～威廉‧诺克斯，「凡命」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a44151fa-aac1-4fdb-a192-083954b9060b\', \'multiverseId\': 97883}, \'multiverseid\': 97883}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutmond\', \'text\': \'Alle Nichtstandardländer sind Gebirge.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Schweres Licht überflutete die Landschaft und hüllte alles in tiefe Rottöne.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98467&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c08dc61-c72d-4b67-bf3e-4b3f3a54e7f2\', \'multiverseId\': 98467}, \'multiverseid\': 98467}, {\'name\': \'Luna de sangre\', \'text\': \'Las tierras no básicas son montañas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Una luz muy brillante inundó el paisaje, envolviendo todo en un carmesí intenso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56c8d27d-f3b5-43e0-a295-6b10033a9f9d\', \'multiverseId\': 99907}, \'multiverseid\': 99907}, {\'name\': \'Lune de sang\', \'text\': \'Tous les terrains non-base sont des montagnes.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "La lune étrange perçait les ténèbres, empourprant le paysage comme s\'il baignait dans le sang.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98107&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62c52feb-6f83-42af-a959-83f9554fb77b\', \'multiverseId\': 98107}, \'multiverseid\': 98107}, {\'name\': \'Luna Insanguinata\', \'text\': \'Le terre non base sono Montagne.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Una luce greve scese su tutto il paesaggio, ammantando ogni cosa di un rosso profondo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fcd1113-6578-4b0e-8f9d-8bff31c4a61f\', \'multiverseId\': 98827}, \'multiverseid\': 98827}, {\'name\': \'血染めの月\', \'text\': \'基本でない土地は山である。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'陰鬱な光が見渡すかぎりにあふれ、すべてを深紅に染め上げた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'161343ea-d878-4696-aca7-679780623020\', \'multiverseId\': 99187}, \'multiverseid\': 99187}, {\'name\': \'Lua Sangrenta\', \'text\': \'Os terrenos não-básicos são Montanhas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Uma luz intensa inundou a paisagem, cobrindo tudo de um escarlate profundo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a24682cb-d851-41e6-bc6b-b19b9bb86d24\', \'multiverseId\': 99547}, \'multiverseid\': 99547}, {\'name\': \'Кровавая луна\', \'text\': \'Небазовые земли Горы.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Мрачный свет озарял местность, окрашивая все в темный красный цвет.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da8ee7db-82a9-42a6-868c-5e467e9e551b\', \'multiverseId\': 109818}, \'multiverseid\': 109818}, {\'name\': \'腥红之月\', \'text\': \'所有非基本地都是山脉。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'阴沉光芒遍洒大地，一片深红笼罩着万物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97747&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'314c70f9-b8ce-4bd3-8785-f47bbab0dd25\', \'multiverseId\': 97747}, \'multiverseid\': 97747}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blütenzauberin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Verzauberungsspruch spielst, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'Betäubt, für einen Augenblick. Verführt, für eine Lebenszeit. Verzaubert, für die Ewigkeit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98769&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58241185-4e36-44bf-b682-a1466af52e13\', \'multiverseId\': 98769}, \'multiverseid\': 98769}, {\'name\': \'Encantadora de plantas\', \'text\': \'Siempre que juegues un hechizo de encantamiento, puedes robar una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Grácil? Sí. ¿Hermosa? Por supuesto. ¿Inofensiva? Definitivamente, no." —Anciano de Fyndhorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=100209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b75f0b94-cd2a-4822-95f0-6e20b6f7abdf\', \'multiverseId\': 100209}, \'multiverseid\': 100209}, {\'name\': \'Enchanteresse verduralde\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous jouez un sort d\'enchantement, vous pouvez piocher une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et druide\', \'flavor\': \'« Gracieuse ? Oui. Belle ? Tout à fait. Inoffensive ? Ne le croyez surtout pas. » —Un Ancêtre cordellien\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98409&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f327a072-0d7e-4f74-a0d8-ba0e87915a61\', \'multiverseId\': 98409}, \'multiverseid\': 98409}, {\'name\': \'Incantatrice Verde dei Boschi\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta giochi una magia incantesimo, puoi pescare una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Graziosa? Sì. Bella? Assolutamente. Innocua? Decisamente no." —Antico di Fyndhorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6813a661-719f-455a-9021-2b0a02e2387d\', \'multiverseId\': 99129}, \'multiverseid\': 99129}, {\'name\': \'新緑の女魔術師\', \'text\': \'あなたがエンチャント呪文をプレイするたび、あなたはカードを１枚引いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'優雅かと？ 確かに。 美しいかと？ まったくもって。 無害かと？ 全然そんなことはないな。 ――フィンドホーンの古老\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51fd36b4-bc89-4354-9a6f-e4488d9f8d57\', \'multiverseId\': 99489}, \'multiverseid\': 99489}, {\'name\': \'Bruxa de Verduran\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você jogar uma mágica de encantamento, você pode comprar um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida Humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Graciosa? Sim. Bela? Certamente. Inofensiva? Não mesmo." — Ancião de Fyndhorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0d6d58a-9deb-43de-817f-11e8295b1ffb\', \'multiverseId\': 99849}, \'multiverseid\': 99849}, {\'name\': \'Вердуранская чародейка\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание волшебства, вы можете взять карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Друид\', \'flavor\': \'"Изящная? Да. Прекрасная? Невероятно. Безвредная? Вот тут вы неправы". — Финдхорн старший\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=110120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5477f4d-2bef-4d42-a2bd-16b9facfc11e\', \'multiverseId\': 110120}, \'multiverseid\': 110120}, {\'name\': \'纽杜云咒术师\', \'text\': \'每当你使用结界咒语时，你可以抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「无比高雅， 绝对美丽， 毫不柔弱。」 ～范得贺恩长者\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8863c48-2a7c-4122-ad2b-5847b5c58437\', \'multiverseId\': 98049}, \'multiverseid\': 98049}]', '[{\'name\': \'Botschaft\', \'text\': \'Ziehe vier Karten.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Auch wenn der Brief viele Seiten lang war, wusste ich alles, was ich wissen musste, nach einem Blick auf das Gesicht des Überbringers." —Barrin, Meisterzauberer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98750&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03ce800d-6396-475b-9ab8-b027b81fb128\', \'multiverseId\': 98750}, \'multiverseid\': 98750}, {\'name\': \'Informes\', \'text\': \'Roba cuatro cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Aunque la carta tenía varias páginas, puedo afirmar que todo lo que necesitaba saber lo supe con mirar la cara del mensajero." —Barrin, mago experto\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=100190&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2783193e-f231-43b1-aa13-2e1bace7c30f\', \'multiverseId\': 100190}, \'multiverseid\': 100190}, {\'name\': \'Nouvelles\', \'text\': \'Piochez quatre cartes.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Les bonnes nouvelles sont toujours retardées, et les mauvaises ont des ailes. » —Voltaire\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98390&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a88a18e2-4241-422a-8d0a-ca7802d36886\', \'multiverseId\': 98390}, \'multiverseid\': 98390}, {\'name\': \'Novelle\', \'text\': \'Pesca quattro carte.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Nonostante la lettera contenesse diverse pagine, mi bastò uno sguardo al volto del messaggero per capire tutto." —Barrin, mago insegnante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cab08cc6-a86b-483b-a3b4-261bb79e5a86\', \'multiverseId\': 99110}, \'multiverseid\': 99110}, {\'name\': \'連絡\', \'text\': \'カードを４枚引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'手紙は何枚にも渡っていたけど、知りたかったことはすべて使者の顔を一目見ればわかったよ。 ――練達の魔術師バリン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab2e4c5a-073e-40d2-b2e0-298073e066a4\', \'multiverseId\': 99470}, \'multiverseid\': 99470}, {\'name\': \'Novidades\', \'text\': \'Compre quatro cards.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Embora a carta se estendesse por muitas e muitas páginas, fiquei sabendo de tudo o que precisava com apenas um olhar para o rosto do mensageiro." — Barrin, mago mestre\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99830&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'949e6cea-6842-4270-97ee-2cf5423222e9\', \'multiverseId\': 99830}, \'multiverseid\': 99830}, {\'name\': \'Вести\', \'text\': \'Возьмите четыре карты.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'"Хотя посланник принес письмо, написанное на нескольких листах, все, что мне надо было, я мог узнать, лишь взглянув на его лицо". — Баррин, главный мудрец\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=110101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ceb16e5-a4ea-4d30-8f11-1bf492234b53\', \'multiverseId\': 110101}, \'multiverseid\': 110101}, {\'name\': \'音信\', \'text\': \'抓四张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「虽然信件长达数页，我只要瞧瞧信差的表情便能晓得重点。」 ～法术大师巴林\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'098fa63b-4620-46ab-b73a-b297be8ad7c9\', \'multiverseId\': 98030}, \'multiverseid\': 98030}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bumerang\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Kehre zurück, woher du kamest..." —Edmund Spenser, Die Feenkönigin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98473&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be6de944-c644-4b13-848f-4207b4765b82\', \'multiverseId\': 98473}, \'multiverseid\': 98473}, {\'name\': \'Búmerang\', \'text\': \'Regresa el permanente objetivo a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Regresa por donde viniste . . ." —Edmund Spenser, La reina hada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e16c559-064c-4f73-87db-02555ac1c51f\', \'multiverseId\': 99913}, \'multiverseid\': 99913}, {\'name\': \'Boomerang\', \'text\': \'Renvoyez le permanent ciblé dans la main de son propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« La ruse la mieux ourdie peut nuire à son inventeur ; et souvent la perfidie retourne sur son auteur. » —Jean de La Fontaine\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98113&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4a01257-63ab-4ea4-83c9-4ea4117f5636\', \'multiverseId\': 98113}, \'multiverseid\': 98113}, {\'name\': \'Boomerang\', \'text\': \'Il proprietario riprende in mano un permanente bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Torna da dove sei venuto. . . ." —Edmund Spenser, La Regina delle Fate\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fad4d7a2-6ef9-4d54-ba90-005c5c287777\', \'multiverseId\': 98833}, \'multiverseid\': 98833}, {\'name\': \'ブーメラン\', \'text\': \'パーマネント１つを対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'汝の来たれるところへ帰れ … … 。 ――エドムンド・スペンサー「妖精の女王」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c77f08bd-971c-45c7-aaf6-a6f87a1b7bea\', \'multiverseId\': 99193}, \'multiverseid\': 99193}, {\'name\': \'Bumerangue\', \'text\': \'Devolve a permanente alvo para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Volta para o lugar donde vieste. . . ." — Edmund Spenser, A Rainha das Fadas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21bbb60b-9050-4556-8f1d-b6995fdfa682\', \'multiverseId\': 99553}, \'multiverseid\': 99553}, {\'name\': \'Бумеранг\', \'text\': \'Верните целевой перманент в руку владельца.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'"Вернись туда, откуда ты пришел . . ." — Эдмунд Спенсер, Королева духов\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b7902bf-30f9-4247-8390-c93d51c53543\', \'multiverseId\': 109824}, \'multiverseid\': 109824}, {\'name\': \'回力镖\', \'text\': \'将目标永久物移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「回归汝等之所从. . . .」 ～史宾塞，《仙后》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c76b761-99f0-4fec-b4b9-0e2538dedea4\', \'multiverseId\': 97753}, \'multiverseid\': 97753}]', '[{\'name\': \'Champion der Elfen\', \'text\': \'Andere Elfen erhalten +1/+1 und Waldtarnung. (Sie sind unblockbar, solange der verteidigende Spieler einen Wald kontrolliert.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Herrscher\', \'flavor\': \'„Denn was sind Blätter anderes als Klingen, Um einen zahllosen Feind zu bekämpfen?" —Wolkenwaldhymne\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98513&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65e00e36-7f7c-4384-8f8e-079bf9682066\', \'multiverseId\': 98513}, \'multiverseid\': 98513}, {\'name\': \'Campeona élfica\', \'text\': \'Los otros Elfos obtienen +1/+1 y tienen la habilidad de cruzar bosques. (Son imbloqueables mientras el jugador defensor controle un bosque.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Señor elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Qué son las hojas sino incontables espadas para pelear contra enemigos incontables en las alturas." —Himno élfico\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99953&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'296e2b9f-f36c-4f6c-ad14-ba7eea636f6a\', \'multiverseId\': 99953}, \'multiverseid\': 99953}, {\'name\': \'Championne elfe\', \'text\': \'Les autres elfes gagnent +1/+1 et ont la traversée des forêts. (Ils sont imblocables tant que le joueur défenseur contrôle au moins une forêt.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et seigneur\', \'flavor\': \'« Car les feuilles ne sont que lames innombrables pour combattre de haut un ennemi implacable. » —Hymne elfe\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98153&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47ff94f3-d15b-4dd9-997f-3a8ef74841b3\', \'multiverseId\': 98153}, \'multiverseid\': 98153}, {\'name\': \'Campione Elfico\', \'text\': \'Gli altri Elfi prendono +1/+1 e hanno passa-foreste. (Non possono essere bloccati fintanto che il giocatore in difesa controlla almeno una Foresta.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Lord Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"E cosa sono le foglie, se non lame innumerevoli Per combattere nemici innumerevoli in cielo." —Inno elfico\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d5afe2d-0786-4674-a2ce-34e492d19076\', \'multiverseId\': 98873}, \'multiverseid\': 98873}, {\'name\': \'エルフのチャンピオン\', \'text\': \'他のエルフは+1/+1の修整を受けるとともに森渡りを持つ。 （それらは防御プレイヤーが森をコントロールしている限りブロックされない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ロード\', \'flavor\': \'葉こそ無数の刃なり。 無数の敵と戦うためのものなり。 ――エルフの賛歌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7e4f305-bd21-40a6-8ee7-21a2db49eb9e\', \'multiverseId\': 99233}, \'multiverseid\': 99233}, {\'name\': \'Campeão Élfico\', \'text\': \'Os outros Elfos recebem +1/+1 e têm travessia de floresta. (Eles não podem ser bloqueados desde que o jogador defensor controle uma Floresta.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Senhor Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"O que são as folhas, senão incontáveis lâminas Para combater incontáveis inimigos no alto." — Hino dos elfos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b82a634-0c64-4b75-9352-49eb531dea36\', \'multiverseId\': 99593}, \'multiverseid\': 99593}, {\'name\': \'Эльфийский чемпион\', \'text\': \'Все остальные Эльфы получают +1/+1 и знание лесов. (Их невозможно блокировать, пока обороняющийся игрок контролирует Лес).\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Предводитель\', \'flavor\': \'"Да славятся клинки, что покорят Бесчисленное вражеское войско". — Гимн эльфов\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'607b00dd-0ff2-412e-be0a-572d1f625471\', \'multiverseId\': 109864}, \'multiverseid\': 109864}, {\'name\': \'地精斗士\', \'text\': \'所有地精得+1/+1，并具有树林行者异能。 （只要防御牌手操控树林，它们便不能被阻挡）\', \'type\': \'生物～地精／领主\', \'flavor\': \'「利刃成林 以御蔽空之敌」 ～地精赞歌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34f0c98b-4456-4909-a75c-f0eaf2f3f961\', \'multiverseId\': 97793}, \'multiverseid\': 97793}]', '[{\'name\': \'Das Auge des Kraken\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spieler einen blauen Zauberspruch spielt, kannst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu erhalten.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Hell wie ein Spiegel, dunkel wie die See.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98598&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ac1bfd5-7623-40ae-af77-71b750e2a007\', \'multiverseId\': 98598}, \'multiverseid\': 98598}, {\'name\': \'Ojo de kraken\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un jugador juegue un hechizo azul, puedes ganar una vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Brillante como un espejo, oscuro como el mar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=100038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32073d71-2605-4bc5-a7ce-5873c261c0db\', \'multiverseId\': 100038}, \'multiverseid\': 100038}, {\'name\': \'Œil du kraken\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un joueur joue un sort bleu, vous pouvez gagner 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "L\'éclat du diamant, la noirceur des profondeurs.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98238&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57047fe0-306d-4703-9c7b-1154eb592289\', \'multiverseId\': 98238}, \'multiverseid\': 98238}, {\'name\': \'Occhio del Kraken\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un giocatore gioca una magia blu, puoi guadagnare 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Radioso come uno specchio, scuro come il mare.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98958&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f529d940-fecb-448b-b4b6-c54860659e4e\', \'multiverseId\': 98958}, \'multiverseid\': 98958}, {\'name\': \'クラーケンの目\', \'text\': \'いずれかのプレイヤーが青の呪文をプレイするたび、あなたは１点のライフを得てもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'鏡の如く明るく、海の如く暗い。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80678e68-ad83-471c-85e7-0de9532ffe65\', \'multiverseId\': 99318}, \'multiverseid\': 99318}, {\'name\': \'Olho de Kraken\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um jogador jogar uma mágica azul, você pode ganhar 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Brilhante como um espelho, escuro como o mar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22172c79-26f5-4c0f-a335-4e454fca20e3\', \'multiverseId\': 99678}, \'multiverseid\': 99678}, {\'name\': \'Глаз кракена\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда разыгрывается синее заклинание, вы получаете 1 пункт жизни.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Блестящий, как зеркало, темный, как морская пучина.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a0dbdb3-b5f3-4ba1-8d94-6a39a7b8b263\', \'multiverseId\': 109949}, \'multiverseid\': 109949}, {\'name\': \'巨怪硕眼\', \'text\': \'每当牌手使用任何蓝色咒语时，你可以获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'亮似明镜，黯如深洋。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d853d55-7be8-4db7-a78a-08a69a308929\', \'multiverseId\': 97878}, \'multiverseid\': 97878}]', '[{\'name\': \'Demolieren\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder ein Land deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Was meinem Schlag nicht widersteht, Das war wohl schlechte Qualität." —Schmiedelied der Zwerge\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98501&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f64c523-a49f-4298-ab18-ef4ae2c4c49b\', \'multiverseId\': 98501}, \'multiverseid\': 98501}, {\'name\': \'Demoler\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto o tierra objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Golpea el acero hasta que quede. ¿No da resultado? Hazlo pedazos." —Canción de forja enana\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99941&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08e901f7-c2bf-47d6-816d-1b3cebedd8c2\', \'multiverseId\': 99941}, \'multiverseid\': 99941}, {\'name\': \'Démolition\', \'text\': "Détruisez l\'artefact ciblé ou le terrain ciblé.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Frappe l\'acier, c\'est ton boulot A marche pas ? Casse en morceaux » —Chant des forgerons nains", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98141&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5629ea4a-5e7d-4045-b7c1-e10dcc55fcba\', \'multiverseId\': 98141}, \'multiverseid\': 98141}, {\'name\': \'Frantumare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un artefatto o una terra bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Colpisci l\\\'acciaio fino a quando si piega. Non funziona? Fallo a pezzetti." —Canzone di forgia nanesca\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07b8f90a-bb70-47a7-b47e-92c0d0ebfdae\', \'multiverseId\': 98861}, \'multiverseid\': 98861}, {\'name\': \'破砕\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つか土地１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'鋼ぶっ叩きゃ型あわせ。 うまくいかなきゃぶち壊せ。 ― ドワーフの鍛冶屋の歌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c9a197f-8fda-4b59-986b-d10e0f20c0ec\', \'multiverseId\': 99221}, \'multiverseid\': 99221}, {\'name\': \'Demolir\', \'text\': \'Destrói o artefato ou o terreno alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Para o aço amoldar malhamos, malhamos. Se não funcionar? Estraçalhamos." — Canção dos anões na forjaria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09df5200-93be-426a-940d-fdcef5c79cd9\', \'multiverseId\': 99581}, \'multiverseid\': 99581}, {\'name\': \'Разрушение\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевой артефакт или землю.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'"Молотом по стали бах Меч не вышел? Разбей в сердцах". — Песня гномов-кузнецов\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92a8d5e6-dcf7-43c3-86bb-4615d41343e7\', \'multiverseId\': 109852}, \'multiverseid\': 109852}, {\'name\': \'毁坏\', \'text\': \'消灭目标神器或地。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「千锤百炼磨成钢， 不成材？ 全毁葬。」 ～矮人冶铁歌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97781&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5560e2dc-1a00-41f0-b516-1b1031f7cb3b\', \'multiverseId\': 97781}, \'multiverseid\': 97781}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Herr der Untoten\', \'text\': \'Andere Zombies erhalten +1/+1.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Bringe eine Zombiekarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Herrscher\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich verhandle mit dem Tod selber. Was könntest du schon machen, um mir etwas anzuhaben?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98608&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'207dacb0-d6d4-47bb-9194-b4e44a7b7c47\', \'multiverseId\': 98608}, \'multiverseid\': 98608}, {\'name\': \'Señor de los muertos vivientes\', \'text\': \'Los otros Zombies obtienen +1/+1.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Regresa la carta objetivo de Zombie de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Señor Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Yo hablo con la misma Muerte. ¿Qué podrías hacer para lastimarme?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=100048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1b8ee8b-a9ca-48c2-b5d6-ca8d7186df9d\', \'multiverseId\': 100048}, \'multiverseid\': 100048}, {\'name\': \'Seigneur des mort-vivants\', \'text\': \'Les autres zombies gagnent +1/+1.\\n{1}{B}, {T} : Renvoyez la carte de zombie ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et seigneur\', \'flavor\': \'« La Mort est ma complice. Que pourrais-tu faire qui puisse me blesser ? »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98248&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'369602ff-3853-492f-85c7-00382fa88c16\', \'multiverseId\': 98248}, \'multiverseid\': 98248}, {\'name\': \'Signore dei Non Morti\', \'text\': \'Tutti gli altri Zombie prendono +1/+1.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Riprendi in mano una carta Zombie bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Lord Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Io conferisco con la Morte stessa. Come speri di riuscire a farmi del male?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98968&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c8bb3f7-ac03-4100-928f-7c94b1502ea4\', \'multiverseId\': 98968}, \'multiverseid\': 98968}, {\'name\': \'アンデッドの王\', \'text\': \'他のゾンビは+1/+1の修整を受ける。\\n{1}{B}, {T}：あなたの墓地にあるゾンビ・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・ロード\', \'flavor\': \'私は死神と対等に付き合ってるんだ。 お前は私を傷つけるために何ができるというのかね。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31fc61bf-9536-477e-b6ff-91c9c81d0322\', \'multiverseId\': 99328}, \'multiverseid\': 99328}, {\'name\': \'Senhor dos Mortos-vivos\', \'text\': \'Os outros Zumbis recebem +1/+1.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Devolve o card alvo de Zumbi de seu cemitério para a sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Senhor Zumbi\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu falo com a própria Morte. O que poderão vocês fazer para me ferir?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b75a0c43-df87-4ab3-8fd9-bf2bcba5f255\', \'multiverseId\': 99688}, \'multiverseid\': 99688}, {\'name\': \'Повелитель нежити\', \'text\': \'Остальные зомби получают +1/+1.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Верните целевую карту Зомби с кладбища в руку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби Предводитель\', \'flavor\': \'"Я советуюсь с самой смертью. Так чем же вы можете меня уязвить?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109959&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1996374d-d1d1-4af6-8f14-ad127cbfcf54\', \'multiverseId\': 109959}, \'multiverseid\': 109959}, {\'name\': \'不死生物大帝\', \'text\': \'其它灵俑得+1/+1。\\n{1}{B}，{T}：将目标灵俑牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～灵俑／领主\', \'flavor\': \'「我与死亡打交道。 你可有本事伤得了我？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad18eb1e-4cc5-48d1-88e6-b66ef1b450f9\', \'multiverseId\': 97888}, \'multiverseid\': 97888}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Schmelzofen von Rath\', \'text\': \'Falls eine Quelle einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler Schadenspunkte zufügen würde, fügt sie dieser Kreatur oder diesem Spieler stattdessen doppelt so viele Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Der Schmelzofen erwartet seinen neuen Meister, der die Feuer der Apokalypse anheizen wird.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98545&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74506585-9564-4f0d-a399-bec25392d925\', \'multiverseId\': 98545}, \'multiverseid\': 98545}, {\'name\': \'Horno de Rath\', \'text\': \'Si una fuente fuera a hacer daño a una criatura o jugador, en vez de eso, hace el doble del daño a esa criatura o jugador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'El horno espera al siguiente amo que avivará las llamas del apocalipsis.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19ab667a-38e8-4d1f-9b4a-ac98fd601d9b\', \'multiverseId\': 99985}, \'multiverseid\': 99985}, {\'name\': \'Fourneau de Rajh\', \'text\': \'Si une source devait infliger des blessures à une créature ou un joueur, elle inflige à la place le double de ces blessures à cette créature ou à ce joueur.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Le fourneau attend son maître, qui osera nourrir les feux de l\'apocalypse.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98185&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9cee38c-3b79-48fd-9b91-387f9e7685a8\', \'multiverseId\': 98185}, \'multiverseid\': 98185}, {\'name\': \'Fornace di Rath\', \'text\': \'Se una fonte sta per infliggere danno a una creatura o a un giocatore, invece infligge il doppio di quel danno a quella creatura o a quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': "La fornace attende il prossimo padrone che attizzerà i fuochi dell\'apocalisse.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ea1d107-44e1-4eec-aa99-21fef102b591\', \'multiverseId\': 98905}, \'multiverseid\': 98905}, {\'name\': \'ラースの灼熱洞\', \'text\': \'いずれかの発生源がクリーチャーかプレイヤーにダメージを与える場合、代わりにそれはそのクリーチャーかプレイヤーにその点数の２倍のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'灼熱洞は、終末の炎を操る次の主人を待ち続けている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef6091f3-c93b-420b-bbb9-5ac39f6e98b7\', \'multiverseId\': 99265}, \'multiverseid\': 99265}, {\'name\': \'Fornalha de Rath\', \'text\': \'Se uma fonte fosse causar dano a uma criatura ou a um jogador, em vez disso, ela causa o dobro daquela quantidade de dano àquela criatura ou àquele jogador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'A fornalha aguarda o próximo mestre, que vai atiçar as fogueiras do apocalipse.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa123fa4-c552-498f-a878-e5971a82a159\', \'multiverseId\': 99625}, \'multiverseid\': 99625}, {\'name\': \'Горнило Рата\', \'text\': \'Если источник наносит повреждения существу или игроку, повреждения, которые он наносит этому существу или игроку, удваиваются.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Горнило ждет мастера, который разожжет пламя апокалипсиса.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f10f0843-94bd-40c8-9563-fbb6407012ad\', \'multiverseId\': 109896}, \'multiverseid\': 109896}, {\'name\': \'瑞斯大熔炉\', \'text\': \'若某来源将对任一生物或牌手造成伤害，则改为它对该生物或牌手造成两倍的伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'大熔炉等待着下一位能扬起末日战火的主子。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57552b29-cc32-4e54-8551-bfb1b26e4182\', \'multiverseId\': 97825}, \'multiverseid\': 97825}]', "[{'name': 'Diebische Elster', 'text': 'Fliegend (Diese Kreatur kann nur von fliegenden Kreaturen geblockt werden.)\\nImmer wenn die Diebische Elster einem Gegner Schaden zufügt, ziehst du eine Karte.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Vogel', 'flavor': 'Andere Vögel sammeln Zweige für ihr Nest. Die Elstern bevorzugen dagegen Juwelen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98744&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b96afbb6-2a0a-43c9-9a30-4f82d89ca581', 'multiverseId': 98744}, 'multiverseid': 98744}, {'name': 'Urraca ladrona', 'text': 'Vuela. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar.)\\nSiempre que la Urraca ladrona haga daño a un oponente, robas una carta.', 'type': 'Criatura — Ave', 'flavor': 'Otras aves recolectan ramas para sus nidos. Las urracas roban joyas para los suyos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=100184&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5dcbfc09-709c-43b0-b6de-ae0b0147a866', 'multiverseId': 100184}, 'multiverseid': 100184}, {'name': 'Pie voleuse', 'text': 'Vol (Cette créature ne peut être bloquée que par des créatures avec le vol.)\\nÀ chaque fois que la Pie voleuse inflige des blessures à un adversaire, vous piochez une carte.', 'type': 'Créature : oiseau', 'flavor': 'Les autres oiseaux cherchent des brindilles pour leurs nids. La pie préfère les joyaux.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98384&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '69aa2a1d-abfd-4384-ab8d-d3bc290a095f', 'multiverseId': 98384}, 'multiverseid': 98384}, {'name': 'Gazza Ladra', 'text': 'Volare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature con volare.)\\nOgniqualvolta la Gazza Ladra infligge danno a un avversario, tu peschi una carta.', 'type': 'Creatura — Uccello', 'flavor': 'Gli altri uccelli raccolgono ramoscelli per costruire i loro nidi. Le gazze rubano gioielli per adornare i propri.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99104&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a773cbd5-e2cc-4a9c-a5b9-9202c98e0dd0', 'multiverseId': 99104}, 'multiverseid': 99104}, {'name': '泥棒カササギ', 'text': '飛行 （このクリーチャーは飛行を持たないクリーチャーによってブロックされない。）\\n泥棒カササギが対戦相手１人にダメージを与えるたび、あなたはカードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 鳥', 'flavor': '他の鳥は巣を作るために小枝を集める。 カササギは巣を作るために宝石を盗むんだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99464&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '26c6fb99-54c7-4fe5-a817-0144db0a514d', 'multiverseId': 99464}, 'multiverseid': 99464}, {'name': 'Gralha Larápia', 'text': 'Voar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com a habilidade de voar.)\\nToda vez que Gralha Larápia causar dano a um oponente, você compra um card.', 'type': 'Criatura — Pássaro', 'flavor': 'Os outros pássaros coletam gravetos para seus ninhos. As gralhas roubam jóias para os delas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99824&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '94a5284f-bcea-446f-87ae-1af258868c77', 'multiverseId': 99824}, 'multiverseid': 99824}, {'name': 'Сорока-воровка', 'text': 'Полет (Это существо может быть блокировано только существом со способностью полета).\\nКаждый раз, когда Сорока-воровка наносит оппоненту повреждения, вы берете карту.', 'type': 'Существо — Птица', 'flavor': 'Обычные птицы несут в гнездо веточки. Сороки же в гнездо несут драгоценности.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=110095&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '42a6f94c-7323-49c6-8c4d-55820796daf3', 'multiverseId': 110095}, 'multiverseid': 110095}, {'name': '窃鹊', 'text': '飞行（只有具飞行异能的生物才能阻挡它。）\\n每当窃鹊向对手造成伤害时，你抓一张牌。', 'type': '生物～鸟', 'flavor': '一般鸟儿收集细枝筑巢， 鹊则是偷窃宝石来筑巢。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98024&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b9213ea0-5142-4a1a-8b7e-0bc7b4383193', 'multiverseId': 98024}, 'multiverseid': 98024}]", "[{'name': 'Donnermahr', 'text': 'Eile (Diese Kreatur kann in dem Zug, in dem sie unter deine Kontrolle kommt, angreifen.)\\nWenn der Donnermahr ins Spiel kommt, tappe alle anderen Kreaturen.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Donnermahr', 'flavor': 'Seine Hufe schlage Blitze, und der Donner folgt kurz darauf.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98748&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c1950eee-b46f-4b7a-951d-0b2744b8ead5', 'multiverseId': 98748}, 'multiverseid': 98748}, {'name': 'Yegua del trueno', 'text': 'Prisa. (Esta criatura puede atacar el turno en que entre bajo tu control.)\\nCuando la Yegua del trueno entre en juego, gira todas las otras criaturas.', 'type': 'Criatura — Yegua del trueno', 'flavor': 'De sus cascos brota el relámpago, y el trueno aparece poco después.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=100188&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '40d733bf-9dfc-4177-83ea-8debcc496f0d', 'multiverseId': 100188}, 'multiverseid': 100188}, {'name': 'Cheval de foudre', 'text': 'Célérité (Cette créature peut attaquer dès le tour où elle arrive sous votre contrôle.)\\nQuand le Cheval de foudre arrive en jeu, engagez toutes les autres créatures.', 'type': 'Créature : cheval de foudre', 'flavor': 'Les éclairs jaillissent de ses sabots, et le tonnerre suit toujours.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98388&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '14748203-336a-4f7b-abd8-80f58df6cd25', 'multiverseId': 98388}, 'multiverseid': 98388}, {'name': 'Cavallo del Tuono', 'text': 'Rapidità (Questa creatura può attaccare nel turno in cui entra sotto il tuo controllo.)\\nQuando il Cavallo del Tuono entra in gioco, TAPpa tutte le altre creature.', 'type': 'Creatura — Cavallo del Tuono', 'flavor': 'I suoi zoccoli emettono lampi seguiti immediatamente da tuoni.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99108&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '54c4b0fd-7f3c-420a-8a84-b3eae19013ee', 'multiverseId': 99108}, 'multiverseid': 99108}, {'name': 'サンダーメア', 'text': '速攻 （このクリーチャーは、あなたのコントロール下になったターンに攻撃に参加してもよい。）\\nサンダーメアが場に出たとき、他のすべてのクリーチャーをタップする。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — サンダーメア', 'flavor': '蹄から稲妻がほとばしり、雷鳴がすぐあとを追う。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99468&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a6130f13-ec51-4d1d-b547-ee4cdc5d8a82', 'multiverseId': 99468}, 'multiverseid': 99468}, {'name': 'Pesadelo Trovejante', 'text': 'Ímpeto (Esta criatura pode atacar no turno em que entra em jogo sob seu controle.)\\nQuando Pesadelo Trovejante entra em jogo, vira todas as outras criaturas.', 'type': 'Criatura — Pesadelo Trovejante', 'flavor': 'Seus cascos disparam relâmpagos e em seguida vem a trovoada.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99828&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '22016566-ff31-4f92-a2ce-9259c39a1e9c', 'multiverseId': 99828}, 'multiverseid': 99828}, {'name': 'Грозовой конь', 'text': 'Ускорение (Это существо может нападать во время того хода, когда оно попало под ваш контроль).\\nКогда Грозовой конь вступает в игру, поверните все остальные существа.', 'type': 'Существо — Грозовой конь', 'flavor': 'Из-под ее копыт летят молнии, а за ними раскаты грома.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=110099&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f37d0fd4-38fd-4cad-bafa-d4be65393895', 'multiverseId': 110099}, 'multiverseid': 110099}, {'name': '雷魇', 'text': '敏捷（你操控此生物的该回合中，它便可以攻击）\\n当雷魇进场时，横置所有其它生物。', 'type': '生物～雷魇', 'flavor': '他的蹄如闪电般落下，雷声紧随而来。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98028&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '936472f3-49e6-4f8e-ac47-40ec4b8985da', 'multiverseId': 98028}, 'multiverseid': 98028}]", '[{\'name\': \'Drachenklaue\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spieler einen roten Zauberspruch spielt, kannst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazuerhalten.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Obwohl sie nicht mehr am Finger befestigt ist, hält sie weiter ihren Gegner fest im Griff.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98506&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'305394c3-4455-4b22-8b7b-3d0afa58f434\', \'multiverseId\': 98506}, \'multiverseid\': 98506}, {\'name\': \'Garra de dragón\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un jugador juegue un hechizo rojo, puedes ganar una vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Aunque ya no está anexada a la mano, todavía tiene agarrado a su adversario.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14136e80-0258-4752-8498-25d59b93622d\', \'multiverseId\': 99946}, \'multiverseid\': 99946}, {\'name\': \'Griffe du dragon\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un joueur joue un sort rouge, vous pouvez gagner 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Bien que détachée de la patte, elle enserre toujours sa proie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98146&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'608557bd-f6d2-47a4-8039-524fec1fc235\', \'multiverseId\': 98146}, \'multiverseid\': 98146}, {\'name\': \'Artiglio di Drago\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un giocatore gioca una magia rossa, puoi guadagnare 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Anche se non è più attaccato alla mano, serra ancora l\'avversario nella propria morsa.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78284b01-65cd-4562-88fe-03f7fe6e6b4f\', \'multiverseId\': 98866}, \'multiverseid\': 98866}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴンの爪\', \'text\': \'いずれかのプレイヤーが赤の呪文をプレイするたび、あなたは１点のライフを得てもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'すでに手から離されたにもかかわらず、それは今でも敵を掴んでいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e3698f4-491b-4940-a288-865d2b0257d4\', \'multiverseId\': 99226}, \'multiverseid\': 99226}, {\'name\': \'Garra de Dragão\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um jogador jogar uma mágica vermelha, você pode ganhar 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Embora não esteja mais ligada à mão, ainda mantém seu adversário em suas garras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12cc55a4-d063-40d2-839e-ce7b44bcfe01\', \'multiverseId\': 99586}, \'multiverseid\': 99586}, {\'name\': \'Коготь дракона\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда разыгрывается красное заклинание, вы получаете 1 пункт жизни.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Но и выдранный из лапы хозяина, он держит неприятеля мертвой хваткой.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b4dcc2b-5766-45e1-9501-69f4175b8fe4\', \'multiverseId\': 109857}, \'multiverseid\': 109857}, {\'name\': \'巨龙钩爪\', \'text\': \'每当牌手使用任何红色咒语时，你可以获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'虽已不在龙掌之上，却似乎依然紧扣着敌手不放。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19e8abec-1066-4a6d-9c89-5fb34eed3746\', \'multiverseId\': 97786}, \'multiverseid\': 97786}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drohender Schatten\', \'text\': \'{B}: Der Drohende Schatten erhält +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schatten\', \'flavor\': \'Er wächst in der Dunkelheit und vermehrt sich in Albträumen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98607&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43e8b3b8-2e3e-45b4-8c77-13143ccebef1\', \'multiverseId\': 98607}, \'multiverseid\': 98607}, {\'name\': \'Sombra vaga\', \'text\': \'{B}: La Sombra vaga obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sombra\', \'flavor\': \'Se alimenta de oscuridad, se reproduce en las pesadillas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=100047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a1dcff1-101f-47c9-bfb3-93a358e43f56\', \'multiverseId\': 100047}, \'multiverseid\': 100047}, {\'name\': \'Ombre surgissante\', \'text\': "{B} : L\'Ombre surgissante gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : ombre\', \'flavor\': \'Elle naît des cauchemars et se nourrit des peurs.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98247&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ccc0a01-07dd-41e1-b8bb-6dc3e87625bc\', \'multiverseId\': 98247}, \'multiverseid\': 98247}, {\'name\': \'Bruma in Agguato\', \'text\': \'{B}: La Bruma in Agguato prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bruma\', \'flavor\': "Si nutre d\'oscurità, prolifica negli incubi.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'506e5ce7-de71-4351-af23-6ff864278288\', \'multiverseId\': 98967}, \'multiverseid\': 98967}, {\'name\': \'立ちはだかる影\', \'text\': \'{B}：立ちはだかる影はターン終了時まで+1/+1の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — シェイド\', \'flavor\': \'闇を食し、悪夢の中で増長する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af3b6340-f2b0-44ee-bc2b-e5d1ec2540da\', \'multiverseId\': 99327}, \'multiverseid\': 99327}, {\'name\': \'Vulto Indistinto\', \'text\': \'{B}: Vulto Indistinto recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vulto\', \'flavor\': \'Das trevas se alimenta, dos pesadelos procria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95f6da3e-0b57-4c43-9f5b-ef473b98ed27\', \'multiverseId\': 99687}, \'multiverseid\': 99687}, {\'name\': \'Смутная тень\', \'text\': \'{B}: Смутная тень получает +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Тень\', \'flavor\': \'Темнотой питается, от кошмаров разрастается.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109958&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d81047f5-9b97-48b3-8632-9ca0e5d2e148\', \'multiverseId\': 109958}, \'multiverseid\': 109958}, {\'name\': \'昏暗阴魂\', \'text\': \'{B}：昏暗阴魂得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～阴魂\', \'flavor\': \'在黑暗中进食，于梦魇里繁衍。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1144e8e9-b9eb-47b5-a894-a595f37a084b\', \'multiverseId\': 97887}, \'multiverseid\': 97887}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dunkle Verbannung\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine nichtschwarze Kreatur deiner Wahl. Sie kann nicht regeneriert werden.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ha, Verbannung? Sei mitleidiger, sage \\\'Tod\\\', denn Verbannung hat weit mehr Schreckliches in ihren Blicken als der Tod selbst." —William Shakespeare, Romeo und Julia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98496&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83eb22cc-b673-4655-9ef9-47f75ab67249\', \'multiverseId\': 98496}, \'multiverseid\': 98496}, {\'name\': \'Destierro sombrío\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo que no sea negra. No puede ser regenerada.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Ah ¿El destierro? Ten piedad, di la muerte. La proscripción es de faz más terrible, mucho más terrible que la muerte." —William Shakespeare, Romeo y Julieta\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'371b42b2-b01b-493c-b2cc-04b192d5a3c4\', \'multiverseId\': 99936}, \'multiverseid\': 99936}, {\'name\': \'Obscur bannissement\', \'text\': \'Détruisez la créature non-noire ciblée. Elle ne peut pas être régénérée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Et leur bannissement, dont j\'accepte la loi, Dépend bien plus de vous, qu\'il ne dépend de moi. » — Molière, Dom Garcie", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98136&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1346830-c5f4-4cd8-b817-6fc367fbd012\', \'multiverseId\': 98136}, \'multiverseid\': 98136}, {\'name\': \'Esilio Oscuro\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio non nera. Non può essere rigenerata.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'esilio? Abbi pietà, di\\\' pure "morte", Poiché l\\\'esilio ha un aspetto molto più terrificante, Della morte stessa."—William Shakespeare, Romeo e Giulietta\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f666f9b1-4fcc-460c-bb31-eb6eca0e9e57\', \'multiverseId\': 98856}, \'multiverseid\': 98856}, {\'name\': \'闇への追放\', \'text\': \'黒でないクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。 それは再生できない。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'追放だと？ 慈悲だ、死罪と言ってくれ、 追放の先に見えるは恐怖、 それは死よりもなお恐ろしい。 ウィリアム・シェークスピア「ロミオとジュリエット」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48ab5833-b18b-4425-b091-b002c751d41e\', \'multiverseId\': 99216}, \'multiverseid\': 99216}, {\'name\': \'Banimento Sombrio\', \'text\': \'Destrói a criatura alvo que não seja preta. Ela não pode ser regenerada.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Exílio exílio Sê clemente, dizendo logo \\\'morte\\\', Pois mais horror contém no olhar o exílio que a própria morte." — William Shakespeare, Romeu e Julieta\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3cf02c0-b3b1-4888-b5d4-81d09bd643c0\', \'multiverseId\': 99576}, \'multiverseid\': 99576}, {\'name\': \'Темное изгнание\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое нечерное существо. Оно не может быть регенерировано.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'"О, лучше сжалься и скажи, что к смерти Мне близость ссылки тяжелей, чем смерть. Не говори ни слова об изгнаньи". — Уильям Шекспир, Ромео и Джульета\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109847&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ff8ea15-67b5-4287-90d4-33e4c936fee9\', \'multiverseId\': 109847}, \'multiverseid\': 109847}, {\'name\': \'黯境放逐\', \'text\': \'消灭目标非黑色的生物。 它不能重生。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「嘿，放逐？ 慈悲一点，判我死吧， 流放带着恐怖的面貌， 比死亡更教我畏惧。」 ～威廉‧莎士比亚，《罗蜜欧与茱丽叶》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3da4ba3-b883-4a8c-b899-1521c8cb2b4b\', \'multiverseId\': 97776}, \'multiverseid\': 97776}]', '[{\'name\': \'Durchkämmen\', \'text\': \'Ziehe drei Karten und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Weile am längsten bei den Gedanken, die am hellsten leuchten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98713&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69b5f399-97a8-4b66-9a5c-ad965dd98cb3\', \'multiverseId\': 98713}, \'multiverseid\': 98713}, {\'name\': \'Inspeccionar\', \'text\': \'Roba tres cartas, luego descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Medita más en los pensamientos que brillan más.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=100153&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91a1c658-951b-46e4-8a35-8f4b5a429a6f\', \'multiverseId\': 100153}, \'multiverseid\': 100153}, {\'name\': \'Tamis\', \'text\': "Piochez trois cartes, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Attarde-toi sur les pensées qui sont les plus brillantes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98353&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6940e92-7031-497e-93eb-bd90149b6ff3\', \'multiverseId\': 98353}, \'multiverseid\': 98353}, {\'name\': \'Setacciare\', \'text\': \'Pesca tre carte, poi scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Indugia più a lungo sui pensieri che brillano maggiormente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31d57e45-2318-4f55-9f8d-1c2def5babe0\', \'multiverseId\': 99073}, \'multiverseid\': 99073}, {\'name\': \'ふるい分け\', \'text\': \'カードを３枚引き、その後カードを１枚捨てる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'もっとも長く頭に残っていた考えがもっとも輝く。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4113687e-8aea-47b8-b8a5-de4c469a10f1\', \'multiverseId\': 99433}, \'multiverseid\': 99433}, {\'name\': \'Peneirar\', \'text\': \'Compre três cards e depois descarte um card.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Demore-se mais nos pensamentos que brilham mais.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d83b947-5f3c-42e9-a20a-fa315e4f860a\', \'multiverseId\': 99793}, \'multiverseid\': 99793}, {\'name\': \'Исследование\', \'text\': \'Возьмите три карты, затем сбросьте карту.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Подольше задерживайтесь над самыми яркими мыслями.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=110064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86df01bd-43f9-41c5-9302-a5cdd901208f\', \'multiverseId\': 110064}, \'multiverseid\': 110064}, {\'name\': \'详查\', \'text\': \'抓三张牌，然后弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'愈有吸引力的念头愈需三思。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'040e73d1-5352-4b5a-9051-7ce44a5be30c\', \'multiverseId\': 97993}, \'multiverseid\': 97993}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämonenhorn\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spieler einen schwarzen Zauberspruch spielt, kannst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazuerhalten.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Seine Biegungen verspotten die Kurven von Leben und Tod.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98502&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac281eb3-ab20-4592-878d-142f5122e89a\', \'multiverseId\': 98502}, \'multiverseid\': 98502}, {\'name\': \'Cuerno de demonio\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un jugador juegue un hechizo negro, puedes ganar una vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Su curvatura simboliza las vueltas de la vida y la muerte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37cdc47b-8cac-4b4c-93fc-42b2723122e6\', \'multiverseId\': 99942}, \'multiverseid\': 99942}, {\'name\': \'Corne de démon\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un joueur joue un sort noir, vous pouvez gagner 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Ses courbes imitent les méandres de la vie et de la mort.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98142&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0344714-b741-4a76-aff9-af5f384983f7\', \'multiverseId\': 98142}, \'multiverseid\': 98142}, {\'name\': \'Corno del Demone\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un giocatore gioca una magia nera, puoi guadagnare 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'La sua foggia imita gli intrecci di vita e morte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fbbacba-4cbe-4b93-909a-1282c77cbe1f\', \'multiverseId\': 98862}, \'multiverseid\': 98862}, {\'name\': \'悪魔の角\', \'text\': \'いずれかのプレイヤーが黒の呪文をプレイするたび、あなたは１点のライフを得てもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'その曲がり様は、生と死の絡み合いを模している。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9786a957-e154-47d4-b6e6-2438f356f13e\', \'multiverseId\': 99222}, \'multiverseid\': 99222}, {\'name\': \'Chifre de Demônio\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um jogador jogar uma mágica preta, você pode ganhar 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Sua curvatura imita as viravoltas da vida e da morte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=99582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af88dead-7c63-4be1-a668-730ac3365503\', \'multiverseId\': 99582}, \'multiverseid\': 99582}, {\'name\': \'Рог демона\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда разыгрывается черное заклинание, вы получаете 1 пункт жизни.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'В его изгибах сплетаются жизнь и смерть.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=109853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c866f041-3d6e-44df-95ce-83801b5894d1\', \'multiverseId\': 109853}, \'multiverseid\': 109853}, {\'name\': \'恶魔犄角\', \'text\': \'每当牌手使用任何黑色咒语时，你可以获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'其弯弧好似生与死的纠结。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=97782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9b7f103-86a2-471b-9882-a534131b45f7\', \'multiverseId\': 97782}, \'multiverseid\': 97782}]', "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=98659&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8498af50-0099-4e32-95e6-e2c7a8a907f0', 'multiverseId': 98659}, 'multiverseid': 98659}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=100099&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '53627cff-402f-444d-9ba6-e2eae45cf2b4', 'multiverseId': 100099}, 'multiverseid': 100099}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de