, 'PULG', 'PW23', 'PW24', 'PWOS', 'PZ1', 'PZ2', 'RAV', 'REN', 'REX', 'RIN', 'RIX', 'RNA', 'ROE', 'RQS', 'RTR', 'RVR', 'S00', 'S99', 'SCD', 'SCG', 'SHM', 'SIR', 'SLC', 'SLD', 'SNC', 'SOI', 'SOM', 'SS2', 'STA', 'STH', 'STX', 'SUM', 'TD0', 'TD2', 'THB', 'THS', 'TMP', 'TOR', 'TPR', 'TSP', 'UDS', 'UGL', 'ULG', 'UMA', 'UND', 'UNF', 'UNH', 'USG', 'UST', 'V09', 'V10', 'V14', 'V15', 'VIS', 'VOW', 'W16', 'W17', 'WAR', 'WC00', 'WC01', 'WC02', 'WC03', 'WC04', 'WC97', 'WC98', 'WC99', 'WHO', 'WOC', 'WOE', 'WOT', 'WTH', 'WWK', 'XANA', 'XLN', 'ZEN', 'ZNR']
original_text: ['Add {R}{R}{R}{R}{R} to your mana pool.', 'All creatures able to block Elvish Bard do so.', 'All creatures get +X/-X until end of turn.', 'As Booby Trap comes into play, name a card other than a basic land card and choose an opponent.\\nThe chosen player reveals each card he or she draws.\\nWhen the chosen player draws the named card, sacrifice Booby Trap. If you do, Booby Trap deals 10 damage to that player.', 'As Clone comes into play, you may choose a creature in play. If you do, Clone comes into play as a copy of that creature.', 'As Story Circle comes into play, choose a color.\\n{W}: The next time a source of your choice of the chosen color would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage.', 'As long as Storage Matrix is untapped, each player chooses artifact, creature, or land during his or her untap step. That player can untap only permanents of the chosen type this step.', 'As long as Thran Golem is enchanted, it gets +2/+2 and has flying, first strike, and trample.', "At the beginning of each player's draw step, if Howling Mine is untapped, that player draws a card.", "At the beginning of each player's draw step, that player puts the cards in his or her hand on the bottom of his or her library in any order, then draws that many cards.", "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, put a 1/1 green Saproling creature token into play under your control.", "At the beginning of your upkeep, Form of the Dragon deals 5 damage to target creature or player.\\nAt the end of each turn, your life total becomes 5.\\nCreatures without flying can't attack you.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if you have 200 or more cards in your library, you win the game.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, if you have a card in hand, return Imaginary Pet to its owner's hand.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you draw a card and you lose 1 life.', 'B', "Beast of Burden's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creatures in play.", 'Blaze deals X damage to target creature or player.', 'Change the text of target permanent by replacing all instances of one color word with another or one basic land type with another. (For example, you may change "nonblack creature" to "nongreen creature" or "forestwalk" to "plainswalk." This effect doesn\'t end at end of turn.)', 'Choose a color. Target player reveals his or her hand and discards all cards of that color.', 'Counter target creature spell.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.', 'Counter target spell, then untap up to four lands.', "Creatures and lands target opponent controls don't untap during his or her next untap step.", "Creatures with power 3 or greater don't untap during their controllers' untap steps.", 'Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control get +1/+1.', "Creatures you control have flying. (They can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)", "Creatures you control have vigilance. (Attacking doesn't cause them to tap.)", 'Destroy all Islands.', 'Destroy all Plains.', "Destroy all creatures you don't control. They can't be regenerated.", "Destroy all creatures. They can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy all enchantments.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'Destroy target artifact or land.', 'Destroy target artifact, enchantment, or land.', 'Destroy target artifact.', 'Destroy target attacking creature. You gain life equal to its power.', "Destroy target creature. It can't be regenerated. Its controller reveals cards from the top of his or her library until he or she reveals a creature card. The player puts that card into play and shuffles all other cards revealed this way into his or her library.", 'Destroy target enchantment.', "Destroy target green creature. It can't be regenerated.\\nDraw a card.", 'Destroy target land.', "Destroy target nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy target tapped creature.', "Destroy target white creature. It can't be regenerated.\\nDraw a card.", 'Draw four cards.', 'Draw three cards, then discard a card.', 'Draw two cards.', "Dream Prowler is unblockable as long as it's attacking alone.", "During each player's turn, each other player's spells cost {3} more to play.", 'Each creature gets +1/+1 for each other creature in play that shares a creature type with it. (For example, if a Goblin Warrior, a Goblin Scout, and a Zombie Goblin are in play, each gets +2/+2.)', 'Each player may search his or her library for up to X creature cards, reveal those cards, and put them into his or her hand. Then each player who searched his or her library this way shuffles it.', 'Each player sacrifices four lands. Wildfire deals 4 damage to each creature.', "Each player's life total becomes the number of creatures he or she controls.", "Enchant creature (Target a creature as you play this. This card comes into play attached to that creature.)\\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block.", "Enchant creature (Target a creature as you play this. This card comes into play attached to that creature.)\\nEnchanted creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.", 'Enchant creature (Target a creature as you play this. This card comes into play attached to that creature.)\\nEnchanted creature gets +0/+2 and can block as though it had flying.', "Enchant creature (Target a creature as you play this. This card comes into play attached to that creature.)\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 and can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.", 'Enchant creature (Target a creature as you play this. This card comes into play attached to that creature.)\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 for each Forest you control.', 'Enchant creature (Target a creature as you play this. This card comes into play attached to that creature.)\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+2.', 'Enchant creature (Target a creature as you play this. This card comes into play attached to that creature.)\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+1.', 'Enchant creature (Target a creature as you play this. This card comes into play attached to that creature.)\\nEnchanted creature gets -2/-2.', "Enchant creature (Target a creature as you play this. This card comes into play attached to that creature.)\\nEnchanted creature has fear. (It can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)", 'Enchant creature (Target a creature as you play this. This card comes into play attached to that creature.)\\nEnchanted creature has first strike. (It deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)', "Enchant creature (Target a creature as you play this. This card comes into play attached to that creature.)\\nEnchanted creature has flying. (It can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)", 'Enchant creature (Target a creature as you play this. This card comes into play attached to that creature.)\\nEnchanted creature has islandwalk. (This creature is unblockable as long as defending player controls an Island.)', 'Enchant creature (Target a creature as you play this. This card comes into play attached to that creature.)\\nWhenever enchanted creature attacks or blocks, its controller loses 3 life.', 'Enchant creature (Target a creature as you play this. This card comes into play attached to that creature.)\\nWhenever enchanted creature deals damage, you gain that much life.', "Enchant creature (Target a creature as you play this. This card comes into play attached to that creature.)\\n{G}: Regenerate enchanted creature. (The next time that creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)", 'Enchant creature (Target a creature as you play this. This card comes into play attached to that creature.)\\n{R}: Enchanted creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Enchant land (Target a land as you play this. This card comes into play attached to that land.)\\nEnchanted land is an Island.', 'Enchant land (Target a land as you play this. This card comes into play attached to that land.)\\nWhenever enchanted land is tapped for mana, its controller adds {G}{G} to his or her mana pool.', 'Enchant land (Target a land as you play this. This card comes into play attached to that land.)\\nYou control enchanted land.', 'Enchant permanent (Target a permanent as you play this. This card comes into play attached to that permanent.)\\nYou control enchanted permanent.', 'Equipped creature gets +2/+2.\\nEquip {2} ({2}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', 'Equipped creature gets +3/+0, has trample, and has "Whenever this creature deals damage, you gain that much life."\\nEquip {3} ({3}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', "Fear (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)", "First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)\\nProtection from black, protection from red (This creature can't be blocked, targeted, dealt damage, or enchanted by anything black or red.)", "First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)\\nWhen Nekrataal comes into play, destroy target nonartifact, nonblack creature. That creature can't be regenerated.", 'First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)\\n{R}: Sandstone Warrior gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flame Wave deals 4 damage to target player and each creature he or she controls.', "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\nFirst strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\nFirst strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may sacrifice an artifact. If you don't, tap Yawgmoth Demon and it deals 2 damage to you.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\nNightmare's power and toughness are each equal to the number of Swamps you control.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\nSacrifice Shard Phoenix: Shard Phoenix deals 2 damage to each creature without flying.\\n{R}{R}{R}: Return Shard Phoenix from your graveyard to your hand. Play this ability only during your upkeep.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\nVigilance (Attacking doesn't cause this creature to tap.)", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\nWhen Angel of Mercy comes into play, you gain 3 life.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\nWhen Aven Cloudchaser comes into play, destroy target enchantment.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\nWhen Aven Fisher is put into a graveyard from play, you may draw a card.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\nWhen Foul Imp comes into play, you lose 2 life.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\nWhen Rathi Dragon comes into play, sacrifice it unless you sacrifice two Mountains.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\nWhen Sage Aven comes into play, look at the top four cards of your library, then put them back in any order.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\nWhenever Blinding Angel deals combat damage to a player, that player skips his or her next combat phase.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\nWhenever Hypnotic Specter deals damage to an opponent, that player discards a card at random.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\nWhenever Thieving Magpie deals damage to an opponent, you draw a card.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\nWhenever a creature dealt damage by Sengir Vampire this turn is put into a graveyard, put a +1/+1 counter on Sengir Vampire.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\n{1}{U}: Return Fleeting Image to its owner's hand.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\n{1}{U}: Target player reveals the top card of his or her library.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\n{B}: Regenerate Will-o'-the-Wisp. (The next time this creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\n{R}: Shivan Dragon gets +1/+0 until end of turn.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\n{W}: Aven Flock gets +0/+1 until end of turn.", 'Forestwalk (This creature is unblockable as long as defending player controls a Forest.)', 'G', 'Giant Spider can block as though it had flying.', 'Goblin Brigand attacks each turn if able.', "Goblin Raider can't block.", 'Guerrilla Tactics deals 2 damage to target creature or player.\\nWhen a spell or ability an opponent controls causes you to discard Guerrilla Tactics, Guerrilla Tactics deals 4 damage to target creature or player.', 'Haste (This creature may attack the turn it comes under your control.)', "Haste (This creature may attack the turn it comes under your control.)\\nAt end of turn, return Viashino Sandstalker to its owner's hand. (Return it only if it's in play.)", "Haste (This creature may attack the turn it comes under your control.)\\nMagnivore's power and toughness are each equal to the number of sorcery cards in all graveyards.", 'Haste (This creature may attack the turn it comes under your control.)\\nWhen Thundermare comes into play, tap all other creatures.', 'If a source would deal damage to a creature or player, it deals double that damage to that creature or player instead.', 'If an opponent has more lands than you, search your library for up to three Plains cards, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then shuffle your library.', 'If you control a creature, damage that would reduce your life total to less than 1 reduces it to 1 instead.', 'Islandwalk (This creature is unblockable as long as defending player controls an Island.)', 'Kird Ape gets +1/+2 as long as you control a Forest.', 'Lava Axe deals 5 damage to target player.', 'Look at the top five cards of your library, then put them back in any order.', 'Look at the top two cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the other on the bottom of your library.', "Maro's power and toughness are each equal to the number of cards in your hand.", "Mortivore's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creature cards in all graveyards.\\n{B}: Regenerate Mortivore. (The next time this creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)", 'Mountainwalk (This creature is unblockable as long as defending player controls a Mountain.)', 'Needle Storm deals 4 damage to each creature with flying.', 'Nonbasic lands are Mountains.', "Ogre Taskmaster can't block.", "Other Elves get +1/+1 and have forestwalk. (They're unblockable as long as defending player controls a Forest.)", "Other Goblins get +1/+1 and have mountainwalk. (They're unblockable as long as defending player controls a Mountain.)", 'Other Zombies get +1/+1.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Return target Zombie card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Other creatures you control get +0/+1.', 'Phantom Warrior is unblockable.', "Players play with their hands revealed.\\nIf a player would draw a card, he or she reveals it instead. Then any other player may pay 2 life. If a player does, put that card into its owner's graveyard. Otherwise, that player draws the card.", 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.', 'Prevent the next 4 damage that would be dealt to target creature or player this turn.', 'Put target card from your graveyard on top of your library.', "Put target creature on top of its owner's library.", 'Pyroclasm deals 2 damage to each creature.', 'R', "Return all creatures to their owners' hands.", 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to play.', 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', "Return target permanent to its owner's hand.", 'Sacrifice Bottle Gnomes: You gain 3 life.', 'Sacrifice Sanctum Guardian: The next time a source of your choice would deal damage to target creature or player this turn, prevent that damage.', "Sacrifice a Swamp: Regenerate target black creature. (The next time that creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)", "Sacrifice a creature: Draw cards equal to the sacrificed creature's power, then discard three cards.", 'Sacrifice a creature: Nantuko Husk gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', "Sea Monster can't attack unless defending player controls an Island.", 'Search your library for a basic land card and put that card into play tapped. Then shuffle your library.', 'Search your library for a card and put that card into your hand. Then shuffle your library.', 'Shock deals 2 damage to target creature or player.', 'Silklash Spider can block as though it had flying.\\n{X}{G}{G}: Silklash Spider deals X damage to each creature with flying.', 'Spend only black mana on X.\\nConsume Spirit deals X damage to target creature or player. You gain X life.', "Spineless Thug can't block.", "Sudden Impact deals damage equal to the number of cards in target player's hand to that player.", 'Swampwalk (This creature is unblockable as long as defending player controls a Swamp.)', "Swarm of Rats's power is equal to the number of Rats you control.", 'Tap an untapped creature you control: Llanowar Behemoth gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Target blocking creature gets +7/+7 until end of turn.', "Target creature gets +3/+3 and gains flying until end of turn. (It can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)", 'Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +7/+7 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +X/+0 until end of turn.', 'Target opponent reveals his or her hand. Choose a card from it. That player discards that card.', 'Target opponent reveals his or her hand. You draw a card for each Forest and green card in it.', 'Target opponent reveals his or her hand. You draw a card for each Mountain and red card in it.', 'Target opponent sacrifices a creature.', 'Target player discards two cards.', 'Target player gains 8 life.', 'Target player gains X life.', 'Target player loses 4 life and you gain 4 life.', 'Target player loses life equal to the damage already dealt to him or her this turn.', 'Target player puts the top half of his or her library, rounded down, into his or her graveyard.', 'Target player reveals three cards from his or her hand and you choose one of them. That player discards that card.', 'Target player shuffles his or her graveyard into his or her library.', 'Target player untaps all basic lands he or she controls.', 'The next time a source of your choice would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage. You gain that much life.', 'Tidal Kraken is unblockable.', 'Trample (If this creature would deal enough combat damage to its blockers to destroy them, you may have it deal the rest of its damage to defending player.)', 'Trample (If this creature would deal enough combat damage to its blockers to destroy them, you may have it deal the rest of its damage to defending player.)\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, Force of Nature deals 8 damage to you unless you pay {G}{G}{G}{G}.', 'Tree Monkey can block as though it had flying.', 'U', 'Untap all creatures that attacked this turn. After this main phase, there is an additional combat phase followed by an additional main phase.', "Untap all permanents you control during each other player's untap step.", 'Untap target creature and gain control of it until end of turn. That creature gains haste until end of turn. (It may attack this turn.)', 'Untap target creature. It gets +2/+4 until end of turn.', 'Until end of turn, all lands become 2/2 creatures that are still lands.', 'Until end of turn, if target player would draw a card, instead that player skips that draw and you draw a card.', "Up to three target creatures can't block this turn.", "Vigilance (Attacking doesn't cause this creature to tap.)", 'Volcanic Hammer deals 3 damage to target creature or player.', 'W', 'When Anarchist comes into play, you may return target sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Festering Goblin is put into a graveyard from play, target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', 'When Gravedigger comes into play, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Highway Robber comes into play, you gain 2 life and target opponent loses 2 life.', 'When Hunted Wumpus comes into play, each other player may put a creature card from his or her hand into play.', 'When Kavu Climber comes into play, draw a card.', 'When Mindslicer is put into a graveyard from play, each player discards his or her hand.', 'When Phyrexian Gargantua comes into play, you draw two cards and you lose 2 life.', 'When Ravenous Rats comes into play, target opponent discards a card.', 'When Rukh Egg is put into a graveyard from play, put a 4/4 red Bird creature token with flying into play at end of turn.', 'When Serpent Warrior comes into play, you lose 3 life.', 'When Venerable Monk comes into play, you gain 2 life.', 'When Viridian Shaman comes into play, destroy target artifact.', "When Wanderguard Sentry comes into play, look at target opponent's hand.", 'When Wood Elves comes into play, search your library for a Forest card and put that card into play. Then shuffle your library.', 'When you control no other creatures, sacrifice Emperor Crocodile.', 'Whenever Deathgazer blocks or becomes blocked by a nonblack creature, destroy that creature at end of combat.', 'Whenever Elvish Berserker becomes blocked, it gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each creature blocking it.', 'Whenever Hollow Dogs attacks, it gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Rogue Kavu attacks alone, it gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Seasoned Marshal attacks, you may tap target creature.', "Whenever a creature becomes the target of a spell or ability, return that creature to its owner's hand. (It won't be affected by the spell or ability.)", "Whenever a creature is dealt damage, destroy it. It can't be regenerated.", 'Whenever a creature you control is put into a graveyard from play, each other player sacrifices a creature.', 'Whenever a player plays a black spell, you may gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player plays a blue spell, you may gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player plays a green spell, you may gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player plays a red spell, you may gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player plays a white spell, you may gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a spell or ability an opponent controls causes a land to be put into your graveyard from play, return that land to play.', 'Whenever an opponent discards a card, Megrim deals 2 damage to that player.', 'Whenever an opponent draws a card, Underworld Dreams deals 1 damage to him or her.', 'Whenever an opponent plays a spell, Mogg Sentry gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Whenever another creature comes into play, you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever you play an enchantment spell, you may draw a card.', 'Yavimaya Enchantress gets +1/+1 for each enchantment in play.', "You and target opponent each flip a coin. Mana Clash deals 1 damage to each player whose coin comes up tails. Repeat this process until both players' coins come up heads on the same flip.", "You can't be the target of spells or abilities.", 'You gain 4 life.', 'You have no maximum hand size.', 'You may play King Cheetah any time you could play an instant.', 'You may play up to three additional lands this turn.', 'Your opponents play with their hands revealed.', "{0}: Return Blinking Spirit to its owner's hand.", '{1}, {T}: Tap target artifact, creature, or land.', '{1}, {T}: You gain 1 life.', "{1}: Return target land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{1}, Discard a land card: Draw a card.", '{1}: The next time a black source of your choice would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage.', '{1}: The next time a red source of your choice would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage.', '{1}{G}: Return target basic land card from your graveyard to your hand.', '{1}{G}: Rootwalla gets +2/+2 until end of turn. Play this ability only once each turn.', '{1}{W}: The next 1 damage that would be dealt to Zealous Inquisitor this turn is dealt to target creature instead.', "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Jester's Cap: Search target player's library for three cards and remove them from the game. Then that player shuffles his or her library.", '{2}, {T}: Target player puts the top two cards of his or her library into his or her graveyard.', '{2}: Jade Statue becomes a 3/6 artifact creature until end of combat. Play this ability only during combat.', '{2}{U}{U}: Draw a card.', '{3}, {T}: Rod of Ruin deals 1 damage to target creature or player.', '{3}, {T}: Target player discards a card. Play this ability only during your turn.', '{4}, {T}, Discard your hand: Draw a card for each creature you control.', "{8}, {T}: Aladdin's Ring deals 4 damage to target creature or player.", '{B}: Looming Shade gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', "{B}: Regenerate Drudge Skeletons. (The next time this creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)", '{G}, {T}: Put a creature card from your hand into play.', "{G}: Regenerate Ancient Silverback. (The next time this creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)", '{R}, Sacrifice Bloodfire Colossus: Bloodfire Colossus deals 6 damage to each creature and each player.', '{R}, {T}: Anaba Shaman deals 1 damage to target creature or player.', '{R}: Flowstone Crusher gets +1/-1 until end of turn.', '{R}: Flowstone Shambler gets +1/-1 until end of turn.', "{R}: Goblin Balloon Brigade gains flying until end of turn. (It can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)", '{R}: Target creature gains haste until end of turn. (It may attack this turn.)', '{T}, Sacrifice Daring Apprentice: Counter target spell.', '{T}, Sacrifice a creature: Return target creature card from your graveyard to play. Play this ability only during your upkeep.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool.', '{T}: Add to your mana pool one mana of any color that a land an opponent controls could produce.', "{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool. If you control an Urza's Mine and an Urza's Power-Plant, add {3} to your mana pool instead.", "{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool. If you control an Urza's Mine and an Urza's Tower, add {2} to your mana pool instead.", "{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool. If you control an Urza's Power-Plant and an Urza's Tower, add {2} to your mana pool instead.", '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.\\n{T}, Sacrifice Quicksand: Target attacking creature without flying gets -1/-2 until end of turn.', '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.\\n{T}: Add {B} or {G} to your mana pool. Llanowar Wastes deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.\\n{T}: Add {B} or {R} to your mana pool. Sulfurous Springs deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {U} to your mana pool. Yavimaya Coast deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {W} to your mana pool. Brushland deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {G} to your mana pool. Karplusan Forest deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {W} to your mana pool. Battlefield Forge deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {B} to your mana pool. Underground River deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {R} to your mana pool. Shivan Reef deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {B} to your mana pool. Caves of Koilos deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {U} to your mana pool. Adarkar Wastes deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {2} to your mana pool.', '{T}: Add {G} to your mana pool.', "{T}: All damage that would be dealt to target creature this turn by a source of your choice is dealt to Oracle's Attendants instead.", '{T}: Crossbow Infantry deals 1 damage to target attacking or blocking creature.', '{T}: Destroy target tapped creature.', '{T}: Draw a card, then discard a card.', '{T}: Draw a card.', '{T}: Karplusan Yeti deals damage equal to its power to target creature. That creature deals damage equal to its power to Karplusan Yeti.', '{T}: Orcish Artillery deals 2 damage to target creature or player and 3 damage to you.', '{T}: Prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt to target creature or player this turn.', '{T}: Prevent the next 4 damage that would be dealt to target creature or player this turn.', '{T}: Target attacking creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{T}: Target creature with power 2 or less is unblockable this turn.', '{T}: Untap target land.', '{U}, {T}: Tap or untap target creature.', "{U}{U}{U}, {T}: Return target permanent to its owner's hand.", '{W}, Discard a card: You gain 3 life.', '{W}, {T}: Search your library for a land card, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library. Play this ability only if an opponent controls more lands than you.', '{W}, {T}: Tap target creature.', '{W}: Honor Guard gets +0/+1 until end of turn.', '{X}{W}, {T}: Ballista Squad deals X damage to target attacking or blocking creature.']
